{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb","hash":"5c924340c6008af9e3c9d6f5ba6a959426f0c1e89581005af93a528053cac6c2","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01V3dNn5MHSzmQMhL7vsD6Yy","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Karing install-config deep link import subscription iOS region Russia rules first launch\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"apps.apple.com\",\"url\":\"https://apps.apple.com/ms/app/karing/id6472431552\"},{\"title\":\"Deep Linking Configuration for iOS\",\"url\":\"https://docs.emaillabs.io/en/analytics-panel/functionalities/deep-linking/deep-linking-configuration-for-ios\"},{\"title\":\"konfiguracja deep linkow dla ios\",\"url\":\"https://docs.emaillabs.io/panel-analityczny/funkcjonalnosci/deep-linking/konfiguracja-deep-linkow-dla-ios\"},{\"title\":\"Karing 17+\",\"url\":\"https://apps.apple.com/gt/app/karing/id6472431552?l=en-GB\"},{\"title\":\"Version: 2021.3\",\"url\":\"https://docs.unity.cn/cn/current/Manual/deep-linking-ios.html\"},{\"title\":\"# How to set up deep links for iOS\",\"url\":\"https://docs.short.io/articles/integrations-and-extensions/mobile-deep-links/how-to-set-up-deep-links-for-ios.md\"},{\"title\":\"Essential Kit Tutorials\",\"url\":\"https://assetstore.essentialkit.voxelbusters.com/v2/deep-link-services/setup/ios\"}]\n\nThe search didn't find what you asked for. None of the results mention an install-config deep link, a subscription import URL scheme, or how Karing behaves on first launch in Russia.\n\nWhat the results do cover is general Karing information from its App Store listings:\n- Karing is a Clash-compatible proxy utility that supports Clash, V2ray, Stash, Singbox, Shadowsocks, Github, and Sub subscriptions.\n- Full clash config is supported, and partial clash.meta config is supported.\n- It requires iOS 15.0 or later.\n\nThe remaining results were unrelated deep-linking guides for Unity, Short.io, and email tools, which describe generic iOS URL schemes and universal links rather than Karing's import flow.\n\nTo answer your question, I'd check Karing's official site (karing.app) or its documentation or GitHub repository directly for the import URL format and any region-specific first-launch behavior. I can run another search with narrower terms if you want to try again.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."},{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WMiuNfuDT8hHWzeZFsXze6","type":"tool_result","content":"**Open source:** Yes. The page says \"Free & open source,\" linking to the GitHub repository (github.com/YuanDevTeam/OneXray). The footer states \"OneXray is open-source software.\"\n\n**VLESS Reality:** The page doesn't explicitly confirm this. Its docs navigation includes a \"VLESS and REALITY\" page under \"Protocols and transports,\" which suggests support.\n\n**Base64 subscription URLs:** The page doesn't confirm this. It lists \"Subscriptions, HWID, and age\" under Servers and \"Import and sharing formats\" in the docs, but doesn't mention base64.\n\n**URL scheme or deep link (onexray://):** The page doesn't mention one, so I can't quote a scheme. The docs have an \"Import and sharing formats\" section, which may cover it, but its content isn't shown here."}]}}
