 path, full request JSON fields with types and allowed values, e.g. paymentMethod codes for SBP/cards/crypto, amount, currency, description, return/failed URLs, payload), response fields (transaction id, redirect URL, status), endpoint to check status, callback/webhook format (method, headers used for verification, body fields, statuses like CONFIRMED/CANCELED), and any test/sandbox mode notes. List the URLs of sub-pages."}},"serverClassifierRequest":"08f74202-7f47-4352-8d1c-0838e2d532b3","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011Cgb2a96vtbwam3aBhtbgE","requestRef":"9cae6fc8-ee8d-451d-b3ec-1d30e572169d","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"ad9de8ae-6bd7-4fbf-af0f-d35cc1be6bbe","timestamp":"2026-10-31T21:31:06.400Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/Sagenkazaran/Library/Application Support/Claude/scratch-workspaces/f907b165-4712-485f-a44b-7f7d54b74cf9/77d6453f-aaee-4ad3-a7ea-34b17cbaf2e5/scratch-2026-10-26-b13584","sessionId":"1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"deep-singing-taco"}
