 payload\n- Response fields (transaction ID, redirect URL, status)\n- Callback headers for verification, body fields, and statuses such as CONFIRMED or CANCELED\n- Any test or sandbox mode\n\n**Sub-pages**\n\nThe page names two sections but gives no URLs for them: \"Выводы\" (payouts) and \"Callbacks.\" Check the Platega documentation site navigation for their addresses, or ask your Platega manager for the create-transaction and callback specs."}]}}
