moderation; unset to hide.\nlegal.py:22:# Price grid. Amounts are in rubles; keep in sync with the payment provider settings.\nlegal.py:24:    {\"key\": \"trial\", \"title\": \"Пробный период\", \"period\": \"7 дней\", \"price\": 0, \"devices\": 1},\nlegal.py:25:    {\"key\": \"m1\", \"title\": \"1 месяц\", \"period\": \"30 дней\", \"price\": 199, \"devices\": 3},\nlegal.py:26:    {\"key\": \"m3\", \"title\": \"3 месяца\", \"period\": \"90 дней\", \"price\": 499, \"devices\": 3},\nlegal.py:27:    {\"key\": \"m12\", \"title\": \"12 месяцев\", \"period\": \"365 дней\", \"price\": 1490, \"devices\": 3},\nlegal.py:46:def tariffs_text() -> str:\nlegal.py:108:        \"4.1. Стоимость и состав тарифов указаны в разделе «Тарифы» Сервиса до момента оплаты.\\n\"\n     326 database.py\n       0 handlers/__init__.py\n     217 handlers/admin.py\n     165 handlers/devices.py\n      16 handlers/fallback.py\n      43 handlers/legal.py\n     434 handlers/onboarding.py\n      40 handlers/referral.py\n      52 handlers/start.py\n     208 handlers/vpn.py\n     174 legal.py\n    1675 total\nShell cwd was reset to /Users/Sagenkazaran/Library/Application Support/Claude/scratch-workspaces/f907b165-4712-485f-a44b-7f7d54b74cf9/77d6453f-aaee-4ad3-a7ea-34b17cbaf2e5/scratch-2026-10-26-b13584","is_error":false}]}}
