{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb","hash":"b775756784e7ef968eddbf98dd47ac705d6a4988dd8cafc0d48ef49ca87004d2","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Господин Шаген, Karing работает стабильно благодаря своему «движку» внутри, а не экранам. Поэтому можно оставить его движок, а экран сделать свой, очень простой.\n\n**Каким будет приложение Nexo:**\n- один экран с большой кнопкой «Включить / Выключить»;\n- под кнопкой надпись «Подключено» или «Отключено» и выбор страны: Австрия или Бразилия;\n- ключ подставляется сам: человек нажимает ссылку в боте, и всё готово;\n- все сложные настройки Karing скрыты;\n- правила для банков и Госуслуг включены сразу, ничего не нужно настраивать руками.\n\n**Как будем делать:**\n1. **Сначала Android.** Сделаем копию Karing на GitHub в вашем аккаунте Shahen777. Лицензия Karing и так требует открытого кода. Приложение будет собираться прямо на GitHub, потому что на вашем Mac свободно всего 6,6 ГБ, а для сборки нужно около 20 ГБ.\n2. **Результат: файл APK.** Его можно поставить на свой телефон и проверить. Срок — примерно 2–3 недели работы.\n3. **iPhone потом.** Это следующий этап. Он требует аккаунта Apple от компании, и Apple может не пропустить приложение.\n\n**Пока делаем приложение:** в Karing уже есть упрощённый «режим новичка». Позже я могу подсказать клиентам в боте, как его включить. Это бесплатно и прямо сейчас.\n\nСтарый бот, VPN-серверы и текущий бот Nexo это никак не затрагивает: приложение делается отдельно."}]}}
{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb","hash":"2e2cbe8ff0d1b6c40b347f3833b5449709efff7b6f999da492dd74b7dddb2f7f","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<system-reminder>\nAttribution for git commits and pull requests you create from here on (this replaces Claude Code's own earlier attribution guidance, such as a previous copy of this reminder; the user's own instructions about these lines, such as a CLAUDE.md or memory rule, take precedence over this reminder, but do not add attribution lines this reminder leaves out):\n- End git commit messages with:\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n- End pull request descriptions with:\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nThe user can follow this conversation from another device; to put a file in front of them there (a report, a screenshot, a built artifact), send it with SendUserFile.\n</system-reminder>\n"},{"type":"text","text":"Пока нет"}]}}
{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb","hash":"96658ac08bb52618058d5ba51296f5a8cf9349220bd75ad80fc442657c690ce5","message":{"role":"system","content":[{"type":"text","text":"<total_tokens>15000000 tokens left</total_tokens>\n\nCalled the Read tool with the following input: {\"file_path\":\"/private/tmp/claude-501/REDACTED/1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb/tasks/bq2r6npye.output\"}\nResult of calling the Read tool:\n1\t<h1 align=\"center\">\n2\t  <img src=\"./README_assets/img/mascot.jpg\" alt=\"Karing\" width=\"256\" />\n3\t  <br>\n4\t  Karing - Simple & Powerful proxy utility\n5\t  <br>\n6\t</h1>\n7\t<h3 align=\"center\">\n8\tA <a href=\"https://github.com/SagerNet/sing-box\">singbox</a> GUI based on <a href=\"https://github.com/flutter/flutter\">flutter</a>.\n9\t</h3>\n10\tEnglish | [简体中文](./README_cn.md) | [繁體中文](./README_tw.md) | [日本語](./README_ja.md) | [한국어](./README_ko.md) | [Español](./README_es.md) | [Français](./README_fr.md) | [Deutsch](./README_de.md) | [Italiano](./README_it.md) | [Tiếng Việt](./README_vi.md) | [Türkçe](./README_tr.md) | [Русский](./README_ru.md) | [فارسی](./README_fa.md) | [العربية](./README_ar.md) | [Português](./README_pt.md) | [Português (BR)](./README_pt_BR.md) | [Українська](./README_uk.md) | [Polski](./README_pl.md) | [اردو](./README_ur.md) | [Svenska](./README_sv.md) | [Norsk](./README_no.md) | [Nederlands](./README_nl.md) | [हिन्दी](./README_hi.md) | [Ελληνικά](./README_el.md) | [Dansk](./README_da.md) | [বাংলা](./README_bn.md) | [ไทย](./README_th.md) | [ਪੰਜਾਬੀ](./README_pa.md)\n11\t### Note: Karing has not opened any channel related to Karing on any video platform\n12\t## Features\n13\t- Compatible with Clash, V2ray/V2fly, Sing-box, Shadowsocks, Sub, Github Subscriptions.\n14\t  - Full `clash` config supported, Partial `clash.meta` config supported.\n15\t- A set of routing rules applied to multiple subscription sources automatically selects efficient nodes.\n16\t- Supports custom routing rule groups and node groups.\n17\t  - Customizes default routing rule groups for novice users - ready to use right out of the box.\n18\t  - Built-in geo-IP, geo-site, ACL, and [other rulesets](https://github.com/KaringX/karing-ruleset/)\n19\t- Backup and synchronization, synchronizing multiple devices with a single configuration.\n20\t  - Supports iCloud synchronization [IOS/MacOS].\n21\t  - Supports synchronization within the local area network.\n22\t  - Supports WebDAV.\n23\t  - Supports importing/exporting ZIP files.\n24\t- Built-in support for [the modified sing-box core](https://github.com/KaringX/sing-box).\n25\t- Introduces a beginner mode for simpler configuration.\n26\t- Plan to support more platforms.\n27\t## Promotion\n28\t<details>\n29\t<summary>View all promotions\n30\t### 推荐机场\n31\t[狗狗加速 —— 技术流机场 Doggygo VPN](https://2.x31415926.top/redir.html?REDACTED&i=3eb&t=1723644053)\n32\t- 高性能海外机场，海外团队，无跑路风险\n33\t- 专属链接注册送 3 天，每天 1G 流量 [免费试用](https://2.x31415926.top/redir.html?REDACTED&i=3eb&t=1723644053)\n34\t- 优惠套餐每月仅需 15.8 元，160G 流量，年付 8 折\n35\t- 全球首家支持`Hysteria2` 协议，集群负载均衡设计，高速专线，极低延迟，无视晚高峰，4K 秒开\n36\t- 解锁流媒体及 ChatGPT\n37\t[👉更多机场优惠 每日更新](https://2.x31415926.top/)\n38\t</summary>\n39\t### 🤝VPN Providers Collaboration Announcement\n40\t- 👉[Contact information and forms of cooperation](https://karing.app/blog/isp/cooperation#for-vpn-providers-from-other-regions)👈\n41\t</details>\n42\t## System Requirements\n43\t- Windows >= 10 (64-bit only)\n44\t- Android >= 8 (arm64-v8a, armeabi-v7a)\n45\t- Linux (64-bit only, glibc >= 2.38 for current .deb packages)\n46\t- IOS >= 15\n47\t- MacOS >= 12 (Intel, Apple Silicon)\n48\t- TvOS >= 17\n49\t## Install\n50\t- **IOS/TvOS AppStore**: (Search Keywords: karing vpn)\n51\t  - https://apps.apple.com/us/app/karing/id6472431552\n52\t- **IOS/TvOS TestFlight**:\n53\t  - https://testflight.apple.com/join/RLU59OsJ\n54\t- **Android**:\n55\t  - [https://karing.app/download](https://karing.app/download)\n56\t  - https://github.com/KaringX/karing/releases/latest\n57\t  - APKPure https://apkpure.com/p/com.nebula.karing\n58\t  - Amazon AppStore https://www.amazon.com/gp/product/B0DJSQDDM8\n59\t- **Windows/Macos/Linux**:\n60\t  - [https://karing.app/download](https://karing.app/download)\n61\t===\n62\t.github\n63\t.gitignore\n64\t.metadata\n65\tLICENSE.md\n66\tREADME.md\n67\tREADME_ar.md\n68\tREADME_assets\n69\tREADME_bn.md\n70\tREADME_cn.md\n71\tREADME_da.md\n72\tREADME_de.md\n73\tREADME_el.md\n74\tREADME_es.md\n75\tREADME_examples\n76\tREADME_fa.md\n77\tREADME_fr.md\n78\tREADME_hi.md\n79\tREADME_it.md\n80\tREADME_ja.md\n81\tREADME_ko.md\n82\tREADME_nl.md\n83\tREADME_no.md\n84\tREADME_pa.md\n85\tREADME_pl.md\n86\tREADME_pt.md\n87\tREADME_pt_BR.md\n88\tREADME_ru.md\n89\tREADME_sv.md\n90\tREADME_th.md\n91\tREADME_tr.md\n92\tREADME_tw.md\n93\tREADME_uk.md\n94\tREADME_ur.md\n95\tREADME_vi.md\n96\tanalysis_options.yaml\n97\tandroid\n98\tassets\n99\tbind\n100\tbuild.yaml\n101\tdevtools_options.yaml\n102\t===\n103\t179965\tmain\tSimple & Powerful proxy utility, Support routing rules for clash/sing-box\n104\t\n105\t[exited with code 0]\n106\t\n\nNote: /Users/Sagenkazaran/.claude/projects/REDACTED/1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb/tool-results/bp11pi048.txt was read before the last conversation was summarized, but the contents are too large to include. Use Read tool if you need to access it.\n\nCalled the Read tool with the following input: {\"file_path\":\"/private/tmp/claude-501/REDACTED/1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb/tasks/btg9fzoi8.output\"}\nResult of calling the Read tool:\n1\t\"\"\"Client-app catalog for the guided setup: which apps fit each device and how to install them.\n2\t\n3\tPure data, no Telegram code. The first app of every platform is the recommended one.\n4\t`auto_rules` marks apps that load the Russian direct-routing rules from the subscription,\n5\tso banks and marketplaces work without toggling anything. All links are official store/vendor pages.\n6\t\"\"\"\n7\tfrom __future__ import annotations\n8\t\n9\tfrom dataclasses import dataclass\n10\t\n11\tHAPP_IOS = \"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/happ-proxy-utility/id6504287215?l=ru\"\n12\tHAPP_SITE = \"https://www.happ.su/main\"\n13\tHAPP_PLAY = \"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.happproxy\"\n14\tHAPP_APK = \"https://github.com/Happ-proxy/happ-android/releases/latest/download/Happ.apk\"\n15\tHAPP_TV_IOS = \"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/happ-proxy-utility-for-tv/id6748297274\"\n16\tV2RAYTUN_IOS = \"https://apps.apple.com/ru/app/id6798667599\"\n17\tV2RAYTUN_PLAY = \"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.v2raytun.android\"\n18\tV2RAYTUN_SITE = \"https://v2raytun.com/\"\n19\tV2BOX_IOS = \"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/v2box-v2ray-client/id6446814690\"\n20\tSTREISAND_IOS = \"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/streisand/id6450534064\"\n21\tKARING_IOS = \"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/karing/id6472431552\"\n22\tKARING = {\n23\t    \"android\": \"https://dot.karing.app/client.html?tag=android-stable\",\n24\t    \"androidtv\": \"https://dot.karing.app/client.html?tag=android-armv7a-stable\",\n25\t    \"windows\": \"https://dot.karing.app/client.html?tag=windows-installer-stable\",\n26\t    \"macos\": \"https://dot.karing.app/client.html?tag=macos-stable\",\n27\t}\n28\tHIDDIFY_PLAY = \"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=app.hiddify.com\"\n29\tSINGBOX_DOCS = \"https://sing-box.sagernet.org/installation/package-manager/\"\n30\t\n31\t\n32\t@dataclass(frozen=True)\n33\tclass App:\n34\t    key: str\n35\t    name: str\n36\t    importer: str | None        # \"happ\" | \"xray\" (HTTPS landing page) | \"karing\" | None = link/QR only\n37\t    auto_rules: bool\n38\t    install: tuple[tuple[str, str], ...]   # (button label, official URL)\n39\t    note: str = \"\"              # one line shown under the install instructions\n40\t    alt_title: str = \"\"         # label in the «Другое приложение» list\n41\t\n42\t\n43\tdef _app(key, name, importer, auto_rules, install, note=\"\", alt_title=\"\"):\n44\t    return App(key, name, importer, auto_rules, tuple(install), note, alt_title or name)\n45\t\n46\t\n47\tCATALOG: dict[str, list[App]] = {\n48\t    \"ios\": [\n49\t        _app(\"happ\", \"Happ\", \"happ\", True, [(\"⬇️ Установить Happ\", HAPP_IOS)],\n50\t             \"Если App Store пишет «недоступно в вашей стране», нажмите «У меня российский App Store».\",\n51\t             \"⭐ Happ — рекомендуем\"),\n52\t        _app(\"v2raytun\", \"v2RayTun\", \"xray\", True, [(\"⬇️ Установить v2RayTun\", V2RAYTUN_IOS)],\n53\t             \"Есть в российском App Store.\", \"v2RayTun — российский App Store\"),\n54\t        _app(\"v2box\", \"V2Box\", \"xray\", True, [(\"⬇️ Установить V2Box\", V2BOX_IOS)]),\n55\t        _app(\"streisand\", \"Streisand\", \"xray\", True, [(\"⬇️ Установить Streisand\", STREISAND_IOS)]),\n56\t        _app(\"karing\", \"Karing\", \"karing\", False, [(\"⬇️ Установить Karing\", KARING_IOS)],\n57\t             \"В Karing правила для российских сервисов включаются вручную.\", \"Karing\"),\n58\t    ],\n59\t    \"android\": [\n60\t        _app(\"happ\", \"Happ\", \"happ\", True, [(\"⬇️ Установить из Google Play\", HAPP_PLAY), (\"⬇️ Скачать APK\", HAPP_APK)],\n61\t             \"Нет Google Play? Используйте кнопку «Скачать APK».\", \"⭐ Happ — рекомендуем\"),\n62\t        _app(\"v2raytun\", \"v2RayTun\", \"xray\", True, [(\"⬇️ Установить из Google Play\", V2RAYTUN_PLAY)]),\n63\t        _app(\"karing\", \"Karing\", \"karing\", False, [(\"⬇️ Скачать Karing (APK)\", KARING[\"android\"])],\n64\t             \"В Karing правила для российских сервисов включаются вручную.\"),\n65\t        _app(\"hiddify\", \"Hiddify\", None, False, [(\"⬇️ Установить из Google Play\", HIDDIFY_PLAY)],\n66\t             \"Профиль в Hiddify добавляется по ссылке, правила — вручную.\"),\n67\t    ],\n68\t    \"windows\": [\n69\t        _app(\"happ\", \"Happ\", \"happ\", True, [(\"⬇️ Скачать Happ\", HAPP_SITE)],\n70\t             \"Установите как обычную программу.\", \"⭐ Happ — рекомендуем\"),\n71\t        _app(\"v2raytun\", \"v2RayTun\", \"xray\", True, [(\"⬇️ Скачать v2RayTun\", V2RAYTUN_SITE)]),\n72\t        _app(\"karing\", \"Karing\", \"karing\", False, [(\"⬇️ Скачать Karing\", KARING[\"windows\"])],\n73\t             \"В Karing правила для российских сервисов включаются вручную.\"),\n74\t    ],\n75\t    \"macos\": [\n76\t        _app(\"happ\", \"Happ\", \"happ\", True, [(\"⬇️ Скачать Happ\", HAPP_SITE)],\n77\t             \"При первом запуске разрешите создание VPN.\", \"⭐ Happ — рекомендуем\"),\n78\t        _app(\"v2box\", \"V2Box\", \"xray\", True, [(\"⬇️ Установить V2Box\", V2BOX_IOS)]),\n79\t        _app(\"streisand\", \"Streisand\", \"xray\", True, [(\"⬇️ Установить Streisand\", STREISAND_IOS)]),\n80\t        _app(\"karing\", \"Karing\", \"karing\", False, [(\"⬇️ Скачать Karing\", KARING[\"macos\"])],\n81\t             \"В Karing правила для российских сервисов включаются вручную.\"),\n82\t    ],\n83\t    \"appletv\": [\n84\t        _app(\"happ\", \"Happ TV\", None, True, [(\"⬇️ Установить Happ TV\", HAPP_TV_IOS)],\n85\t             \"Установите на Apple TV из App Store.\", \"⭐ Happ TV — рекомендуем\"),\n86\t        _app(\"karing\", \"Karing\", None, False, [(\"⬇️ Установить Karing\", KARING_IOS)]),\n87\t    ],\n88\t    \"androidtv\": [\n89\t        _app(\"happ\", \"Happ\", None, True, [(\"⬇️ Скачать Happ (APK)\", HAPP_APK)],\n90\t             \"Скачайте APK на телевизор или перенесите его с телефона.\", \"⭐ Happ — рекомендуем\"),\n91\t        _app(\"karing\", \"Karing\", None, False, [(\"⬇️ Скачать Karing для TV\", KARING[\"androidtv\"])]),\n92\t    ],\n93\t    \"router\": [\n94\t        _app(\"singbox\", \"sing-box\", None, False, [(\"📖 Инструкция sing-box\", SINGBOX_DOCS)],\n95\t             \"Нужна прошивка с поддержкой sing-box или другого клиента VLESS.\"),\n96\t    ],\n97\t}\n98\t\n99\t# How the user turns the VPN on, per platform (step 4).\n100\tPOWER_ON = {\n101\t    \"ios\": \"Откройте {app} и нажмите большую кнопку подключения. iPhone спросит разрешение добавить VPN — нажмите «Разрешить».\",\n102\t    \"android\": \"Откройте {app} и нажмите кнопку подключения. Android спросит разрешение на VPN — подтвердите.\",\n103\t    \"windows\": \"Откройте {app} и нажмите кнопку подключения. Если Windows спросит разрешение — подтвердите.\",\n104\t    \"macos\": \"Откройте {app} и нажмите кнопку подключения. macOS спросит разрешение добавить VPN — разрешите.\",\n105\t    \"appletv\": \"Откройте {app} на телевизоре, выберите сервер и включите подключение.\",\n106\t    \"androidtv\": \"Откройте {app} на телевизоре, выберите сервер и включите подключение.\",\n107\t    \"router\": \"Включите профиль в клиенте роутера.\",\n108\t}\n109\t\n110\t\n111\tdef apps_for(platform: str) -> list[App]:\n112\t    return CATALOG.get(platform, [])\n113\t\n114\t\n115\tdef get_app(platform: str, key: str | None) -> App | None:\n116\t    apps = apps_for(platform)\n117\t    if not apps:\n118\t        return None\n119\t    return next((a for a in apps if a.key == key), apps[0])\n120\thandlers/vpn.py:91:                            \"Правила для российских сервисов (банки, Госуслуги, Ozon, Wildberries, Авито) подгрузятся из подписки сами. \"\n121\thandlers/onboarding.py:99:@router.callback_query(F.data.in_({\"get_vpn\", \"install_karing\"}))\n122\thandlers/onboarding.py:139:             \"Правила для российских сервисов в нём включаются вручную, поэтому мы рекомендуем Happ.\")\n123\thandlers/onboarding.py:155:        rows.append([cb(\"🇷🇺 У меня российский App Store\", f\"app:v2raytun:{nonce}\")])\n124\thandlers/onboarding.py:333:        if app.importer == \"karing\" and install.startswith(\"https://\"):\n125\thandlers/onboarding.py:410:            f\"<i>В {name} правила для российских сервисов включаются в настройках приложения.</i>\")\n126\thandlers/onboarding.py:458:                         \"«У меня российский App Store» — v2RayTun работает так же.\")\n127\ttests/test_brand_env.py:11:from vpn_service import Node, build_karing_deep_link, build_vless_uri\n128\ttests/test_brand_env.py:14:print(build_karing_deep_link(\"https://example.test/sub/x\"))\n129\ttests/test_keyboards.py:7:    def test_main_menu_contains_karing_subscription_actions(self):\n130\ttests/test_keyboards.py:57:        self.assertEqual(links[\"Добавить в v2RayTun\"], \"https://vpn.example/app/v2raytun/install/tok\")\n131\ttests/test_keyboards.py:60:        page = client_install_page(\"v2raytun\", \"https://vpn.example/happ/sub/tok\")\n132\ttests/test_keyboards.py:61:        self.assertIn('href=\"v2raytun://import/https%3A%2F%2Fvpn.example%2Fhapp%2Fsub%2Ftok\"', page)\n133\ttests/test_happ.py:10:    async def test_happ_has_routing_but_identical_karing_servers(self):\n134\ttests/test_happ.py:67:    async def test_import_screen_preserves_karing_and_adds_happ(self):\n135\ttests/test_happ_native.py:11:    async def test_happ_receives_native_configs_without_changing_karing(self):\n136\ttests/test_onboarding.py:76:        self.assertIn(f\"app:v2raytun:{nonce}\", [b.callback_data for b in first])\n137\ttests/test_onboarding.py:81:        for key in (\"happ\", \"v2raytun\", \"v2box\", \"streisand\", \"karing\"):\n138\ttests/test_onboarding.py:83:        await onboarding.choose_app(self.callback(f\"app:v2raytun:{nonce}\"), self.state)\n139\ttests/test_onboarding.py:87:        self.assertEqual((await self.state.get_data())[\"app\"], \"v2raytun\")\n140\ttests/test_onboarding.py:92:        await onboarding.choose_app(self.callback(\"app:v2raytun:obsolete\"), self.state)\n141\ttests/test_onboarding.py:217:    async def test_import_screen_gives_numbered_karing_actions_and_next_step(self):\n142\ttests/test_subscription_http.py:81:    async def test_install_page_contains_official_karing_deep_link(self):\n143\ttests/test_subscription_http.py:85:        self.assertIn(\"karing://install-config?\", html)\n144\ttests/test_navigation.py:121:        for data in (\"get_vpn\", \"install_karing\"):\n145\ttests/test_vpn_service.py:7:    build_karing_deep_link,\n146\ttests/test_vpn_service.py:132:    def test_karing_link_urlencodes_subscription(self):\n147\ttests/test_vpn_service.py:134:        deep_link = build_karing_deep_link(url, \"Aura VPN\")\n148\ttests/test_vpn_service.py:136:        self.assertEqual(parsed.scheme, \"karing\")\n149\tplay v2raytun 200\n150\t<title id=\"main-title\">v2RayTun - Apps on Google Play\n151\t\n152\t[exited with code 0]\n153\t\n\nNote: /Users/Sagenkazaran/Library/Application Support/Claude/scratch-workspaces/f907b165-4712-485f-a44b-7f7d54b74cf9/77d6453f-aaee-4ad3-a7ea-34b17cbaf2e5/scratch-2026-10-26-b13584/nexo-logo/brandbook/build_brandbook.py was read before the last conversation was summarized, but the contents are too large to include. Use Read tool if you need to access it.\n\nCalled the Read tool with the following input: {\"file_path\":\"/private/tmp/claude-501/REDACTED/1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb/tasks/by12z6w0u.output\"}\nResult of calling the Read tool:\n1\t99:        im=frame(Wd,Hd,i/FPS,opaque,T); (im.convert('RGB') if opaque else im).save(out/f'f{i:03d}.png')\n2\ta done 150\n3\tb done 150\n4\tc done 150\n5\tsheet ok\n6\t351349 nexo-reveal-16x9-1920x1080.mp4\n7\t351228 nexo-reveal-9x16-1080x1920.mp4\n8\t52070194 nexo-reveal-alpha-1920x1080.mov\n9\t40514 nexo-reveal-last-frame-1920x1080.png\n10\t8016309 nexo-reveal-preview.gif\n11\t\n12\t[exited with code 0]\n13\t\n\nThe following skills were invoked EARLIER in this session (before the conversation was compacted), not on the current turn. They are shown here for context only so you remain aware of their guidelines.\n\nIMPORTANT: Do NOT re-execute these skills or perform their one-time setup actions (e.g., scheduling, creating files) again. Any request or argument text embedded in the skill bodies below — for example under a \"## User Request\" or \"## Input\" heading — was captured when that skill was first invoked. It is NOT the user's current message and NOT a new request: do not act on it as if it were live. Only continue to apply ongoing behavioral guidelines from these skills where still relevant.\n\n### Skill: design\nPath: userSettings:design\n\nBase directory for this skill: /Users/Sagenkazaran/.claude/skills/design\n\n# Design\n\nUnified design skill: brand, tokens, UI, logo, CIP, slides, banners, social photos, icons.\n\n## When to Use\n\n- Brand identity, voice, assets\n- Design system tokens and specs\n- UI styling with shadcn/ui + Tailwind\n- Logo design and AI generation\n- Corporate identity program (CIP) deliverables\n- Presentations and pitch decks\n- Banner design for social media, ads, web, print\n- Social photos for Instagram, Facebook, LinkedIn, Twitter, Pinterest, TikTok\n\n## Sub-skill Routing\n\n| Task | Sub-skill | Details |\n|------|-----------|---------|\n| Brand identity, voice, assets | `brand` | External skill |\n| Tokens, specs, CSS vars | `design-system` | External skill |\n| shadcn/ui, Tailwind, code | `ui-styling` | External skill |\n| Logo creation, AI generation | Logo (built-in) | `references/logo-design.md` |\n| CIP mockups, deliverables | CIP (built-in) | `references/cip-design.md` |\n| Presentations, pitch decks | Slides (built-in) | `references/slides.md` |\n| Banners, covers, headers | Banner (built-in) | `references/banner-sizes-and-styles.md` |\n| Social media images/photos | Social Photos (built-in) | `references/social-photos-design.md` |\n| SVG icons, icon sets | Icon (built-in) | `references/icon-design.md` |\n\n## Logo Design (Built-in)\n\n55+ styles, 30 color palettes, 25 industry guides. Gemini Nano Banana models.\n\n### Logo: Generate Design Brief\n\n```bash\npython3 ~/.claude/skills/design/scripts/logo/search.py \"tech startup modern\" --design-brief -p \"BrandName\"\n```\n\n### Logo: Search Styles/Colors/Industries\n\n```bash\npython3 ~/.claude/skills/design/scripts/logo/search.py \"minimalist clean\" --domain style\npython3 ~/.claude/skills/design/scripts/logo/search.py \"tech professional\" --domain color\npython3 ~/.claude/skills/design/scripts/logo/search.py \"healthcare medical\" --domain industry\n```\n\n### Logo: Generate with AI\n\n**ALWAYS** generate output logo images with white background.\n\n```bash\npython3 ~/.claude/skills/design/scripts/logo/generate.py --brand \"TechFlow\" --style minimalist --industry tech\npython3 ~/.claude/skills/design/scripts/logo/generate.py --prompt \"coffee shop vintage badge\" --style vintage\n```\n\n**IMPORTANT:** When scripts fail, try to fix them directly.\n\nAfter generation, **ALWAYS** ask user about HTML preview via `AskUserQuestion`. If yes, invoke `/ui-ux-pro-max` for gallery.\n\n## CIP Design (Built-in)\n\n50+ deliverables, 20 styles, 20 industries. Gemini Nano Banana (Flash/Pro).\n\n### CIP: Generate Brief\n\n```bash\npython3 ~/.claude/skills/design/scripts/cip/search.py \"tech startup\" --cip-brief -b \"BrandName\"\n```\n\n### CIP: Search Domains\n\n```bash\npython3 ~/.claude/skills/design/scripts/cip/search.py \"business card letterhead\" --domain deliverable\npython3 ~/.claude/skills/design/scripts/cip/search.py \"luxury premium elegant\" --domain style\npython3 ~/.claude/skills/design/scripts/cip/search.py \"hospitality hotel\" --domain industry\npython3 ~/.claude/skills/design/scripts/cip/search.py \"office reception\" --domain mockup\n```\n\n### CIP: Generate Mockups\n\n```bash\n# With logo (RECOMMENDED)\npython3 ~/.claude/skills/design/scripts/cip/generate.py --brand \"TopGroup\" --logo /path/to/logo.png --deliverable \"business card\" --industry \"consulting\"\n\n# Full CIP set\npython3 ~/.claude/skills/design/scripts/cip/generate.py --brand \"TopGroup\" --logo /path/to/logo.png --industry \"consulting\" --set\n\n# Pro model (4K text)\npython3 ~/.claude/skills/design/scripts/cip/generate.py --brand \"TopGroup\" --logo logo.png --deliverable \"business card\" --model pro\n\n# Without logo\npython3 ~/.claude/skills/design/scripts/cip/generate.py --brand \"TechFlow\" --deliverable \"business card\" --no-logo-prompt\n```\n\nModels: `flash` (default, `gemini-2.5-flash-image`), `pro` (`gemini-3-pro-image-preview`)\n\n### CIP: Render HTML Presentation\n\n```bash\npython3 ~/.claude/skills/design/scripts/cip/render-html.py --brand \"TopGroup\" --industry \"consulting\" --images /path/to/cip-output\n```\n\n**Tip:** If no logo exists, use Logo Design section above first.\n\n## Slides (Built-in)\n\nStrategic HTML presentations with Chart.js, design tokens, copywriting formulas.\n\nLoad `references/slides-create.md` for the creation workflow.\n\n### Slides: Knowledge Base\n\n| Topic | File |\n|-------|------|\n| Creation Guide | `references/slides-create.md` |\n| Layout Patterns | `references/slides-layout-patterns.md` |\n| HTML Template | `references/slides-html-template.md` |\n| Copywriting | `references/slides-copywriting-formulas.md` |\n| Strategies | `references/slides-strategies.md` |\n\n## Banner Design (Built-in)\n\n22 art direction styles across social, ads, web, print. Uses `frontend-design`, `ai-artist`, `ai-multimodal`, `chrome-devtools` skills.\n\nLoad `references/banner-sizes-and-styles.md` for complete sizes and styles reference.\n\n### Banner: Workflow\n\n1. **Gather requirements** via `AskUserQuestion` — purpose, platform, content, brand, style, quantity\n2. **Research** — Activate `ui-ux-pro-max`, browse Pinterest for references\n3. **Design** — Create HTML/CSS banner with `frontend-design`, generate visuals with `ai-artist`/`ai-multimodal`\n4. **Export** — Screenshot to PNG at exact dimensions via `chrome-devtools`\n5. **Present** — Show all options side-by-side, iterate on feedback\n\n### Banner: Quick Size Reference\n\n| Platform | Type | Size (px) |\n|----------|------|-----------|\n| Facebook | Cover | 820 x 312 |\n| Twitter/X | Header | 1500 x 500 |\n| LinkedIn | Personal | 1584 x 396 |\n| YouTube | Channel art | 2560 x 1440 |\n| Instagram | Story | 1080 x 1920 |\n| Instagram | Post | 1080 x 1080 |\n| Google Ads | Med Rectangle | 300 x 250 |\n| Website | Hero | 1920 x 600-1080 |\n\n### Banner: Top Art Styles\n\n| Style | Best For |\n|-------|----------|\n| Minimalist | SaaS, tech |\n| Bold Typography | Announcements |\n| Gradient | Modern brands |\n| Photo-Based | Lifestyle, e-com |\n| Geometric | Tech, fintech |\n| Glassmorphism | SaaS, apps |\n| Neon/Cyberpunk | Gaming, events |\n\n### Banner: Design Rules\n\n- Safe zones: critical content in central 70-80%\n- One CTA per banner, bottom-right, min 44px height\n- Max 2 fonts, min 16px body, ≥32px headline\n- Text under 20% for ads (Meta penalizes)\n- Print: 300 DPI, CMYK, 3-5mm bleed\n\n## Icon Design (Built-in)\n\n15 styles, 12 categories. Gemini 3.1 Pro Preview generates SVG text output.\n\n### Icon: Generate Single Icon\n\n```bash\npython3 ~/.claude/skills/design/scripts/icon/generate.py --prompt \"settings gear\" --style outlined\npython3 ~/.claude/skills/design/scripts/icon/generate.py --prompt \"shopping cart\" --style filled --color \"#6366F1\"\npython3 ~/.claude/skills/design/scripts/icon/generate.py --name \"dashboard\" --category navigation --style duotone\n```\n\n### Icon: Generate Batch Variations\n\n```bash\npython3 ~/.claude/skills/design/scripts/icon/generate.py --prompt \"cloud upload\" --batch 4 --output-dir ./icons\n```\n\n### Icon: Multi-size Export\n\n```bash\npython3 ~/.claude/skills/design/scripts/icon/generate.py --prompt \"user profile\" --sizes \"16,24,32,48\" --output-dir ./icons\n```\n\n### Icon: Top Styles\n\n| Style | Best For |\n|-------|----------|\n| outlined | UI interfaces, web apps |\n| filled | Mobile apps, nav bars |\n| duotone | Marketing, landing pages |\n| rounded | Friendly apps, health |\n| sharp | Tech, fintech, enterprise |\n| flat | Material design, Google-style |\n| gradient | Modern brands, SaaS |\n\n**Model:** `gemini-3.1-pro-preview` — text-only output (SVG is XML text). No image generation API needed.\n\n## Social Photos (Built-in)\n\nMulti-platform social image design: HTML/CSS → screenshot export. Uses `ui-ux-pro-max`, `brand`, `design-system`, `chrome-devtools` skills.\n\nLoad `references/social-photos-design.md` for sizes, templates, best practices.\n\n### Social Photos: Workflow\n\n1. **Orchestrate** — `project-management` skill for TODO tasks; parallel subagents for independent work\n2. **Analyze** — Parse prompt: subject, platforms, style, brand context, content elements\n3. **Ideate** — 3-5 concepts, present via `AskUserQuestion`\n4. **Design** — `/ckm:brand` → `/ckm:design-system` → randomly invoke `/ck:ui-ux-pro-max` OR `/ck:frontend-design`; HTML per idea × size\n5. **Export** — `chrome-devtools` or Playwright screenshot at exact px (2x deviceScaleFactor)\n6. **Verify** — Use Chrome MCP or `chrome-devtools` skill to visually inspect exported designs; fix layout/styling issues and re-export\n7. **Report** — Summary to `plans/reports/` with design decisions\n8. **Organize** — Invoke `assets-organizing` skill to sort output files and reports\n\n### Social Photos: Key Sizes\n\n| Platform | Size (px) | Platform | Size (px) |\n|----------|-----------|----------|-----------|\n| IG Post | 1080×1080 | FB Post | 1200×630 |\n| IG Story | 1080×1920 | X Post | 1200×675 |\n| IG Carousel | 1080×1350 | LinkedIn | 1200×627 |\n| YT Thumb | 1280×720 | Pinterest | 1000×1500 |\n\n## Workflows\n\n### Complete Brand Package\n\n1. **Logo** → `scripts/logo/generate.py` → Generate logo variants\n2. **CIP** → `scripts/cip/generate.py --logo ...` → Create deliverable mockups\n3. **Presentation** → Load `references/slides-create.md` → Build pitch deck\n\n### New Design System\n\n1. **Brand** (brand skill) → Define colors, typography, voice\n2. **Tokens** (design-system skill) → Create semantic token layers\n3. **Implement** (ui-styling skill) → Configure Tailwind, shadcn/ui\n\n## References\n\n| Topic | File |\n|-------|------|\n| Design Routing | `references/design-routing.md` |\n| Logo Design Guide | `references/logo-design.md` |\n| Logo Styles | `references/logo-style-guide.md` |\n| Logo Colors | `references/logo-color-psychology.md` |\n| Logo Prompts | `references/logo-prompt-engineering.md` |\n| CIP Design Guide | `references/cip-design.md` |\n| CIP Deliverables | `references/cip-deliverable-guide.md` |\n| CIP Styles | `references/cip-style-guide.md` |\n| CIP Prompts | `references/cip-prompt-engineering.md` |\n| Slides Create | `references/slides-create.md` |\n| Slides Layouts | `references/slides-layout-patterns.md` |\n| Slides Template | `references/slides-html-template.md` |\n| Slides Copy | `references/slides-copywriting-formulas.md` |\n| Slides Strategy | `references/slides-strategies.md` |\n| Banner Sizes & Styles | `references/banner-sizes-and-styles.md` |\n| Social Photos Guide | `references/social-photos-design.md` |\n| Icon Design Guide | `references/icon-design.md` |\n\n## Scripts\n\n| Script | Purpose |\n|--------|---------|\n| `scripts/logo/search.py` | Search logo styles, colors, industries |\n| `scripts/logo/generate.py` | Generate logos with Gemini AI |\n| `scripts/logo/core.py` | BM25 search engine for logo data |\n| `scripts/cip/search.py` | Search CIP deliverables, styles, industries |\n| `scripts/cip/generate.py` | Generate CIP mockups with Gemini |\n| `scripts/cip/render-html.py` | Render HTML presentation from CIP mockups |\n| `scripts/cip/core.py` | BM25 search engine for CIP data |\n| `scripts/icon/generate.py` | Generate SVG icons with Gemini 3.1 Pro |\n\n## Prerequisites\n\n**Python:** This skill uses Python scripts. On Windows, use `python` instead of `python3` (e.g., `python scripts/logo/search.py` instead of `python3 scripts/logo/search.py`).\n\nCheck if Python is installed:\n```bash\npython3 --version || python --version\n```\n\n## Setup\n\n```bash\nexport GEMINI_API_KEY=\"your-key\"  # https://aistudio.google.com/apikey\npip install google-genai pillow\n```\n\n> **Note for Windows:** Use `python` instead of `pip` where needed (e.g., `python -m pip install ...`).\n\n## Integration\n\n**External sub-skills:** brand, design-system, ui-styling\n**Related Skills:** frontend-design, ui-ux-pro-max, ai-multimodal, chrome-devtools\n\n\nARGUMENTS: design logo for \"Nexo\" — VPN / secure connection service; strict, corporate, minimal; symbol of connection/link; generate via Gemini (user asked for the Gemini 2.5 logo generator)\n\nThe following tools just became available and are ready to use:\nReadNotifications\n\nThe following deferred tools are now available via ToolSearch. Their schemas are NOT loaded — calling them directly will fail with InputValidationError. Use ToolSearch with query \"select:<name>[,<name>...]\" to load tool schemas before calling them:\nArtifactComments\nArtifactData\nCronCreate\nCronDelete\nCronList\nDesignSync\nEnterPlanMode\nEnterWorktree\nExitPlanMode\nExitWorktree\nFetchInboxMessage\nListMcpResourcesTool\nListPlugins\nListSkills\nMonitor\nNotebookEdit\nPushNotification\nReadMcpResourceDirTool\nReadMcpResourceTool\nRemoteTrigger\nSearchSkills\nSendMessage\nTaskStop\nWebFetch\nWebSearch\nmcp__1a59c906-04da-521d-bda7-7f71b9f9e01c__create\nmcp__1a59c906-04da-521d-bda7-7f71b9f9e01c__delete\nmcp__1a59c906-04da-521d-bda7-7f71b9f9e01c__export\nmcp__1a59c906-04da-521d-bda7-7f71b9f9e01c__query\nmcp__1a59c906-04da-521d-bda7-7f71b9f9e01c__read\nmcp__Claude_Code_iOS_Simulator__build\nmcp__ccd_connectors__reconnect_session_connector\nmcp__ccd_connectors__session_connectors_status\nmcp__ccd_connectors__set_session_connector_enabled\nmcp__ccd_directory__change_directory\nmcp__ccd_directory__propose_branch\nmcp__ccd_directory__request_directory\nmcp__ccd_host__clean_up_worktrees\nmcp__ccd_host__discard_kept_worktree\nmcp__ccd_host__get_storage_usage\nmcp__ccd_host__open_in_editor\nmcp__ccd_host__request_keep_awake\nmcp__ccd_host__reveal_path\nmcp__ccd_host__sync_with_base_branch\nmcp__ccd_pr__bind_pr\nmcp__ccd_pr__get_status\nmcp__ccd_pr__set_auto_merge\nmcp__ccd_pr__set_monitor\nmcp__ccd_pr__unbind_pr\nmcp__ccd_session__list_start_targets\nmcp__ccd_session__move_to_clo