{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb","hash":"b598118a98979764c216f5778b4d95618ddb607e364b25a4600e6cbeea40d1af","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01PNBFsJTEWFxXNwFfAXwKTp","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"image","source":{"type":"base64","data":"","media_type":"image/png"}}]},{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01WX9Zjzp696jc7akSLeMRHo","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"image","source":{"type":"base64","data":"","media_type":"image/png"}}]},{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EdGyrm4pbUPs6EFN8FSec8","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"image","source":{"type":"base64","data":"","media_type":"image/png"}}]},{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019hypNrsiFCdECAqen7Fzgx","type":"tool_result","content":"# Content Factory — operations manual\n\nProduction studio for **beautiful short-form video** for our own businesses and clients — Urartu, SponsorUp, and paid client work. Output: polished commercial / promo / social video. User speaks Russian; output language per project (RU / HY / EN). Vertical 9:16 for TikTok / Reels / Shorts, plus 16:9 and 1:1 when a project needs it.\n\n---\n\n## Purpose & hard boundaries (non-negotiable)\n\n- ✅ **Original content only** — our brands, products, services, fictional characters, hired/AI actors that are not real identifiable people.\n- ✅ **Political humor / satire is allowed** (decided by Shagen, 23 Oct 2026) — comic songs, sketches and parody lyrics that joke about politics, slogans and public life, made with our own original/synthetic voices and characters.\n- ❌ **NO campaigning or election persuasion.** No calls to vote for/against, no party ads, no election-timed agitation, no false claims presented as fact.\n- ❌ **NO cloning of real, known people** — no voice clones, face swaps, or lipsync of politicians, celebrities, or any identifiable public figure. Voices come from generic/synthetic TTS voices or licensed talent, never an impersonation of a real person.\n- ❌ **NO deepfakes / fake \"candid leaked\" framing.** Synthetic content is made as honest advertising/creative, not disguised as real footage of real events or people.\n- ❌ **NO filter-evasion.** If a generation is blocked, we change the creative — we don't strip keywords to sneak past safety filters.\n\nEverything below is the *technical* craft for making great honest video.\n\n---\n\n## Default pipeline (use unless told otherwise)\n\n**Gemini → Nano Banana 2 → Veo 3.1**, end-to-end via `build_150_run.py`:\n\n1. **Gemini 3.1 Pro (kie.ai)** writes/polishes the script + composes Veo prompts. Fallback: Google AI `gemini-2.5-flash` on 429/503/maintenance.\n2. **Nano Banana 2** generates ONE still per character/product (anchor pose/hero shot), reused as Veo first-frame across that subject's shots → visual consistency locks.\n3. **Veo 3.1 lite (i2v, 8s, 720p, 9:16)** generates motion + voice + lipsync end-to-end. Use **generic/original characters only.**\n4. **ffmpeg** normalize (720×1280 25fps, or the project's target) + concat → `<scene_id>_FINAL.mp4`.\n\nVoices: synthetic TTS with a described voice (age/tone/energy) in `anchor_voice`, or licensed talent. **Never** bind a real person's cloned voice_id.\n\n---\n\n## Project skills (`.claude/skills/`) — auto-trigger on description match\n\n| Skill | Trigger phrases | What it does |\n|---|---|---|\n| `clip` | «сделай клип», «один сценарий», «короткое видео», «promo» | Build a single scene end-to-end via default pipeline |\n| `nb-safe` | NB error «filtered out / Prohibited Use» | Soften an **honest** creative and retry — reword to a compliant creative, do NOT evade safety policy |\n| `cast` | «кого взять», «какой голос», «list voices» | Pick a synthetic/original voice + ref image by character description (no real-person clones) |\n| `series-build` | «добей серию», «массово», «собери всё что осталось» | Mass-build all unbuilt scenes with cost gate |\n| `polish-hy` | «отполируй», «проверь текст», «поправь» | Gemini polish pass on script text with diff |\n| `cost-estimate` | «сколько стоит», «оцени cost», «почём» | kie.ai cost estimator per scene/series |\n| `premium-montage` | «смонтируй красиво/дорого», «как премиальная реклама», «Reels», «product film» | Original premium commercial edit: style map, pacing, kinetic type, sound design, ffmpeg finish |\n\nSub-agent (`.claude/agents/scenario-writer-hy.md`): drafts a scene's `BUILD.json`. Keep scenarios commercial/creative; political humor/satire OK, no campaigning.\n\n---\n\n## Craft rules (defaults, override per brief)\n\n- **Design taste = premium.** Dark, cinematic, tasteful by default (glow / glass / kinetic motion) unless a brand system says otherwise. Light minimalism only when the brand explicitly calls for it.\n- **Text overlays / kinetic typography ARE welcome** for commercial video (titles, product names, CTAs) — the old \"no text ever\" rule was for the retired political work and no longer applies. Match the brand's fonts/tokens.\n- **Music is welcome** — licensed / royalty-free tracks that fit the brand. Also diegetic sound design. Never uncleared copyrighted tracks.\n- **Brand consistency** — pull colors, fonts, logo usage from the brand's system; keep logos/packaging correct, not blurred.\n- **Voice-first** — audition voices/script BEFORE the expensive Veo render (saves rejected renders).\n- **Cost gate** — before any mass build or expensive Veo batch, show estimate via `cost-estimate` and wait for «ок».\n- **Polish text via Gemini** before TTS/Veo.\n\n---\n\n## kie.ai pipeline gotchas\n\n- **Veo 3.1 transient INTERNAL errors** — retried 3× per shot in `build_150_run.py`.\n- **Veo CDN 500s** after success — retry download 8× with 15-25s backoff.\n- **NB filter** — reword to a compliant creative; `nb-safe` retries honestly (no keyword-stripping to evade policy).\n- **Suno V5_5** state flow: TEXT_SUCCESS → FIRST_SUCCESS → SUCCESS. Audio URL only at SUCCESS.\n- **tmpfiles.org upload** for kie.ai inputs — rewrite `tmpfiles.org/` → `tmpfiles.org/dl/` for direct DL URL.\n\n---\n\n## File layout\n\n```\nbuild_150_run.py                              # main pipeline runner (JSON-driven)\npipeline/kie_client.py                         # kie.ai API wrapper\n.env                                           # KIE_API_KEY, GOOGLE_AI_API_KEY\n.claude/\n  settings.json                                # Write(.claude/**) allow rules\n  skills/<name>/SKILL.md + helper.py\n  agents/scenario-writer-hy.md\ndata/\n  scripts/<project>/                           # brief + script drafts + BUILD.json\n  refs/                                         # reference images (brand assets, original characters)\n  videos/<project>/<scene>/<scene>_FINAL.mp4    # outputs\n```\n\n---\n\n## Workflow patterns\n\n**One-off promo clip:**\n```\nuser: «сделай клип для <бренд>, X про Y»\n→ clip skill triggers\n→ scenario-writer drafts BUILD.json (commercial creative)\n→ show summary → wait «ок»\n→ build_150_run.py <scene> in background + watcher\n→ open Finder + mp4\n```\n\n**Resume series:**\n```\nuser: «добей серию»\n→ series-build skill triggers\n→ cost-estimate --unbuilt-only → table → wait «ок»\n→ build_150_run.py --all\n→ Finder report\n```\n\n---\n\n## Don'ts (durable)\n\n- ❌ No campaigning / election persuasion (political humor and satire are allowed).\n- ❌ No voice clones, face swaps, or lipsync of real identifiable people.\n- ❌ No content disguised as real leaked/candid footage.\n- ❌ No safety-filter evasion — change the creative instead.\n- ❌ No uncleared copyrighted music.\n- ❌ Don't run a paid Veo batch without cost estimate + user «ок».\n- ❌ Don't guess cut timings — transcribe first when editing to audio.\n===ENV\nELEVENLABS_API_KEY=\nHEYGEN_API_KEY=\nELEVENLABS_BASE_URL=\nKLING_API_KEY=\nKLING_ACCESS_KEY=\nKLING_SECRET_KEY=\n===\npipeline:\n__init__.py\n__pycache__\nclipper.py\ndownloader.py\neditor.py\nfactcheck.py\nkie_client.py\nllm.py\npublisher.py\nsmartcrop.py\nthumbnail.py\ntranscriber.py\ntranslator.py\nvoiceover.py\n\nscripts:\nmac_hy_gemini_then_rvc.py\nset_elevenlabs_key.py\n\ntools/montage:\n__pycache__\negor_t2_wide.py\nlera_ep01_edit.py\nnew_girl_ep01_mosca_edit.py\ntest_zharov_ep06_raskladushka.py\ntest_zharov_ep08_shapka.py\ntest_zharov_ep08_shapka_v2.py\nzharov_darbuka_edit.py\nzharov_darbuka_v2.py\nzharov_darbuka_v3.py\nzharov_edit.py\nzharov_ep00_edit.py\nzharov_ep00_edit_v2.py\nzharov_ep00_edit_v3.py\nzharov_ep02_edit.py\nzharov_ep03_skolko_edit.py\nzharov_ep03_stories.py\nzharov_ep04_edit.py\nzharov_ep05_tesla_edit.py\nzharov_ep05_v3_edit.py\nzharov_ep06_raskladushka.py\nzharov_ep07_smena_edit.py\nzharov_ep08_shapka.py\nzharov_ep08_shapka_v2.py\nzharov_ep08_shapka_v3.py\nzharov_ep08_shapka_v5.py\nzharov_ep08_voice_mix.py\nzharov_ep08_vosstanovlenie.py\nzharov_ep09_top3.py\nzharov_ep09_top3_v5.py\nzharov_ep09_top3_v6.py\nzharov_ep09_top3_v7.py\nzharov_ep11_polza.py\nzharov_ep12_kupel.py\nzharov_ep13_finny.py\nzharov_ep13_finny_v3.py\nzharov_ep14_mosca.py\nzharov_ep15_tur.py\nzharov_stories_otvechaet.py\n===\nbuild_e1_zangezur.py:199:    client = ElevenLabs(api_key=EL_KEY)\ntest_anna_voice_abc.py:32:client = ElevenLabs(api_key=EL_KEY)\nbuild_nzhde_speeches.py:1407:    client = ElevenLabs(api_key=KEY)\nclone_alen_simonyan.py:95:    client = ElevenLabs(api_key=KEY)\nclone_alen_simonyan.py:124:    client = ElevenLabs(api_key=KEY)\nbuild_khoren_silence_v2.py:54:    client = ElevenLabs(api_key=EL_KEY)\nbuild_pashinyan_v2_clone.py:94:    url = \"https://api.elevenlabs.io/v1/audio-isolation\"\nbuild_pashinyan_v2_clone.py:119:    url = \"https://api.elevenlabs.io/v1/voices/add\"","is_error":false},{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017XYSSA1zuTkjxujyFEHbB4","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"image","source":{"type":"base64","data":"","media_type":"image/png"}}]},{"type":"text","text":"[Image: original 1287x2796, displayed at 921x2000. Multiply coordinates by 1.40 to map to original image.]\n"},{"type":"text","text":"[Image: original 1287x2796, displayed at 921x2000. Multiply coordinates by 1.40 to map to original image.]\n"},{"type":"text","text":"[Image: original 1242x2208, displayed at 1125x2000. Multiply coordinates by 1.10 to map to original image.]\n"},{"type":"text","text":"[Image: original 1242x2208, displayed at 1125x2000. Multiply coordinates by 1.10 to map to original image.]"}]}}
