{"parentUuid":"4c739233-7e98-48e0-9f1c-4e49984004f5","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"c07342c3-c5db-4dab-b77b-973a6227d973","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FWSfvBMTY875i98D6U3nC7","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Karing VPN app GitHub KaringX license source code\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"github.com\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/KaringX/karing\"},{\"title\":\"github.com\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/wl851229/Karing\"},{\"title\":\"github.com\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/blarApp/karing\"},{\"title\":\"github.com\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/coco-coc/karing\"},{\"title\":\"mynixos.com\",\"url\":\"https://mynixos.com/nixpkgs/package/karing\"},{\"title\":\"github.com\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/KaringX/karing/releases\"},{\"title\":\"karing proxy utility\",\"url\":\"https://www.linuxlinks.com/karing-proxy-utility/\"}]\n\nThe official repository is KaringX/karing on GitHub. The search results point to a GPL-3.0 license, but none of the results show the license file directly from the official repo.\n\n- **Official repo:** A singbox GUI based on flutter, with Karing has not opened any channel related to Karing on any video platform noted on the page. Its releases page lists iOS/tvOS builds on the App Store alongside GitHub pre-releases.\n- **License:** A NixOS package listing gives the version as 1.2.5.880 with the license GPL-3.0-or-later, and its homepage is the KaringX repo. LinuxLinks also says License: GNU General Public License v3.0.\n- **Language and stack:** LinuxLinks notes that Karing is written in Dart.\n- **Forks and mirrors:** Other GitHub copies exist, such as wl851229/Karing and blarApp/karing. These are not the official project, and I did not verify their licensing.\n\nThe search did not return the LICENSE file itself. To confirm the exact license terms, check the LICENSE file in github.com/KaringX/karing.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"71d1a929-2eb0-4510-ba1a-8b637ab7dcc8","timestamp":"2026-11-02T15:16:53.455Z","toolUseResult":{"query":"Karing VPN app GitHub KaringX license source code","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01Tprijw3XexAJyqKovVH8nr","content":[{"title":"github.com","url":"https://github.com/KaringX/karing"},{"title":"github.com","url":"https://github.com/wl851229/Karing"},{"title":"github.com","url":"https://github.com/blarApp/karing"},{"title":"github.com","url":"https://github.com/coco-coc/karing"},{"title":"mynixos.com","url":"https://mynixos.com/nixpkgs/package/karing"},{"title":"github.com","url":"https://github.com/KaringX/karing/releases"},{"title":"karing proxy utility","url":"https://www.linuxlinks.com/karing-proxy-utility/"}]},"The official repository is KaringX/karing on GitHub. The search results point to a GPL-3.0 license, but none of the results show the license file directly from the official repo.\n\n- **Official repo:** A singbox GUI based on flutter, with Karing has not opened any channel related to Karing on any video platform noted on the page. Its releases page lists iOS/tvOS builds on the App Store alongside GitHub pre-releases.\n- **License:** A NixOS package listing gives the version as 1.2.5.880 with the license GPL-3.0-or-later, and its homepage is the KaringX repo. LinuxLinks also says License: GNU General Public License v3.0.\n- **Language and stack:** LinuxLinks notes that Karing is written in Dart.\n- **Forks and mirrors:** Other GitHub copies exist, such as wl851229/Karing and blarApp/karing. These are not the official project, and I did not verify their licensing.\n\nThe search did not return the LICENSE file itself. To confirm the exact license terms, check the LICENSE file in github.com/KaringX/karing."],"durationSeconds":6.861994832992553,"searchCount":1},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"9c628375-b0b9-4eed-a1bc-fc1636fd0fd7","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/Sagenkazaran/Library/Application Supp