{"parentUuid":"dfe87061-7cb2-41d5-97f8-40e772474291","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"c07342c3-c5db-4dab-b77b-973a6227d973","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HrKqHEtDH6c23K7G623wAt","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"sing-box for Android SFA license GPL fork custom branded client\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"sing box for android\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/SagerNet/sing-box-for-android\"},{\"title\":\"github.com%2Fsagernet%2Fsing box for android\",\"url\":\"https://awesome.ecosyste.ms/projects/github.com%2Fsagernet%2Fsing-box-for-android\"},{\"title\":\"github.com%2FSagerNet%2Fsing box for android\",\"url\":\"https://awesome.ecosyste.ms/projects/github.com%2FSagerNet%2Fsing-box-for-android\"},{\"title\":\"sing box for android\",\"url\":\"https://backiee.wasmer.app/https_github_com/SagerNet/sing-box-for-android\"},{\"title\":\"sing-box for Android\",\"url\":\"https://sing-box.sagernet.org/clients/android/\"},{\"title\":\"apt.izzysoft.de\",\"url\":\"https://apt.izzysoft.de/fdroid/index/apk/io.nekohasekai.sfa?repo=main\"},{\"title\":\"sing_box 0.0.1 copy \\\"sing_box: ^0.0.1\\\" to clipboard\",\"url\":\"https://pub.dev/packages/sing_box/license\"}]\n\nShort version: the GPL-3.0 license permits forks, but the SFA repo adds a name restriction that rules out a custom-branded client using the sing-box name.\n\n- **License:** The SFA repo is under the GNU General Public License, copyright nekohasekai, and the GitHub listing shows GPL-3.0-or-later for the F-Droid build (License:GPL-3.0-or-later).\n- **Name restriction:** The license has an added condition: no derivative work may use the name or imply association with this application without prior consent.\n- **Store listing:** The README says that forks of the app are not allowed to be listed on F-Droid or other app stores under the original name. A fork under a different name isn't covered by that sentence.\n- **Core library:** The sing-box core (libbox) is a separate GPL-3.0 component. A third-party Flutter wrapper notes that the libbox library is licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0 (GPL-3.0).\n\nPractical takeaway: you can fork and rebrand the client under a new name, but you can't use \"sing-box\" or \"SFA\" in the name, branding, or store listing without permission from the maintainer. Source-release obligations under GPL also apply if you distribute builds. I found no authoritative analysis of how the extra name clause interacts with GPL, so have a lawyer check that before shipping.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"fdbc16bf-e605-4d00-8de4-577b822cb8b4","timestamp":"2026-11-02T15:17:05.459Z","toolUseResult":{"query":"sing-box for Android SFA license GPL fork custom branded client","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01BPYNRSDde9ZnYmsq3xq4J2","content":[{"title":"sing box for android","url":"https://github.com/SagerNet/sing-box-for-android"},{"title":"github.com%2Fsagernet%2Fsing box for android","url":"https://awesome.ecosyste.ms/projects/github.com%2Fsagernet%2Fsing-box-for-android"},{"title":"github.com%2FSagerNet%2Fsing box for android","url":"https://awesome.ecosyste.ms/projects/github.com%2FSagerNet%2Fsing-box-for-android"},{"title":"sing box for android","url":"https://backiee.wasmer.app/https_github_com/SagerNet/sing-box-for-android"},{"title":"sing-box for Android","url":"https://sing-box.sagernet.org/clients/android/"},{"title":"apt.izzysoft.de","url":"https://apt.izzysoft.de/fdroid/index/apk/io.nekohasekai.sfa?repo=main"},{"title":"sing_box 0.0.1 copy \"sing_box: ^0.0.1\" to clipboard","url":"https://pub.dev/packages/sing_box/license"}]},"Short version: the GPL-3.0 license permits forks, but the SFA repo adds a name restriction that rules out a custom-branded client using the sing-box name.\n\n- **License:** The SFA repo is under the GNU General Public License, copyright nekohasekai, and the GitHub listing shows GPL-3.0-or-later for the F-Droid build (License:GPL-3.0-or-later).\n- **Name restriction:** The license has an added condition: no derivative work may use the name or imply association with this application without prior consent.\n- **Store listing:** The README says that forks of the app are not allowed to be listed on F-Droid or other app stores under the original name. A fork under a different name isn't covered by that sentence.\n- **Core library:** The sing-box core (libbox) is a separate GPL-3.0 component. A third-party Flutter wrapper notes that the libbox library is licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0 (GPL-3.0).\n\nPractical takeaway: you can fork and rebrand the client under a new name, but you can't use \"sing-box\" or \"SFA\" in the name, branding, or store listing without permission from the maintainer. Source-release obligations under GPL also apply if you distribute builds. I found no authoritative analysis of how the extra name clause interacts with GPL, so have a lawyer check that before shipping."],"durationSeconds":18.854440166980027,"searchCount":1},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"9c628375-b0b9-4eed-a1bc-fc1636fd0fd7","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/Sagenkazaran/Library/Application Support/Claude/scratch-workspaces/f907b165-4712-485f-a44b-7f7d54b74cf9/77d6453f-aaee-4ad3-a7ea-34b17cbaf2e5/scratch-2026-10-26-b13584","root":null,"branch":null,"default_branch":null,"status":null,"visibility":{"origin":null,"push_remote":null,"remotes":[],"visibility_cache":[]},"error":"not_a_repo"},"live_cwd":"/Users/Sagenkazaran/Library/Application Support/Claude/scratch-workspaces/f907b165-4712-485f-a44b-7f7d54b74cf9/77d6453f-aaee-4ad3-a7ea-34b17cbaf2e5/scratch-2026-10-26-b13584","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"dfe87061-7cb2-41d5-97f8-40e772474291","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/Sagenkazaran/Libr