{"parentUuid":"24ab6c98-1507-40eb-a863-5366b5b337c8","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"async_hook_response","processId":"async_hook_86204","hookName":"PostToolUse:WebSearch","hookEvent":"PostToolUse","toolName":"WebSearch","response":{},"stdout":"","stderr":"","exitCode":1},"type":"attachment","uuid":"91ad04e2-17c8-453d-ad8b-f5e666dfe891","timestamp":"2026-11-02T15:17:05.472Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/Sagenkazaran/Library/Application Support/Claude/scratch-workspaces/f907b165-4712-485f-a44b-7f7d54b74cf9/77d6453f-aaee-4ad3-a7ea-34b17cbaf2e5/scratch-2026-10-26-b13584","sessionId":"1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"deep-singing-taco"}
{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb","hash":"7560688a57b5839037d194263348fcc48c00db4c54901dec872178b01cfaa9a0","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_014KMutt5586EzwU2V8zU7Xa","name":"mcp__ccd_turn__update_plan","input":{"advance":true},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_012PkqyFCWyE3T6nDjKBUegr","name":"mcp__obsidian__obsidian_edit_note","input":{"vault":"vault","path":"Проекты/VPN-инфраструктура.md","operation":"append","content":"\n\n## 2026-11-02 — Поддержка ведёт прямо в Telegram Шагена\n- Все кнопки «Поддержка» в боте (помощь, экран «не получается», ошибка выдачи ключа, ошибка оплаты, документ «Поддержка») — теперь прямая ссылка на https://t.me/Shahen_Kazaryan (`legal.SUPPORT_URL`, `keyboards.support_button()`).\n- В веб-приложении: плитка «Поддержка» на главной, первая строка в «Ещё» и кнопка на странице /docs/support — тоже ссылка на Telegram.\n- Коммиты на сервере: 1813568 (поддержка), 8057318 (тест видео больше не зависит от реального файла). 210 тестов зелёные, nexo-bot и nexo-subscription перезапущены.\n- Замечание: в РФ t.me без VPN может не открыться — позже стоит добавить второй контакт (почта/телефон).\n- Вопрос Шагена: можно ли веб-приложение без Karing / встроить Karing. Ответ: браузер не умеет включать VPN на телефоне; варианты — своё приложение Nexo (Android APK с сайта — реально; iPhone — нужен аккаунт разработчика Apple и App Store/TestFlight), либо встроенный VPN iOS через профиль (IKEv2) — но в РФ его часто блокируют.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01FWSfvBMTY875i98D6U3nC7","name":"WebSearch","input":{"query":"Karing VPN app GitHub KaringX license source code","mode":"standard"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01HrKqHEtDH6c23K7G623wAt","name":"WebSearch","input":{"query":"sing-box for Android SFA license GPL fork custom branded client","mode":"standard"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb","hash":"cc694083a8b98f1149b1b66c4a066dc80d573dfaf87ad9e28e01464bd671e246","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_014KMutt5586EzwU2V8zU7Xa","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Plan updated: step 4 of 5 is in progress."}]},{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012PkqyFCWyE3T6nDjKBUegr","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"ok\":true,\"data\":{\"path\":\"Проекты/VPN-инфраструктура.md\",\"etag\":\"18e27b402700100d83b643fdf319e71ce4cea86ed2d03291736049468ae488ee\",\"transaction_id\":\"ae07cd0f-008d-4ad6-b4af-7ec3e99831fb\"}}"},{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01FWSfvBMTY875i98D6U3nC7","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Karing VPN app GitHub KaringX license source code\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"github.com\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/KaringX/karing\"},{\"title\":\"github.com\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/wl851229/Karing\"},{\"title\":\"github.com\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/blarApp/karing\"},{\"title\":\"github.com\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/coco-coc/karing\"},{\"title\":\"mynixos.com\",\"url\":\"https://mynixos.com/nixpkgs/package/karing\"},{\"title\":\"github.com\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/KaringX/karing/releases\"},{\"title\":\"karing proxy utility\",\"url\":\"https://www.linuxlinks.com/karing-proxy-utility/\"}]\n\nThe official repository is KaringX/karing on GitHub. The search results point to a GPL-3.0 license, but none of the results show the license file directly from the official repo.\n\n- **Official repo:** A singbox GUI based on flutter, with Karing has not opened any channel related to Karing on any video platform noted on the page. Its releases page lists iOS/tvOS builds on the App Store alongside GitHub pre-releases.\n- **License:** A NixOS package listing gives the version as 1.2.5.880 with the license GPL-3.0-or-later, and its homepage is the KaringX repo. LinuxLinks also says License: GNU General Public License v3.0.\n- **Language and stack:** LinuxLinks notes that Karing is written in Dart.\n- **Forks and mirrors:** Other GitHub copies exist, such as wl851229/Karing and blarApp/karing. These are not the official project, and I did not verify their licensing.\n\nThe search did not return the LICENSE file itself. To confirm the exact license terms, check the LICENSE file in github.com/KaringX/karing.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."},{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01HrKqHEtDH6c23K7G623wAt","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"sing-box for Android SFA license GPL fork custom branded client\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"sing box for android\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/SagerNet/sing-box-for-android\"},{\"title\":\"github.com%2Fsagernet%2Fsing box for android\",\"url\":\"https://awesome.ecosyste.ms/projects/github.com%2Fsagernet%2Fsing-box-for-android\"},{\"title\":\"github.com%2FSagerNet%2Fsing box for android\",\"url\":\"https://awesome.ecosyste.ms/projects/github.com%2FSagerNet%2Fsing-box-for-android\"},{\"title\":\"sing box for android\",\"url\":\"https://backiee.wasmer.app/https_github_com/SagerNet/sing-box-for-android\"},{\"title\":\"sing-box for Android\",\"url\":\"https://sing-box.sagernet.org/clients/android/\"},{\"title\":\"apt.izzysoft.de\",\"url\":\"https://apt.izzysoft.de/fdroid/index/apk/io.nekohasekai.sfa?repo=main\"},{\"title\":\"sing_box 0.0.1 copy \\\"sing_box: ^0.0.1\\\" to clipboard\",\"url\":\"https://pub.dev/packages/sing_box/license\"}]\n\nShort version: the GPL-3.0 license permits forks, but the SFA repo adds a name restriction that rules out a custom-branded client using the sing-box name.\n\n- **License:** The SFA repo is under the GNU General Public License, copyright nekohasekai, and the GitHub listing shows GPL-3.0-or-later for the F-Droid build (License:GPL-3.0-or-later).\n- **Name restriction:** The license has an added condition: no derivative work may use the name or imply association with this application without prior consent.\n- **Store listing:** The README says that forks of the app are not allowed to be listed on F-Droid or other app stores under the original name. A fork under a different name isn't covered by that sentence.\n- **Core library:** The sing-box core (libbox) is a separate GPL-3.0 component. A third-party Flutter wrapper notes that the libbox library is licensed under the GNU General Public License v3.0 (GPL-3.0).\n\nPractical takeaway: you can fork and rebrand the client under a new name, but you can't use \"sing-box\" or \"SFA\" in the name, branding, or store listing without permission from the maintainer. Source-release obligations under GPL also apply if you distribute builds. I found no authoritative analysis of how the extra name clause interacts with GPL, so have a lawyer check that before shipping.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]}}
