ile: `autoUpdateDuration`, edited in `views/profiles/edit.dart`.\n    - A 20-minute polling timer (`application.dart:118`) calls `autoUpdateProfiles` (`profiles.dart:42`).\n  \n  ## 6. Theme\n  - Seed: `constant.dart:166` `defaultPrimaryColor = 0xFF007AFF`. It feeds `DynamicColor` (`lib/providers/state/theme.dart:18`, seeded in `bootstrap.dart:72`).\n  - Scheme: `genColorScheme` (`theme.dart:~41`). The user's `ThemeProps.primaryColor` overrides the seed.\n  - Model: `lib/models/config.dart:471` `ThemeProps` (themeMode, colorStyle, pureBlack, fontFamily). Defaults at `:89`.\n  - ThemeData: `lib/manager/theme_manager.dart:41` `watchAppTheme` (font is `themeSetting.fontFamily`). The Theme settings UI is `lib/views/theme.dart`.\n  - **To force a brand color:** set `defaultPrimaryColor` (and `defaultPrimaryColors`) and pass a fixed `color:` / `ignoreConfig` in `genColorScheme`, or hide the Theme settings page. Fonts in `pubspec.yaml:112-118` are only JetBrainsMono and Twemoji; add a brand font there.\n  \n  ## 7. Localization\n  - Russian is supported: `arb/intl_ru.arb` (967 lines, the same as en). Locale list: `lib/l10n/l10n.dart:8060`.\n  - Default locale: `appSetting.locale` (null means follow the system), via `getLocaleForString` (`lib/common/app_localizations.dart:116`). It is applied in `bootstrap.dart:142-145` (falls back to `platformDispatcher.locale`) and `application.dart:183`. The language picker is in `lib/views/tools.dart:124`.\n  \n  ## 8. First-run dialogs\n  `bootstrap.dart` start sequence:\n  - `:177` `_handleFailedPreference` (shown only if the cache is corrupt).\n  - `:178` disclaimer: `_handlerDisclaimer` (`:244`) → `requestDisclaimerConsent()` (`lib/views/disclaimer.dart:10`). It is gated by `disclaimerVersion` (`constant.dart:34`) against `acceptedDisclaimerVersion` (`config.dart:260`). Env bypass: `FLCLASH_ACCEPT_DISCLAIMER` (`:238`).\n  - `:181` crash-recovery tip.\n  - `:189` location permission refresh.\n  - The deep-link confirmation dialog at `application.dart:89`.\n  \n  ## Recommendation (least invasive)\n  1. Create `lib/views/nexo_home.dart` (`NexoHomeView`): a big button calling `commonActionProvider.toggleRunning()`, watching `isStartProvider`, `currentGroupsStateProvider`, `selectedProxyNameProvider` and `trafficsProvider`, with a country list that calls `selectGroupProxy` / `changeProxyDebounce`. Read subscription info from the current profile.\n  2. In `lib/views/navigation.dart:17`, keep `PageLabel.dashboard` but point its builder at `NexoHomeView`. That label is the default in `CurrentPageLabel` and the back-button target in `home.dart:435`, so no enum changes are needed.\n  3. Set `modes: []` on proxies, profiles, requests, connections, dns, resources and logs. Keep `tools` and treat it as \"Settings\". Inside `ToolsView` (`lib/views/tools.dart:43` area), add an \"Advanced\" item that pushes the existing views (`ProxiesView`, `ProfilesView`, and so on) as routes.\n  4. Change `_showProfiles` (`profiles.dart:345`) to go to the dashboard. Optionally skip the deep-link confirm dialog and the disclaimer.\n  5. Rename user-visible strings and icons only; keep the package, Go and helper identifiers.","handback":true,"handbackReportText":"All paths below are relative to `~/Projects/nexo-app`. I only read files; nothing was changed.\n\n## 1. Branding\n\n**Dart and build config**\n- `pubspec.yaml:1` `name: fl_clash`. **Do not rename.** Every `package:fl_clash/...` import depends on it.\n- `lib/common/constant.dart`:\n  - `:12` `appName='FlClash'`. This is used as the window/MaterialApp title at `lib/application.dart:182`.\n  - `:13` `appHelperService='FlClashHelperService'`.\n  - `:17` `packageName='com.follow.clash'`.\n  - `:18-19` socket and pipe names.\n  - `:24-25` helper socket and protocol header.\n  - `:124` `repository`.\n  - `:166` `defaultPrimaryColor`, `:179` `defaultPrimaryColors`.\n- `distribute_options.yaml`: `app_name: 'FlClash'`.\n- `build_config.yaml`: `core_name: FlClashCore`, `helper_name: FlClashHelperService`. **Risky.** These names must match `windows/CMakeLists.txt:109-125`, `inno_setup.iss:28,41` and `constant.dart:13,22` (the Windows service registry key). Renaming orphans helpers that are already installed.\n- Deep-link schemes: `lib/common/protocol.dart:7` `['clash','clashmeta','flclash']`. Keep `clash` for compatibility and add `nexo`.\n\n**Android**\n- `android/app/build.gradle.kts:36` `applicationId` is safe to change. Leave `namespace` (`:26`) and the Kotlin package `com.follow.clash` alone; `android/core/build.gradle.kts:153` passes the Go JNI `-javapkg=com.follow.clash.core`.\n- App label: `android/common/src/main/res/values/strings.xml:3` `app_name`. It is used in `AndroidManifest.xml:37,100` and the VPN session name at `VpnService.kt:131`.\n- Hardcoded \"FlClash\" in the notification: `android/service/.../models/NotificationParams.kt:4` and `modules/NotificationModule.kt:98`.\n- Launcher icons: `android/app/src/main/res/mipmap-*` (including the TV variants), `mipmap-anydpi-v26/ic_launcher*.xml` and `drawable/ic_launcher_foreground*.xml`.\n- Notification small icon: `android/service/src/main/res/drawable/ic_service.xml`, set at `NotificationModule.kt:97`.\n- Quick-settings tile icon: `android/service/src/main/res/drawable/ic.xml` (manifest `:99`). Shortcut icons are `drawable/ic_shortcut_*.xml`.\n- Deep links: `AndroidManifest.xml:63-74` (schemes `:69-71`, host `install-config` `:73`).\n\n**macOS**\n- `macos/Runner/Configs/AppInfo.xcconfig:8` `PRODUCT_NAME`, `:11` `PRODUCT_BUNDLE_IDENTIFIER`, `:14` copyright.\n- `Info.plist:28-33` URL schemes.\n- App icon: `macos/Runner/Assets.xcassets/AppIcon.appiconset`.\n- Menu bar icon: `assets/images/tray/macos/status_{1,4}.png` (plus the 2x/3x/4x folders), chosen in `lib/common/tray.dart:42-73`.\n\n**Windows**\n- `windows/CMakeLists.txt:3` `project(FlClash)`, `:7` `BINARY_NAME` (the exe name).\n- `windows/runner/main.cpp:52` window title.\n- `windows/runner/Runner.rc:55` icon `resources/app_icon.ico`, and `:92-98` CompanyName, FileDescription, OriginalFilename and ProductName.\n- `windows/packaging/exe/make_config.yaml`: `app_id` GUID (generate a new one), `app_name`, `display_name`, `executable_name`, `publisher`, `setup_icon_file`.\n- `windows/packaging/exe/inno_setup.iss:28` process names, `:41` helper exe, `:79` schemes.\n- Tray icons: `assets/images/tray/windows/status_1-4.ico`.\n- Shared icons: `assets/images/icon.png` and `icon.ico` (used by the About page, `lib/views/about.dart:162`).\n\n## 2. Navigation\n- Page enum: `lib/enum/enum.dart:558` `PageLabel`. Modes: `:204` `NavigationItemMode {mobile, desktop, more, moreFull}`.\n- Page registry: `lib/views/navigation.dart:12` `Navigation.getItems()`. Each `NavigationItem` has a `modes` list, defaulting to `[mobile, desktop]` (`lib/models/common.dart:19-28`). **To hide a page, set `modes: []`.**\n- Wiring: `lib/bootstrap.dart:45` sets `navigationPort = navigation`.\n- Filtering by width: `lib/providers/state/navigation.dart:4` `navigationItemsState`, `:24` `currentNavigationItemsState` (mobile when width ≤ 600), `:58` `navigationState`, `:85` the \"more\" tools list.\n- Shell: `lib/pages/home.dart:52` `_HomeShell` renders the mobile `NavigationDock` (`:94`) or `NavigationBar` (`:116`). The desktop sidebar is `lib/manager/app_manager.dart:142` `_Sidebar` → `NavigationSidebar`.\n- Current page: `lib/providers/app.dart:282` `CurrentPageLabel` (defaults to dashboard), `.toPage()` at `:289`.\n\n## 3. Dashboard\n- `lib/views/dashboard/dashboard.dart:26` `DashboardView`; `_DesktopDashboard` is at `:113`, `_MobileDashboard` at `:291`. Cards are listed in `widget_registry.dart` and stored in `appSetting.dashboardWidgets`.\n- Start button: `lib/views/dashboard/widgets/current_outbound.dart:698` `_StartToggle`. At `:757` it calls `ref.read(commonActionProvider.notifier).toggleRunning()` (`lib/providers/actions/common.dart:11`), which calls `setupActionProvider.setRunning()` (`lib/providers/actions/setup.dart:166`).\n- Running state: `isStartProvider` (`lib/providers/state/proxies.dart:152`). Uptime: `runTimeProvider` (`app.dart:204`).\n- Groups and selection, in `lib/providers/state/proxies.dart`: `currentGroupsState` `:4`, `selectedMap` `:215`, `proxyName(groupName)` `:242`, `selectedProxyName` `:250`.\n- Traffic: `trafficsProvider` and `totalTrafficProvider` (`app.dart:161,180`), refreshed by `CommonAction.updateTraffic` (`common.dart:~49`). Speed UI: `widgets/traffic.dart:100` `SpeedCard`, `:196` `NetworkSpeedCard`.\n\n## 4. Proxies\n- `lib/views/proxies/proxies.dart:13` `ProxiesView` switches between `tab.dart` and `list.dart`. Each proxy is drawn by `card.dart:43` `ProxyCard`.\n- Selecting a proxy: `card.dart:10` `selectGroupProxy()` → `proxiesActionProvider.changeProxyDebounce` (`lib/providers/actions/proxies.dart:94`) → `changeProxy` (`:178`) + `profilesAction.updateCurrentSelectedMap` (`lib/providers/actions/profiles.dart:10`).\n- Ping: `proxyDelayTest` `:318`, `delayTest` `:324`, `delayTestGroups` `:329`, `delayTestPageGroup` `:336`. The UI triggers are `tab.dart:98` and `card.dart:306`. Results come from `delayProvider` (`state/proxies.dart:189`). Default test URL: `constant.dart:127`.\n\n## 5. Profiles\n- Adding a profile, in `lib/providers/actions/profiles.dart`:\n  - `addProfileFromLink` `:352`. It calls `_showProfiles()` (`:345`), which forces `PageLabel.profiles`; change this if Profiles is hidden.\n  - `addProfilesFromLinks` `:378`, `addProfileFormFile` `:188`, `addProfileFormQrCode` `:455`.\n  - `putProfile` `:62` makes the first profile current automatically.\n  - The UI is `lib/views/profiles/add.dart`.\n- Deep links: `lib/common/link.dart` `LinkManager.initAppLinksListen` (`:60`, using `app_links`) and `_installConfigUrl` (`:31`). Only `<scheme>://install-config?url=` is handled.\n  - The callback is `lib/application.dart:89` `_initLink`. It shows a confirmation dialog and then calls `addProfileFromLink`; drop the dialog here for a smoother import.\n  - Desktop scheme registration: `lib/common/window.dart:39-44`.\n- `lib/common/link_receiver.dart` is not the deep-link handler. It is a LAN HTTP form that receives a link from a phone that scans a QR code.\n- Subscription info:\n  - `lib/models/profile.dart:17` `SubscriptionInfo` holds upload, download, total and expire. `.formHString` (`:28`) parses the header.\n  - Extensions `usage` and `expireDate` are at `:53`.\n  - The `subscription-userinfo` and `content-disposition` headers are read in `Profile.update` (`:186-194`).\n  - Stored through the drift converter `lib/database/profiles.dart:69`.\n  - `profile-update-interval` and `profile-title` are **not** parsed.\n- Auto-update:\n  - Default interval: `constant.dart:102` `defaultUpdateDuration = 1 day`.\n  - Per profile: `autoUpdateDuration`, edited in `views/profiles/edit.dart`.\n  - A 20-minute polling timer (`application.dart:118`) calls `autoUpdateProfiles` (`profiles.dart:42`).\n\n## 6. Theme\n- Seed: `constant.dart:166` `defaultPrimaryColor = 0xFF007AFF`. It feeds `DynamicColor` (`lib/providers/state/theme.dart:18`, seeded in `bootstrap.dart:72`).\n- Scheme: `genColorScheme` (`theme.dart:~41`). The user's `ThemeProps.primaryColor` overrides the seed.\n- Model: `lib/models/config.dart:471` `ThemeProps` (themeMode, colorStyle, pureBlack, fontFamily). Defaults at `:89`.\n- ThemeData: `lib/manager/theme_manager.dart:41` `watchAppTheme` (font is `themeSetting.fontFamily`). The Theme settings UI is `lib/views/theme.dart`.\n- **To force a brand color:** set `defaultPrimaryColor` (and `defaultPrimaryColors`) and pass a fixed `color:` / `ignoreConfig` in `genColorScheme`, or hide the Theme settings page. Fonts in `pubspec.yaml:112-118` are only JetBrainsMono and Twemoji; add a brand font there.\n\n## 7. Localization\n- Russian is supported: `arb/intl_ru.arb` (967 lines, the same as en). Locale list: `lib/l10n/l10n.dart:8060`.\n- Default locale: `appSetting.locale` (null means follow the system), via `getLocaleForString` (`lib/common/app_localizations.dart:116`). It is applied in `bootstrap.dart:142-145` (falls back to `platformDispatcher.locale`) and `application.dart:183`. The language picker is in `lib/views/tools.dart:124`.\n\n## 8. First-run dialogs\n`bootstrap.dart` start sequence:\n- `:177` `_handleFailedPreference` (shown only if the cache is corrupt).\n- `:178` disclaimer: `_handlerDisclaimer` (`:244`) → `requestDisclaimerConsent()` (`lib/views/disclaimer.dart:10`). It is gated by `disclaimerVersion` (`constant.dart:34`) against `acceptedDisclaimerVersion` (`config.dart:260`). Env bypass: `FLCLASH_ACCEPT_DISCLAIMER` (`:238`).\n- `:181` crash-recovery tip.\n- `:189` location permission refresh.\n- The deep-link confirmation dialog at `application.dart:89`.\n\n## Recommendation (least invasive)\n1. Create `lib/views/nexo_home.dart` (`NexoHomeView`): a big button calling `commonActionProvider.toggleRunning()`, watching `isStartProvider`, `currentGroupsStateProvider`, `selectedProxyNameProvider` and `trafficsProvider`, with a country list that calls `selectGroupProxy` / `changeProxyDebounce`. Read subscription info from the current profile.\n2. In `lib/views/navigation.dart:17`, keep `PageLabel.dashboard` but point its builder at `NexoHomeView`. That label is the default in `CurrentPageLabel` and the back-button target in `home.dart:435`, so no enum changes are needed.\n3. Set `modes: []` on proxies, profiles, requests, connections, dns, resources and logs. Keep `tools` and treat it as \"Settings\". Inside `ToolsView` (`lib/views/tools.dart:43` area), add an \"Advanced\" item that pushes the existing views (`ProxiesView`, `ProfilesView`, and so on) as routes.\n4. Change `_showProfiles` (`profiles.dart:345`) to go to the dashboard. Optionally skip the deep-link confirm dialog and the disclaimer.\n5. Rename user-visible strings and icons only; keep the package, Go and helper identifiers."},"timestamp":"2026-11-02T16:10:37.285Z","isMeta":true,"reminderId":"a8250cff346b0b92"