cons `assets/images/tray/macos/status_{1,4}.png` and the 2x/3x/4x folders —\n  monochrome template images (black knot on transparent), check `lib/common/tray.dart:42-73` for what each status means.\n- Windows: `windows/CMakeLists.txt` project/BINARY_NAME → `Nexo` (then update every place that refers to the exe name:\n  inno_setup.iss process names :28, make_config.yaml, any Dart code that spawns/kills or checks the exe by name —\n  grep for `FlClash.exe` and `\"FlClash\"` across lib/, windows/, services/, tool/, setup.dart, plugins/);\n  `windows/runner/main.cpp:52` window title; `windows/runner/Runner.rc` CompanyName `Nexo`, FileDescription,\n  OriginalFilename, ProductName; `resources/app_icon.ico` multi-size (16–256) from icon.png;\n  `windows/packaging/exe/make_config.yaml` new random `app_id` GUID, app_name, display_name, executable_name,\n  publisher `Nexo`, setup_icon_file; tray icons `assets/images/tray/windows/status_1-4.ico` (knot, colored per status\n  like the originals). `assets/images/icon.png` / `icon.ico` (About page) → Nexo icon.\n- Linux is out of scope; do not spend effort there (leave as is unless a shared file forces it).\n\n## Licence\nGPL-3.0 requires keeping copyright and licence notices. Do not remove LICENSE or upstream credits. In\n`lib/views/about.dart` keep the existing project credits and add a line that Nexo is based on FlClash (GPL-3.0) with\na link to https://github.com/chen08209/FlClash and our source https://github.com/Shahen777/nexo-app.\nReplace README.md with a short Russian+English README for Nexo stating this, how to build (same as upstream), and\ncredits.\n\n## Done means\nAll the above edited consistently; a final report listing every file changed, every name you deliberately left as\nFlClash and why, and anything you could not do (e.g. an icon you could not rasterize). Keep the report short.\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"5e3d2dfc-643d-453a-b32a-bf5e6a5b1f49","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"other"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/Sagenkazaran/Library/Application Support/Claude/scratch-workspaces/f907b165-4712-485f-a44b-7f7d54b74cf9/77d6453f-aaee-4ad3-a7ea-34b17cbaf2e5/scratch-2026-10-26-b13584","sessionId":"1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"deep-singing-taco"}
{"parentUuid":"1aec1391-2baa-408b-8850-e5f3f6848bd4","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgePxWkjLFXpNdupUf77V","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01FayifoRXWQH7YVubxoYoP5","name":"Write","input":{"file_path":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-Sagenkazaran-Library-Application-Support-Claude-scratch-workspaces-f907b165-4712-485f-a44b-7f7d54b74cf9-77d6453f-aaee-4ad3-a7ea-34b17cbaf2e5-scratch-2026-10-26-b13584/1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb/scratchpad/codex/home.md","content":"# Task: a simple, beautiful Happ-like home screen for \"Nexo\" (this FlClash fork)\n\nYou are working in a git worktree of github.com/Shahen777/nexo-app, a GPL-3.0 fork of FlClash (Flutter + Go mihomo\ncore, Riverpod, drift). We are turning it into \"Nexo\", the client app of our paid VPN service for Russian users who\nare not technical. Another agent is rebranding names/ids/icons in parallel in a different worktree: do NOT touch\n`lib/common/constant.dart`, `lib/common/protocol.dart`, `android/`, `macos/`, `windows/`, `assets/images/`.\n\nFlutter, Dart and Go are NOT installed here; CI builds later. You cannot run codegen (build_runner), so do NOT add\nor change anything that needs generated code (no new `@riverpod` providers, freezed models, drift tables, arb keys\nthat need gen-l10n). Use existing providers/actions and plain `ConsumerWidget`/`ConsumerStatefulWidget`; hardcode\nRussian UI strings in a small `lib/views/nexo/strings.dart` const class. Write code that compiles against Flutter\n3.47 / Dart 3.11 — re-read the signatures of every provider/method you call. Follow the repo's AGENTS.md style rules\n(superellipse shapes via `lib/ui/shape.dart` tokens, comment density) but our commits will carry our own trailers.\nDo NOT commit or push; leave changes in the working tree.\n\n## How our service delivers config\nThe user gets a subscription URL `https://<host>/nexo/sub/<token>` (mihomo YAML). It contains:\n- proxy group `Nexo` (type select): first option `Автовыбор`, then each server by name, names start with a flag\n  emoji, e.g. `🇦🇹 Nexo — Вена Fast`, `🇧🇷 Nexo — Бразилия`;\n- group `Автовыбор` (url-test over all servers);\n- our routing rules and DNS (the app must not override them by default);\n- header `subscription-userinfo` with `expire=<unix>` when the paid period has an end (absent = unlimited).\nDeep link to import: `nexo://install-config?url=<urlencoded subscription url>` (scheme added by the other agent; the\nhandler `lib/common/link.dart` already parses `<scheme>://install-config?url=`).\n\n## Build (map already researched — verify yourself)\n1. `lib/views/nexo/home.dart` `NexoHomeView`, wired as the builder of `PageLabel.dashboard` in\n   `lib/views/navigation.dart` (~:17). Hide pages by `modes: []` for proxies, profiles, requests, connections, dns,\n   resources, logs. Keep `tools` as the second (and last) tab and label it «Настройки»; inside `ToolsView`\n   (`lib/views/tools.dart`) add a section «Расширенные» that pushes the existing Proxies, Profiles, Connections,\n   Logs views as routes, so nothing is lost for power users.\n2. Home layout (mobile first, also good on desktop where it is centered, max width ~440):\n   - Top: Nexo wordmark (Unbounded) + small status line.\n   - Center: one big round connect button (~200 dp). States: off (white/outlined, «Подключить»), connecting\n     (animated ring), on (filled brand blue `#2F6BFF`, «Подключено» + uptime from `runTimeProvider`). Calls\n     `ref.read(commonActionProvider.notifier).toggleRunning()`; state from `isStartProvider`. Haptic on tap (mobile).\n   - Below: a server card showing the current choice of group `Nexo` (flag + name; for `Автовыбор` also show which\n     server it picked now via the url-test group's current proxy) and its ping; tap opens a bottom sheet (dialog on\n     desktop) listing `Автовыбор` first then each server with flag, name, ping, a check on the selected one; tapping\n     selects via the existing select action (`selectGroupProxy` / `proxiesActionProvider.changeProxyDebounce` —\n     see `lib/views/proxies/card.dart`) and a \"проверить скорость\" action runs the group delay test.\n   - Info row: «Осталось N дней» / «Доступ без срока» from the current profile's `SubscriptionInfo.expire`\n     (`lib/models/profile.dart`), turning orange under 3 days; and live ↓/↑ speed from `trafficsProvider`.\n   - Empty state when there is no profile: friendly text «Добавьте ключ доступа», buttons «Вставить ссылку» (reads\n     clipboard, accepts a https URL or a `nexo://install-config?url=` link, then `addProfileFromLink`) and\n     «Сканировать QR» (existing `addProfileFormQrCode`) on mobile; small text «Ключ — в веб-кабинете или в\n     Telegram-боте».\n3. Import flow: `lib/application.dart` `_initLink` (~:89) — import without the confirmation dialog when the scheme is\n   `nexo`; keep the dialog for other schemes. `_showProfiles()` in `lib/providers/actions/profiles.dart` (~:345) must\n   go to the dashboard instead of Profiles. After the first profile is added, make sure it becomes current (check\n   `putProfile`) and set its auto-update interval to 6 hours if that is set per profile at creation.\n4. Fonts: add `assets/fonts/nexo/Unbounded-Variable.ttf` and `Manrope-Variable.ttf` (already present, variable\n   `wght` axis) to `pubspec.yaml` fonts as families `Unbounded` and `Manrope`; use Manrope for body text in our new\n   screens (set `fontVariations: [FontVariation('wght', w)]` matching the weight, since these are variable fonts).\n   Do not change the global app theme font in this task.\n5. Look and feel: light background `#F5F7FB`, cards white with soft shadow, text navy `#0B1F3A`, accent `#2F6BFF`;\n   in dark mode background `#0B1F3A`, cards `#13294A`. Calm and clean, like Happ/modern iOS — no gradients\n   everywhere, one accent color, generous spacing, 48 dp+ tap targets, smooth 200–300 ms animations.\n6. Default language Russian: in `bootstrap.dart` / app locale fallback, if the user never chose a locale and the\n   system locale is not supported, use `ru` (keep following the system when it is supported).\n7. First launch: skip the upstream disclaimer dialog (`bootstrap.dart` `_handlerDisclaimer`) — treat it as accepted.\n\n## Done means\nThe new screen and flows implemented, everything else of FlClash still reachable from «Настройки → Расширенные».\nFinal report: files changed, the providers/actions you used with their file:line, any API you were unsure compiles\n(list them so I can check in CI), and anything left undone. Keep it short.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1585,"cache_read_input_tokens":206457,"output_tokens":5370,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":406},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1585,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":5370,"cache_read_input_tokens":206457,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1585,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1585},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01FayifoRXWQH7YVubxoYoP5":{"file_path":"/private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-Sagenkazaran-Library-Application-Support-Claude-scratch-workspaces-f907b165-4712-485f-a44b-7f7d54b74cf9-77d6453f-aaee-4ad3-a7ea-34b17cbaf2e5-scratch-2026-10-26-b13584/1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb/scratchpad/codex/home.md","content":"# Task: a simple, beautiful Happ-like home screen for \"Nexo\" (this FlClash fork)\n\nYou are working in a git worktree of github.com/Shahen777/nexo-app, a GPL-3.0 fork of FlClash (Flutter + Go mihomo\ncore, Riverpod, drift). We are turning it into \"Nexo\", the client app of our paid VPN service for Russian users who\nare not technical. Another agent is rebranding names/ids/icons in parallel in a different worktree: do NOT touch\n`lib/common/constant.dart`, `lib/common/protocol.dart`, `android/`, `macos/`, `windows/`, `assets/images/`.\n\nFlutter, Dart and Go are NOT installed here; CI builds later. You cannot run codegen (build_runner), so do NOT add\nor change anything that needs generated code (no new `@riverpod` providers, freezed models, drift tables, arb keys\nthat need gen-l10n). Use existing providers/actions and plain `ConsumerWidget`/`ConsumerStatefulWidget`; hardcode\nRussian UI strings in a small `lib/views/nexo/strings.dart` const class. Write code that compiles against Flutter\n3.47 / Dart 3.11 — re-read the signatures of every provider/method you call. Follow the repo's AGENTS.md style rules\n(superellipse shapes via `lib/ui/shape.dart` tokens, comment density) but our commits will carry our own trailers.\nDo NOT commit or push; leave changes in the working tree.\n\n## How our service delivers config\nThe user gets a subscription URL `https://<host>/nexo/sub/<token>` (mihomo YAML). It contains:\n- proxy group `Nexo` (type select): first option `Автовыбор`, then each server by name, names start with a flag\n  emoji, e.g. `🇦🇹 Nexo — Вена Fast`, `🇧🇷 Nexo — Бразилия`;\n- group `Автовыбор` (url-test over all servers);\n- our routing rules and DNS (the app must not override them by default);\n- header `subscription-userinfo` with `expire=<unix>` when the paid period has an end (absent = unlimited).\nDeep link to import: `nexo://install-config?url=<urlencoded subscription url>` (scheme added by the other agent; the\nhandler `lib/common/link.dart` already parses `<scheme>://install-config?url=`).\n\n## Build (map already researched — verify yourself)\n1. `lib/views/nexo/home.dart` `NexoHomeView`, wired as the builder of `PageLabel.dashboard` in\n   `lib/views/navigation.dart` (~:17). Hide pages by `modes: []` for proxies, profiles, requests, connections, dns,\n   resources, logs. Keep `tools` as the second (and last) tab and label it «Настройки»; inside `ToolsView`\n   (`lib/views/tools.dart`) add a section «Расширенные» that pushes the existing Proxies, Profiles, Connections,\n   Logs views as routes, so nothing is lost for power users.\n2. Home layout (mobile first, also good on desktop where it is centered, max width ~440):\n   - Top: Nexo wordmark (Unbounded) + small status line.\n   - Center: one big round connect button (~200 dp). States: off (white/outlined, «Подключить»), connecting\n     (animated ring), on (filled brand blue `#2F6BFF`, «Подключено» + uptime from `runTimeProvider`). Calls\n     `ref.read(commonActionProvider.notifier).toggleRunning()`; state from `isStartProvider`. Haptic on tap (mobile).\n   - Below: a server card showing the current choice of group `Nexo` (flag + name; for `Автовыбор` also show which\n     server it picked now via the url-test group's current proxy) and its ping; tap opens a bottom sheet (dialog on\n     desktop) listing `Автовыбор` first then each server with flag, name, ping, a check on the selected one; tapping\n     selects via the existing select action (`selectGroupProxy` / `proxiesActionProvider.changeProxyDebounce` —\n     see `lib/views/proxies/card.dart`) and a \"проверить скорость\" action runs the group delay test.\n   - Info row: «Осталось N дней» / «Доступ без срока» from the current profile's `SubscriptionInfo.expire`\n     (`lib/models/profile.dart`), turning orange under 3 days; and live ↓/↑ speed from `trafficsProvider`.\n   - Empty state when there is no profile: friendly text «Добавьте ключ доступа», buttons «Вставить ссылку» (reads\n     clipboard, accepts a https URL or a `nexo://install-config?url=` link, then `addProfileFromLink`) and\n     «Сканировать QR» (existing `addProfileFormQrCode`) on mobile; small text «Ключ — в веб-кабинете или в\n     Telegram-боте».\n3. Import flow: `lib/application.dart` `_initLink` (~:89) — import without the confirmation dialog when the scheme is\n   `nexo`; keep the dialog for other schemes. `_showProfiles()` in `lib/providers/actions/profiles.dart` (~:345) must\n   go to the dashboard instead of Profiles. After the first profile is added, make sure it becomes current (check\n   `putProfile`) and set its auto-update interval to 6 hours if that is set per profile at creation.\n4. Fonts: add `assets/fonts/nexo/Unbounded-Variable.ttf` and `Manrope-Variable.ttf` (already present, variable\n   `wght` axis) to `pubspec.yaml` fonts as families `Unbounded` and `Manrope`; use Manrope for body text in our new\n   screens (set `fontVariations: [FontVariation('wght', w)]` matching the weight, since these are variable fonts).\n   Do not change the global app theme font in this task.\n5. Look and feel: light background `#F5F7FB`, cards white with soft shadow, text navy `#0B1F3A`, accent `#2F6BFF`;\n   in dark mode background `#0B1F3A`, cards `#13294A`. Calm and clean, like Happ/modern iOS — no gradients\n   everywhere, one accent color, generous spacing, 48 dp+ tap targets, smooth 200–300 ms animations.\n6. Default language Russian: in `bootstrap.dart` / app locale fallback, if the user never chose a locale and the\n   system locale is not supported, use `ru` (keep following the system when it is supported).\n7. First launch: skip the upstream disclaimer dialog (`bootstrap.dart` `_handlerDisclaimer`) — treat it as accepted.\n\n## Done means\nThe new screen and flows implemented, everything else of FlClash still reachable from «Настройки → Расширенные».\nFinal report: files changed, the providers/actions you used with their file:line, any API you were unsure compiles\n(list them so I can check in CI), and anything left undone. Keep it short.\n"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"d38d5fd3-aab0-4169-ba0a-d659dda25bec","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011CgePxWGDfpVU4mv1hmF2S","requestRef":"5bef5b6e-9e68-48fe-bc57-9fc0c1b9db01","req