{"parentUuid":"c0a253bf-b019-478d-969c-933d7fdd478b","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"3b9d0d5e-1848-4eae-b42a-febe9cc9c0e1","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QMEgW9KzVGU1SeYZuCkrbX","type":"tool_result","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Plan shown (10 steps). Keep only one step in_progress."}]}]},"uuid":"01c6f7b8-8dd1-460c-9d1a-c3e37f5ed32f","timestamp":"2026-11-02T16:14:18.795Z","toolUseResult":[{"type":"text","text":"Plan shown (10 steps). Keep only one step in_progress."}],"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"c0a253bf-b019-478d-969c-933d7fdd478b","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"rule","ruleSource":"cliArg"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/Sagenkazaran/Library/Application Support/Claude/scratch-workspaces/f907b165-4712-485f-a44b-7f7d54b74cf9/77d6453f-aaee-4ad3-a7ea-34b17cbaf2e5/scratch-2026-10-26-b13584","sessionId":"1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"deep-singing-taco"}
{"parentUuid":"01c6f7b8-8dd1-460c-9d1a-c3e37f5ed32f","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgeQ4MX2w6ijTziY7aJhe","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_0155vzsSvLp25Ur7CGad4V2k","name":"mcp__obsidian__obsidian_edit_note","input":{"vault":"vault","path":"Проекты/VPN-инфраструктура.md","operation":"append","content":"\n### 2026-11-02 — Nexo app: старт\n- Репозиторий: https://github.com/Shahen777/nexo-app (публичный форк FlClash, GPL-3.0). Локально `~/Projects/nexo-app`.\n- Облачная сборка: workflow `nexo-build` (вручную, Actions) — Android APK, macOS dmg, Windows exe. Апстрим-проверки отключены от push.\n- Сервер: новая подписка `/nexo/sub/<token>` (mihomo YAML): группа `Nexo` (Автовыбор + серверы), url-test `Автовыбор`, наши правила РФ (госуслуги/банки/маркетплейсы и локальные сети напрямую), DNS через VPN, `expire` в subscription-userinfo. Коммит d58201a. Проверено реальным mihomo: ozon → DIRECT, остальное → Вена.\n- По просьбе Шагена работу над приложением делят агенты Codex (экономия токенов): ветка `nexo/brand` (имя, id app.nexo.vpn, иконки) и `nexo/home` (простой главный экран как в Happ, импорт по nexo://, русский язык). Claude координирует, проверяет, собирает.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1859,"cache_read_input_tokens":213841,"output_tokens":963,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":36},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1859,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":963,"cache_read_input_tokens":213841,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1859,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1859},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"