{"parentUuid":"c20518d0-deee-4914-ba9f-1e8f19d677b4","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"ab579993-eb99-47ec-99b7-78254132785e","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Xf8twEyx7GvrvxGSRerhsx","type":"tool_result","content":"home exit 0\nГосподин Шаген, готово. Новый Nexo Home реализован, коммиты и push не выполнялись.\n\n- UI и навигация: [home.dart](/Users/Sagenkazaran/Projects/nexo-app-home/lib/views/nexo/home.dart:47), [strings.dart](/Users/Sagenkazaran/Projects/nexo-app-home/lib/views/nexo/strings.dart:1), [navigation.dart](/Users/Sagenkazaran/Projects/nexo-app-home/lib/views/navigation.dart:18), [tools.dart](/Users/Sagenkazaran/Projects/nexo-app-home/lib/views/tools.dart:69), [views.dart](/Users/Sagenkazaran/Projects/nexo-app-home/lib/views/views.dart:1), [pages/home.dart](/Users/Sagenkazaran/Projects/nexo-app-home/lib/pages/home.dart:1), [app_manager.dart](/Users/Sagenkazaran/Projects/nexo-app-home/lib/manager/app_manager.dart:1).\n- Импорт и первый запуск: [application.dart](/Users/Sagenkazaran/Projects/nexo-app-home/lib/application.dart:89), [link.dart](/Users/Sagenkazaran/Projects/nexo-app-home/lib/common/link.dart:59), [profiles.dart](/Users/Sagenkazaran/Projects/nexo-app-home/lib/providers/actions/profiles.dart:347), [bootstrap.dart](/Users/Sagenkazaran/Projects/nexo-app-home/lib/bootstrap.dart:25).\n- Шрифты: [pubspec.yaml](/Users/Sagenkazaran/Projects/nexo-app-home/pubspec.yaml:120), `assets/fonts/nexo/`.\n- Тесты обновлены: `application_test.dart`, `link_test.dart`, `home_test.dart`, `profiles_action_test.dart`, `state_derived_test.dart`.\n\nИспользованы:\n\n- `toggleRunning()` — [common.dart](/Users/Sagenkazaran/Projects/nexo-app-home/lib/providers/actions/common.dart:11).\n- `isStart`, `delay`, `proxyName`, `selectedProxyName` — [proxies.dart](/Users/Sagenkazaran/Projects/nexo-app-home/lib/providers/state/proxies.dart:153).\n- `changeProxyDebounce` и `delayTestPageGroup` — [actions/proxies.dart](/Users/Sagenkazaran/Projects/nexo-app-home/lib/providers/actions/proxies.dart:94).\n- `groupsProvider`, `trafficsProvider`, `runTimeProvider`, `coreStatusProvider`, `delayTestingGroupsProvider` — [app.dart](/Users/Sagenkazaran/Projects/nexo-app-home/lib/providers/app.dart:161).\n- `currentProfileProvider`, `putProfile`, импорт ссылки и QR — [state/profile.dart](/Users/Sagenkazaran/Projects/nexo-app-home/lib/providers/state/profile.dart:11), [actions/profiles.dart](/Users/Sagenkazaran/Projects/nexo-app-home/lib/providers/actions/profiles.dart:64).\n\nСтатические проверки, YAML, шрифты, comment-density и проверка защищённых путей прошли. По прочитанным сигнатурам сомнительных API не осталось, но `flutter pub get`, analyze и тесты локально не запускались: Flutter, Dart и Go отсутствуют. Визуальная проверка на устройстве остаётся CI/ручному запуску. Запись в Obsidian не сохранилась — клиент отменил MCP-вызов.\n[exited with code 0]\n M lib/application.dart\n M lib/bootstrap.dart\n M lib/common/link.dart\n M lib/manager/app_manager.dart\n M lib/pages/home.dart\n M lib/providers/actions/profiles.dart\n M lib/views/navigation.dart\n M lib/views/tools.dart\n M lib/views/views.dart\n M pubspec.yaml\n M test/application_test.dart\n M test/common/link_test.dart\n M test/pages/home_test.dart\n M test/providers/profiles_action_test.dart\n M test/providers/state_derived_test.dart\n?? assets/fonts/nexo/\n?? lib/views/nexo/\n test/providers/state_derived_test.dart   |  6 +-\n 15 files changed, 206 insertions(+), 65 deletions(-)\nShell cwd was reset to /Users/Sagenkazaran/Library/Application Support/Claude/scratch-workspaces/f907b165-4712-485f-a44b-7f7d54b74cf9/77d6453f-aaee-4ad3-a7ea-34b17cbaf2e5/scratch-2026-10-26-b13584","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"3208081d-4a19-4e6d-b4cd-5a80bb01badc","timestamp":"2026-11-02T16:29:59.265Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"home exit 0\nГосподин Шаген, готово. Новый Nexo Home реализован, коммиты и push не выполнялись.\n\n- UI и навигация: [home.dart](/Users/Sagenkazaran/Projects/