{"parentUuid":"24a3b841-409d-4ad7-8132-b315b560b362","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgeVMbUiz8TXbbiovtqQq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_013CsdVyihwWJEg2iupYzH1t","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"C=/private/tmp/claude-501/REDACTED/1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb/scratchpad/codex; sed -n 7190,7440p /tmp/dart.log | sed -E 's/^[0-9TZ:.-]+ //' > $C/test-failures.log; wc -l $C/test-failures.log; cd ~/Projects/nexo-app && git pull -q origin main; git worktree add -q ../nexo-app-tests -b nexo/tests && cat > $C/tests.md <<EOF\n# Task: make the 8 failing Flutter tests pass in this Nexo fork of FlClash\n\nThis worktree is github.com/Shahen777/nexo-app (GPL fork of FlClash). We rebranded it to \"Nexo\" (app name, ids\napp.nexo.vpn, icons, primary color 0xFF2F6BFF, nexo:// scheme added first) and added a simple home screen\n(lib/views/nexo/), changed navigation, deep-link import and profile actions. CI now has 8 failing tests (of ~4400).\nFull failure output is in $C/test-failures.log — read it first.\n\nFlutter/Dart are NOT installed here, so reason from the log and the code. For each failure decide:\n- the test asserts the old upstream branding/behaviour we changed on purpose (name, color, icon geometry, scheme\n  list, user agent string) → update the test expectation to the new intended value; or\n- our change broke real behaviour (e.g. share-link import, maximized-window home controls) → fix the code, keeping\n  the Nexo behaviour (nexo:// imports without dialog, Nexo home as dashboard).\nFor the TV launcher icon test, fix the icon (vector/geometry) if the icon really sits outside the safe zone,\nrather than loosening the test.\nKeep changes minimal and in the repo's style (see AGENTS.md; ignore its commit-trailer rule, you do not commit).\nDo NOT commit or push. Keep any formatting dart-format compatible (2-space indent, trailing commas).\n\nReport: per failing test — cause, what you changed (file:line), and confidence that it now passes. Keep it short.\nEOF\necho ok","description":"Extract failures and prepare a Codex test-fix task"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2126,"cache_read_input_tokens":256349,"output_tokens":1250,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":245},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2126,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1250,"cache_read_input_tokens":256349,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2126,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2126},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_013CsdVyihwWJEg2iupYzH1t":{"command":"C=/private/tmp/claude-501/REDACTED/1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb/scratchpad/codex; sed -n 7190,7440p /tmp/dart.log | sed -E 's/^[0-9TZ:.-]+ //' > $C/test-failures.log; wc -l $C/test-failures.log; cd ~/Projects/nexo-app && git pull -q origin main; git worktree add -q ../nexo-app-tests -b nexo/tests && cat > $C/tests.md <<EOF\n# Task: make the 8 failing Flutter tests pass in this Nexo fork of FlClash\n\nThis worktree is github.com/Shahen777/nexo-app (GPL fork of FlClash). We rebranded it to \"Nexo\" (app name, ids\napp.nexo.vpn, icons, primary color 0xFF2F6BFF, nexo:// scheme added first) and added a simple home screen\n(lib/views/nexo/), changed navigation, deep-link import and profile actions. CI now has 8 failing tests (of ~4400).\nFull failure output is in $C/test-failures.log — read it first.\n\nFlutter/Dart are NOT installed here, so reason from the log and the code. For each failure decide:\n- the test asserts the old upstream branding/behav