{"parentUuid":"ef073f4c-6989-43f9-b181-27fec8575721","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cgeh2oSfxPFMjfjqHowWe","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01F61oP2Vpg1pzjVjKzAA7yu","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"C=/private/tmp/claude-501/REDACTED/1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb/scratchpad/codex; cd ~/Projects/nexo-app && git pull -q origin main && git worktree add -q ../nexo-app-polish -b nexo/polish && cat > $C/polish.md <<'EOF'\n# Task: four polish fixes for the Nexo app (FlClash fork)\n\nRepo worktree of github.com/Shahen777/nexo-app. Nexo is our VPN client: Flutter 3.47.6 + Go mihomo core. Our home\nscreen is `lib/views/nexo/home.dart` (+ `strings.dart`), wired as `PageLabel.dashboard` in `lib/views/navigation.dart`;\n\"Настройки\" is the tools page with an «Расширенные» section. Flutter/Dart/Go/Xcode are NOT installed here — reason\nfrom the code; CI runs analyze + ~4400 tests and builds. Follow AGENTS.md style (ignore its commit-trailer rule).\nDo NOT commit or push. Keep dart-format style. Update/add tests where the repo already tests the area.\n\n1. **First launch opens «Настройки» instead of the home screen.** On a fresh macOS install (no profile yet, desktop\n   window ~490×810) the app showed the tools/Settings tab selected. Find why (initial `CurrentPageLabel`\n   (`lib/providers/app.dart` ~:282), restored page from preferences, navigation filtering in\n   `lib/providers/state/navigation.dart`, `_showProfiles` / profile-import redirects, the hidden pages with\n   `modes: []` falling back to the last item, etc.) and make the app always open on the home screen\n   (PageLabel.dashboard) at start, on every platform. After importing a key it must also land on home (it already\n   does — keep that).\n2. **Server card label for the auto choice.** When group `Nexo` has `Автовыбор` selected, the card currently shows\n   only the resolved server (e.g. «Nexo — Вена Fast»). Show «Автовыбор» as the title and the resolved server as a\n   smaller second line, e.g. «Сейчас: Вена Fast» (strip the leading flag and the «Nexo — » prefix for display), with\n   that server's flag in the round mark. When a specific server is selected, title = server name without the\n   «Nexo — » prefix. Apply the same display-name cleanup in the server picker list.\n3. **macOS app icon** (`macos/Runner/Assets.xcassets/AppIcon.appiconset/*`, sizes 16–1024): today it is a full-bleed\n   square. Make it a proper macOS icon: transparent canvas, the artwork inside a continuous rounded rectangle\n   (superellipse-like) inset like Apple's template (on 1024: ~824×824 body centered, corner radius ~185, a soft\n   drop shadow is optional), navy `#0B1F3A` body with the existing blue knot. Generate every size from one master.\n   Tools available: `sips`, `python3` stdlib (no Pillow), `qlmanage`, `swift` may be available (CoreGraphics via a\n   small swift script is a good option — check `which swift`). Source art: `assets_source/nexo/knot.svg`,\n   current icons in the appiconset. Keep Contents.json valid.\n4. **DMG name for the universal build.** CI sets `NEXO_MAC_UNIVERSAL: 1` in the macOS job env\n   (`.github/workflows/nexo.yaml`) and the produced file is named like `Nexo-0.9.2-macos-amd64.dmg` because\n   `setup.dart` uses the host arch (`_detectArch`, the `--description` arg). When that env var is `1` and the\n   platform is macos, use `universal` instead of the host arch in the artifact name. Nothing else should change.\n\nReport briefly per item: cause/what changed (file:line) and anything unsure for CI.\nEOF\ncodex exec -m gpt-6.1-terra -s workspace-write -C ~/Projects/nexo-app-polish -o $C/polish-report.md - < $C/polish.md > $C/polish.log 2>&1; echo \"exit $?\"; cat $C/polish-report.md","description":"Run Codex agent for the four polish fixes","run_in_background":true},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":486,"cache_read_input_tokens":341368,"output_tokens":2182,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":362},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":486,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":2182,"cache_read_input_tokens":341368,"cache_creation_input_tokens":486,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":486},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01F61oP2Vpg1pzjVjKzAA7yu":{"command":"C=/private/tmp/claude-501/REDACTED/1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb/scratchpad/codex; cd ~/Projects/nexo-app && git pull -q origin main && git worktree add -q ../nexo-app-polish -b nexo/polish && cat > $C/polish.md <<'EOF'\n# Task: four polish fixes for the Nexo app (FlClash fork)\n\nRepo worktree of github.com/Shahen777/nexo-app. Nexo is our VPN client: Flutter 3.47.6 + Go mihomo core. Our home\nscreen is `lib/views/nexo/home.dart` (+ `strings.dart`), wired as `PageLabel.dashboard` in `lib/views/navigation.dart`;\n\"Настройки\" is the tools page with an «Расширенные» section. Flutter/Dart/Go/Xcode are NOT installed here — reason\nfrom the code; CI runs analyze + ~4400 tests and builds. Follow AGENTS.md style (ignore its commit-trailer rule).\nDo NOT commit or push. Keep dart-format style. Update/add tests where the repo already tests the area.\n\n1. **First launch opens «Настройки» instead of the home screen.** On a fresh macOS install (no profile yet, desktop\n   window ~490×810) the app showed the tools/Settings tab selected. Find why (initial `CurrentPageLabel`\n   (`lib/providers/app.dart` ~:282), restored page from preferences, navigation filtering in\n   `lib/providers/state/navigation.dart`, `_showProfiles` / profile-import redirects, the hidden pages with\n   `modes: []` falling back to the last item, etc.) and make the app always open on the home screen\n   (PageLabel.dashboard) at start, on every platform. After importing a key it must also land on home (it already\n   does — keep that).\n2. **Server card label for the auto choice.** When group `Nexo` has `Автовыбор` selected, the card currently shows\n   only the resolved server (e.g. «Nexo — Вена Fast»). Show «Автовыбор» as the title and the resolved server as a\n   smaller second line, e.g. «Сейчас: Вена Fast» (strip the leading flag and the «Nexo — » prefix for display), with\n   that server's flag in the round mark. When a specific server is selected, title = server name without the\n   «Nexo — » prefix. Apply the same display-name cleanup in the server picker list.\n3. **macOS app icon** (`macos/Runner/Assets.xcassets/AppIcon.appiconset/*`, sizes 16–1024): today it is a full-bleed\n   square. Make it a proper macOS icon: transparent canvas, the artwork inside a continuous rounded rectangle\n   (superellipse-like) inset like Apple's template (on 1024: ~824×824 body centered, corner radius ~185, a soft\n   drop shadow is optional), navy `#0B1F3A` body with the existing blue knot. Generate every size from one master.\n   Tools available: `sips`, `python3` stdlib (no Pillow), `qlmanage`, `swift` may be available (CoreGraphics via a\n   small swift script is a good option — check `which swift`). Source art: `assets_source/nexo/knot.svg`,\n   current icons in the appiconset. Keep Contents.json valid.\n4. **DMG name for the universal build.** CI sets `NEXO_MAC_UNIVERSAL: 1` in the macOS job env\n   (`.github/workflows/nexo.yaml`) and the produced file is named like `Nexo-0.9.2-macos-amd64.dmg` because\n   `setup.dart` uses the host arch (`_detectArch`, the `--description` arg). When that env var is `1` and the\n   platform is macos, use `universal` instead of the host arch in the artifact name. Nothing else should change.\n\nReport briefly per item: cause/what changed (file:line) and anything unsure for CI.\nEOF\ncodex exec -m gpt-6.1-terra -s workspace-write -C ~/Projects/nexo-app-polish -o $C/polish-report.md - < $C/polish.md > $C/polish.log 2>&1; echo \"exit $?\"; cat $C/polish-report.md","description":"Run Codex agent for the four polish fixes","run_in_background":true}},"serverClassifierRequest":"cfea03f5-dfb2-4069-a08e-d805be193db9","apiBlockIndex":2,"requestId":"req_011Cgeh2oA4L21EcRhar4VQR","requestRef":"55ee7ce9-4232-40e9-8349-0f89b541c933","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"a4a7d8ea-4201-48b3-810a-c0638c9abcc9","timestamp":"2026-11-02T19:57:12.042Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/Sagenkazaran/Library/Application Support/Claude/scratch-workspaces/f907b165-4712-485f-a44b-7f7d54b74cf9/77d6453f-aaee-4ad3-a7ea-34b17cbaf2e5/scratch-2026-10-26-b13584","sessionId":"1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"deep-singing-taco"}
