{"parentUuid":"31186867-96df-4bfe-b164-f13100e777d8","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"auto_mode","autoModeConsentFlow":false,"finishExposedWork":false,"bashFirst":true,"bashFirstSteer":"relaxed","steerOnly":true,"bypass":false},"type":"attachment","uuid":"5c5c67e8-0c10-4eb6-87f2-5ffdba2d6c8b","timestamp":"2026-11-03T07:15:55.687Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\nWhile auto mode is active:\n\nYou can do much of your work through the Bash tool when it is the simpler route: read files with cat, head, or sed -n, search with grep and find, and make small, mechanical file changes with sed, heredocs, or short scripts instead of the dedicated Read, Edit, or Write tools. The choice is yours: prefer Edit or Write when a shell edit would be fragile, such as exact or multi-line replacements, or sed/awk flags that differ between GNU and BSD/macOS.\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/Sagenkazaran/Library/Application Support/Claude/scratch-workspaces/f907b165-4712-485f-a44b-7f7d54b74cf9/77d6453f-aaee-4ad3-a7ea-34b17cbaf2e5/scratch-2026-10-26-b13584","sessionId":"1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"deep-singing-taco"}
{"parentUuid":"5c5c67e8-0c10-4eb6-87f2-5ffdba2d6c8b","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"async_hook_response","processId":"async_hook_76327","hookName":"SessionStart:compact","hookEvent":"SessionStart","command":"claude-mem start","pluginId":"claude-mem@thedotmack","response":{},"stdout":"","stderr":"","exitCode":1},"type":"attachment","uuid":"fcf2fed6-acef-4eb1-8900-a3cbba90626d","timestamp":"2026-11-03T07:15:55.688Z","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/Sagenkazaran/Library/Application Support/Claude/scratch-workspaces/f907b165-4712-485f-a44b-7f7d54b74cf9/77d6453f-aaee-4ad3-a7ea-34b17cbaf2e5/scratch-2026-10-26-b13584","sessionId":"1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"deep-singing-taco"}
{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb","hash":"a60ecb6d1ee2799514f5fe4a19e9aec4dc00bb22b5b9cc5f4ec3af911f4f991b","message":{"role":"system","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The following MCP servers require authentication before their tools can be used:\ngetlayers\nhiggsfield\n\nClaude cannot start the OAuth flow itself. If the user's request depends on one of these servers (even if they didn't name it explicitly), or they ask about it, tell them that it needs to be authorized — via /mcp — and that the capability is unavailable until they do. Otherwise carry on with the request and do not mention these servers. Do not ask the user for authorization codes, tokens, or callback URLs.\n\nWhile auto mode is active:\n\nYou can do much of your work through the Bash tool when it is the simpler route: read files with cat, head, or sed -n, search with grep and find, and make small, mechanical file changes with sed, heredocs, or short scripts instead of the dedicated Read, Edit, or Write tools. The choice is yours: prefer Edit or Write when a shell edit would be fragile, such as exact or multi-line replacements, or sed/awk flags that differ between GNU and BSD/macOS."}]}}
{"type":"api-request","sessionId":"1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb","id":"8320fdfc-01da-49e1-b1ec-d90ea8a69cfe","timestamp":"2026-11-03T07:15:55.714Z","version":"2.1.309","querySource":"sdk","shapeHash":"fca5d4960fc2d9efc24ec6c5df78cdcd9cdf743dce8c36aa9b4473d50e5b16f3","params":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","betas":["claude-code-20250219","oauth-2025-04-20","interleaved-thinking-2025-05-14","thinking-token-count-2026-05-13","context-management-2025-06-27","prompt-caching-scope-2026-01-05","per-turn-control-2026-07-01","mid-conversation-tool-changes-2026-07-01","inline-tools-2026-09-15","advisor-tool-2026-03-01","advanced-tool-use-2025-11-20","mid-conversation-system-clear-at-2026-08-21","effort-2025-11-24","dangerous-tool-use-2026-09-03","thinking-binding-controls-2026-08-01","thinking-display-updates-2026-08-18","afk-mode-2026-01-31","extended-cache-ttl-2025-04-11","cache-diagnosis-2026-04-07","message-threads-2026-08-12"],"max_tokens":128000,"thinking":{"type":"adaptive","display":"updates"},"context_management":{"edits":[{"type":"clear_thinking_20251015","keep":"all"}]},"output_config":{"effort":"high"}},"base":"e6f9581f-3c04-4a92-b47c-65bcd0c84f2c","keep":5,"tail":["4beb8f7138aa51f1dbe910adec891455034e8c96c9a4afb6f60ddf3b5539c395","14987f29920a65539346ee9b197e859ca5c8a9c3bd8c03e1761527742b9f43f1","a60ecb6d1ee2799514f5fe4a19e9aec4dc00bb22b5b9cc5f4ec3af911f4f991b"],"cacheControl":[{"path":["system",1],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h","scope":"global"}},{"path":["system",2],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}},{"path":["messages",7,"content",0],"value":{"type":"ephemeral","ttl":"1h"}}],"requestDigest":"4bb2fe64625b5a974c8014a810c1a673b153ed4264d7bcc7690f85b29f8804eb"}
