{"parentUuid":"57681244-5ddf-4297-98cd-c073f4924a49","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"deferred_tools_delta","addedNames":[],"addedLines":[],"removedNames":["FetchInboxMessage","ReadNotifications"],"wireHiddenNames":[],"readdedNames":[],"pendingMcpServers":[],"needsAuthMcpServers":["getlayers","higgsfield"],"failedMcpServers":[],"removedByBlock":["ReadNotifications"]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"81d72cfa-ff69-4f82-88c6-3837a421c2e6","timestamp":"2026-11-03T21:06:20.371Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\nThe following tools are no longer available. Do not call them:\nReadNotifications\n\nThe following deferred tools are no longer available in this session. Do not search for them — ToolSearch will return no match:\nFetchInboxMessage\n\nThis is ambient context — do not narrate it to the user unless they ask or it is directly relevant to their request.\n\nThe following MCP servers require authentication before their tools can be used:\ngetlayers\nhiggsfield\n\nClaude cannot start the OAuth flow itself. If the user's request depends on one of these servers (even if they didn't name it explicitly), or they ask about it, tell them that it needs to be authorized — via /mcp — and that the capability is unavailable until they do. Otherwise carry on with the request and do not mention these servers. Do not ask the user for authorization codes, tokens, or callback URLs.\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/Sagenkazaran/Library/Application Support/Claude/scratch-workspaces/f907b165-4712-485f-a44b-7f7d54b74cf9/77d6453f-aaee-4ad3-a7ea-34b17cbaf2e5/scratch-2026-10-26-b13584","sessionId":"1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"deep-singing-taco"}
{"parentUuid":"81d72cfa-ff69-4f82-88c6-3837a421c2e6","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"agent_listing_delta","addedTypes":["scenario-writer-hy","smm-growth-marketer","video-editor-director","viral-pr-strategist"],"addedLines":["- scenario-writer-hy: Use when authoring a new Armenian-language verite scene/sketch for any of the project's series (150 հազար, Ապագա կա, 300 000, Алиев говорит, etc). Produces a production-ready BUILD.json or .md scene draft with polished Eastern Armenian dialogue, character anchors (visual + voice), shot list with Veo prompts, and May 2026 spring environmental cues. Input: scene archetype + which series. Output: file written to data/scripts/<series>/. (Tools: Read, Write, Glob, Grep, Bash, WebFetch)","- smm-growth-marketer: SMM / growth-маркетолог команды. Use to pick formats by platform, timing, captions, hashtags/keywords, alt text, cover, Trial Reels and A/B plans, and to score concepts by expected reach. Also critiques ideas from the strategist. (Tools: Read, Glob, Grep, WebSearch, WebFetch)","- video-editor-director: Монтажёр-режиссёр команды. Use to turn an approved concept into a shot list, generation plan (which model per shot, price), edit timeline with titles/subtitles/SFX/music, and to QA a finished cut frame-by-frame against our rules. (Tools: Read, Glob, Grep, Bash)","- viral-pr-strategist: Вирусный стратег / пиарщик команды. Use when a new Reels/Shorts idea is needed or a video must «залететь»: finds the hook, the emotion, the share-trigger and the trend angle for our AI heroes (Егор, Жана, Милана, Лера…). Outputs 3–5 concepts with hook (0–2 s), retention mechanic, share/comment trigger, why it spreads, risk check. (Tools: Read, Glob, Grep, WebSearch, WebFetch)"],"builtInTypes":[],"builtInPluginTypes":[],"removedTypes":[],"isInitial":false,"showConcurrencyNote":true},"type":"attachment","uuid":"50a3b901-720c-41af-9ea9-a741e9539220","timestamp":"2026-11-03T21:06:20.371Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\nNew agent types are now available for the Agent tool:\n- scenario-writer-hy: Use when authoring a new Armenian-language verite scene/sketch for any of the project's series (150 հազար, Ապագա կա, 300 000, Алиев говорит, etc). Produces a production-ready BUILD.json or .md scene draft with polished Eastern Armenian dialogue, character anchors (visual + voice), shot list with Veo prompts, and May 2026 spring environmental cues. Input: scene archetype + which series. Output: file written to data/scripts/<series>/. (Tools: Read, Write, Glob, Grep, Bash, WebFetch)\n- smm-growth-marketer: SMM / growth-маркетолог команды. Use to pick formats by platform, timing, captions, hashtags/keywords, alt text, cover, Trial Reels and A/B plans, and to score concepts by expected reach. Also critiques ideas from the strategist. (Tools: Read, Glob, Grep, WebSearch, WebFetch)\n- video-editor-director: Монтажёр-режиссёр команды. Use to turn an approved concept into a shot list, generation plan (which model per shot, price), edit timeline with titles/subtitles/SFX/music, and to QA a finished cut frame-by-frame against our rules. (Tools: Read, Glob, Grep, Bash)\n- viral-pr-strategist: Вирусный стратег / пиарщик команды. Use when a new Reels/Shorts idea is needed or a video must «залететь»: finds the hook, the emotion, the share-trigger and the trend angle for our AI heroes (Егор, Жана, Милана, Лера…). Outputs 3–5 concepts with hook (0–2 s), retention mechanic, share/comment trigger, why it spreads, risk check. (Tools: Read, Glob, Grep, WebSearch, WebFetch)\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/Sagenkazaran/Library/Application Support/Claude/scratch-workspaces/f907b165-4712-485f-a44b-7f7d54b74cf9/77d6453f-aaee-4ad3-a7ea-34b17cbaf2e5/scratch-2026-10-26-b13584","sessionId":"1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"deep-singing-taco"}
{"parentUuid":"50a3b901-720c-41af-9ea9-a741e9539220","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"skill_listing","content":"- cast: Select original on-screen talent references and generic or licensed synthetic voices for commercial video. Use when the user asks who should appear, which voice fits, how to cast a promo, or when a BUILD.json needs a visual and voice anchor. Never select or create a clone or impersonation of a real identifiable person.\n- clip: Build one original commercial, promo, product, or social-first video via Gemini → Nano Banana 2 → Veo 3.1 → ffmpeg. Use whenever the user asks to make a short video, promo, ad, launch clip, Reel, TikTok, or Shorts for a brand or client. Produce a vertical 9:16 master by default and keep the work original, brand-safe, and ready for approval before paid generation.\n- cost-estimate: Estimate kie.ai cost (Veo 3.1, Nano Banana 2, Infinitalk, Suno, Gemini) for a planned build before running. Takes a BUILD.json path, a list of scene_ids, or a manual shot count. Reports a per-stage breakdown plus total. Use BEFORE running build_150_run.py or any pipeline that hits Veo. Triggers when user asks \"сколько будет стоить\", \"оцени cost\", \"почём\", \"по деньгам\", or before a series-build confirmation gate.\n- nb-safe: Handle Nano Banana 2 safety rejections for honest commercial artwork. Use when an image request is blocked or before generating a sensitive concept. Diagnose the creative constraint and propose a genuinely different, compliant concept; never strip or disguise words to evade a safety system.\n- polish-hy: Polish Eastern Armenian text via Gemini for maximum clarity, logic, and realism (Yerevan working-class colloquial). Shows a diff of changes. Use BEFORE any ElevenLabs TTS or Veo voice gen on Armenian dialogue. Triggers when user pastes Armenian text and asks \"проверь / отполируй / скорректируй / поправь грамматику\", or when running a build pipeline that needs the dialogue verified. Invokes kie.ai gemini-3.1-pro with Google AI gemini-2.5-flash fallback.\n- premium-montage: Edit original footage or approved generated clips into a premium commercial Reel, TikTok, Shorts, product film, or campaign cut. Use whenever the user asks for a beautiful, expensive-looking, high-fashion, product-hero, cinematic, minimal, motion-graphics, or brand-experience style edit—especially when matching the design principles of a reference without copying it. Handles shot selection, pacing, typography, sound design, colour, ffmpeg finishing, and vertical social export.\n- series-build: Mass-build all unbuilt scenes in a series. Scans data/scripts/&lt;series&gt;/ for *_BUILD.json files, finds those without a corresponding *_FINAL.mp4, runs build_150_run.py in parallel for the missing ones. Shows cost estimate before running and prompts for confirmation. Use when user says \"добей серию\", \"собери всё что осталось\", \"запусти все сцены\", \"массово\", \"финиши remaining\". Skips cached scenes via the build script's exists() checks.","skillCount":7,"isInitial":false,"names":["cast","clip","cost-estimate","nb-safe","polish-hy","premium-montage","series-build"],"digests":["4f1c6076241ba512","8318f7906634f261","7062846e7f72789b","5487f9b789824749","41b3ec141a9e6da5","5d17aa4aed158462","47ae59fdedfb45c5"]},"type":"attachment","uuid":"42cb69c4-c507-4a68-bd8a-ff16cdb5b745","timestamp":"2026-11-03T21:06:20.372Z","rendered":[{"content":"<system-reminder>\nThe following skills are available for use with the Skill tool:\n\n- cast: Select original on-screen talent references and generic or licensed synthetic voices for commercial video. Use when the user asks who should appear, which voice fits, how to cast a promo, or when a BUILD.json needs a visual and voice anchor. Never select or create a clone or impersonation of a real identifiable person.\n- clip: Build one original commercial, promo, product, or social-first video via Gemini → Nano Banana 2 → Veo 3.1 → ffmpeg. Use whenever the user asks to make a short video, promo, ad, launch clip, Reel, TikTok, or Shorts for a brand or client. Produce a vertical 9:16 master by default and keep the work original, brand-safe, and ready for approval before paid generation.\n- cost-estimate: Estimate kie.ai cost (Veo 3.1, Nano Banana 2, Infinitalk, Suno, Gemini) for a planned build before running. Takes a BUILD.json path, a list of scene_ids, or a manual shot count. Reports a per-stage breakdown plus total. Use BEFORE running build_150_run.py or any pipeline that hits Veo. Triggers when user asks \"сколько будет стоить\", \"оцени cost\", \"почём\", \"по деньгам\", or before a series-build confirmation gate.\n- nb-safe: Handle Nano Banana 2 safety rejections for honest commercial artwork. Use when an image request is blocked or before generating a sensitive concept. Diagnose the creative constraint and propose a genuinely different, compliant concept; never strip or disguise words to evade a safety system.\n- polish-hy: Polish Eastern Armenian text via Gemini for maximum clarity, logic, and realism (Yerevan working-class colloquial). Shows a diff of changes. Use BEFORE any ElevenLabs TTS or Veo voice gen on Armenian dialogue. Triggers when user pastes Armenian text and asks \"проверь / отполируй / скорректируй / поправь грамматику\", or when running a build pipeline that needs the dialogue verified. Invokes kie.ai gemini-3.1-pro with Google AI gemini-2.5-flash fallback.\n- premium-montage: Edit original footage or approved generated clips into a premium commercial Reel, TikTok, Shorts, product film, or campaign cut. Use whenever the user asks for a beautiful, expensive-looking, high-fashion, product-hero, cinematic, minimal, motion-graphics, or brand-experience style edit—especially when matching the design principles of a reference without copying it. Handles shot selection, pacing, typography, sound design, colour, ffmpeg finishing, and vertical social export.\n- series-build: Mass-build all unbuilt scenes in a series. Scans data/scripts/&lt;series&gt;/ for *_BUILD.json files, finds those without a corresponding *_FINAL.mp4, runs build_150_run.py in parallel for the missing ones. Shows cost estimate before running and prompts for confirmation. Use when user says \"добей серию\", \"собери всё что осталось\", \"запусти все сцены\", \"массово\", \"финиши remaining\". Skips cached scenes via the build script's exists() checks.\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"system","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/Sagenkazaran/Library/Application Support/Claude/scratch-workspaces/f907b165-4712-485f-a44b-7f7d54b74cf9/77d6453f-aaee-4ad3-a7ea-34b17cbaf2e5/scratch-2026-10-26-b13584","sessionId":"1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"deep-singing-taco"}
