{"parentUuid":"5114acf1-4b28-467c-8aae-512dca2f1095","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgggECpnvw91uz75Tgttf","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Y15Skc512qZjTTYBpBG5T5","name":"WebSearch","input":{"query":"FlClash mips tun stack slow speed mipstack","mode":"standard"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"tool_use","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":729,"cache_read_input_tokens":145297,"output_tokens":89,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":729,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":4,"output_tokens":89,"cache_read_input_tokens":145297,"cache_creation_input_tokens":729,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":729},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01Y15Skc512qZjTTYBpBG5T5":{"query":"FlClash mips tun stack slow speed mipstack","mode":"standard"}},"serverClassifierRequest":"ce9fa0b8-ac8c-4d1b-b04b-121a51a900a3","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgggECYgXcN6UpHdFZK3a","requestRef":"6e12cbfa-75fc-4554-ac96-bebdbc837c53","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"96bd6983-8167-402e-9bab-c9bde7cae1f0","timestamp":"2026-11-03T21:07:30.354Z","advisorModel":"claude-opus-5-5","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":"high","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/Sagenkazaran/Library/Application Support/Claude/scratch-workspaces/f907b165-4712-485f-a44b-7f7d54b74cf9/77d6453f-aaee-4ad3-a7ea-34b17cbaf2e5/scratch-2026-10-26-b13584","sessionId":"1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"deep-singing-taco"}
{"parentUuid":"96bd6983-8167-402e-9bab-c9bde7cae1f0","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"3fbe9f71-8063-48d4-834a-af228220393c","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Y15Skc512qZjTTYBpBG5T5","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"FlClash mips tun stack slow speed mipstack\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"pkg.go.dev\",\"url\":\"https://pkg.go.dev/github.com/metacubex/mipstack\"},{\"title\":\"csr rfc 039\",\"url\":\"https://web.mit.edu/~saltzer/www/publications/rfc/csr-rfc-039.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"From owner-linux-mips@oss.sgi.com Wed Nov  1 00:24:07 2000\",\"url\":\"https://linux-mips.org/archives/mbox/linux-mips/2000-11\"},{\"title\":\"app.silentinstallhq.com\",\"url\":\"https://app.silentinstallhq.com/installer/15d1c206045f4bdd16b7ddeb5d5c79ed7b5d7fc1a6279c923d3f1d64ce2a0d02\"},{\"title\":\"debian-mips Mar 2011 by thread\",\"url\":\"https://lists.debian.org/debian-mips/2011/03/\"},{\"title\":\"• 请不要在回答技术问题时复制粘贴 AI 生成的内容\",\"url\":\"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1000081\"},{\"title\":\"• 请不要在回答技术问题时复制粘贴 AI 生成的内容\",\"url\":\"https://global.v2ex.co/t/1000081\"},{\"title\":\"2024-08-24 01:27:29 +00:00\",\"url\":\"https://gitea.com/kwxmbfbc/FlClash\"},{\"title\":\"StackAnalyzer for MIPS automatically determines the worst-case stack usage\",\"url\":\"https://absint.com/stackanalyzer/mips.htm\"},{\"title\":\"Fax Versand und Fax Empfang auf FritzBox oder PC-Linux\",\"url\":\"https://www.ip-phone-forum.de/threads/fax-versand-und-fax-empfang-auf-fritzbox-oder-pc-linux.145110/post-932702\"},{\"title\":\"7-cpu.com\",\"url\":\"https://7-cpu.com/cpu/Mips24K.html\"},{\"title\":\"does TCP/IP stack work on MIPS platform?\",\"url\":\"https://lists.rtems.org/pipermail/users/2000-May/000843.html\"},{\"title\":\"[OpenWrt-Devel] lantiq v3.18\",\"url\":\"https://desiato.infradead.org/pipermail/openwrt-devel/2015-February/005277.html\"},{\"title\":\"Re: MISC-d Digest V99 #107\",\"url\":\"https://strangegizmo.com/forth/misc/msg01339\"},{\"title\":\"Index of port-mips for April, 2000\",\"url\":\"https://mail-index.netbsd.org/port-mips/2000/04/oindex.html\"},{\"title\":\"us-west-2b-production.gl-awslz.arm.com\",\"url\":\"https://us-west-2b-production.gl-awslz.arm.com/linux-arm/linux-dm/-/commit/04d4d7d5e36957b2d941310fc8243aa7bf036f3b\"}]\n\nThe search didn't turn up any report of FlClash being slow on MIPS with the mipstack TUN stack, so I can't confirm a cause or fix.\n\n- **What mipstack is:** The mihomo IP stack (MIPS) is the small, pure-Go userspace IP stack developed for mihomo. It converts complete IPv4 and IPv6 packets from an arbitrary L3 link into standard Go TCP, UDP, and IP protocol socket interfaces. The README also notes that a successful socket write accepts the message but does not guarantee that every resulting packet reaches Stack.Read.\n- **FlClash context:** It is a multi-platform proxy client based on Clash Meta, simple and easy to use, open-source and ad-free. I found no FlClash-specific issue about MIPS or mipstack performance.\n- **Related TUN tuning:** One forum thread describes a different setup (WSL2 with Clash TUN) where the default MTU of Clash's TUN mode was 9000, and changing it to 1500 fixed the problem. That is a separate issue, but MTU is a plausible thing to check if throughput is poor.\n\nThe other results were unrelated MIPS hardware or Linux pages. To investigate further, I'd search FlClash's GitHub issues for \"mips\" or \"mipstack\", or check whether the slowdown reproduces with the TUN stack set to gvisor or system.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"823d9cea-1ff2-4dd3-a9c8-5f79a8bb948c","timestamp":"2026-11-03T21:07:36.399Z","toolUseResult":{"query":"FlClash mips tun stack slow speed mipstack","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01QAUJ7VCqcAuwzPtVAjokH9","content":[{"title":"pkg.go.dev","url":"https://pkg.go.dev/github.com/metacubex/mipstack"},{"title":"csr rfc 039","url":"https://web.mit.edu/~saltzer/www/publications/rfc/csr-rfc-039.pdf"},{"title":"From owner-linux-mips@oss.sgi.com Wed Nov  1 00:24:07 2000","url":"https://linux-mips.org/archives/mbox/linux-mips/2000-11"},{"title":"app.silentinstallhq.com","url":"https://app.silentinstallhq.com/installer/15d1c206045f4bdd16b7ddeb5d5c79ed7b5d7fc1a6279c923d3f1d64ce2a0d02"},{"title":"debian-mips Mar 2011 by thread","url":"https://lists.debian.org/debian-mips/2011/03/"},{"title":"• 请不要在回答技术问题时复制粘贴 AI 生成的内容","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1000081"},{"title":"• 请不要在回答技术问题时复制粘贴 AI 生成的内容","url":"https://global.v2ex.co/t/1000081"},{"title":"2024-08-24 01:27:29 +00:00","url":"https://gitea.com/kwxmbfbc/FlClash"},{"title":"StackAnalyzer for MIPS automatically determines the worst-case stack usage","url":"https://absint.com/stackanalyzer/mips.htm"},{"title":"Fax Versand und Fax Empfang auf FritzBox oder PC-Linux","url":"https://www.ip-phone-forum.de/threads/fax-versand-und-fax-empfang-auf-fritzbox-oder-pc-linux.145110/post-932702"},{"title":"7-cpu.com","url":"https://7-cpu.com/cpu/Mips24K.html"},{"title":"does TCP/IP stack work on MIPS platform?","url":"https://lists.rtems.org/pipermail/users/2000-May/000843.html"},{"title":"[OpenWrt-Devel] lantiq v3.18","url":"https://desiato.infradead.org/pipermail/openwrt-devel/2015-February/005277.html"},{"title":"Re: MISC-d Digest V99 #107","url":"https://strangegizmo.com/forth/misc/msg01339"},{"title":"Index of port-mips for April, 2000","url":"https://mail-index.netbsd.org/port-mips/2000/04/oindex.html"},{"title":"us-west-2b-production.gl-awslz.arm.com","url":"https://us-west-2b-production.gl-awslz.arm.com/linux-arm/linux-dm/-/commit/04d4d7d5e36957b2d941310fc8243aa7bf036f3b"}]},"The search didn't turn up any report of FlClash being slow on MIPS with the mipstack TUN stack, so I can't confirm a cause or fix.\n\n- **What mipstack is:** The mihomo IP stack (MIPS) is the small, pure-Go userspace IP stack developed for mihomo. It converts complete IPv4 and IPv6 packets from an arbitrary L3 link into standard Go TCP, UDP, and IP protocol socket interfaces. The README also notes that a successful socket write accepts the message but does not guarantee that every resulting packet reaches Stack.Read.\n- **FlClash context:** It is a multi-platform proxy client based on Clash Meta, simple and easy to use, open-source and ad-free. I found no FlClash-specific issue about MIPS or mipstack performance.\n- **Related TUN tuning:** One forum thread describes a different setup (WSL2 with Clash TUN) where the default MTU of Clash's TUN mode was 9000, and changing it to 1500 fixed the problem. That is a separate issue, but MTU is a plausible thing to check if throughput is poor.\n\nThe other results were unrelated MIPS hardware or Linux pages. To investigate further, I'd search FlClash's GitHub issues for \"mips\" or \"mipstack\", or check whether the slowdown reproduces with the TUN stack set to gvisor or system."],"durationSeconds":5.162359250000009,"searchCount":1},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"ce9fa0b8-ac8c-4d1b-b04b-121a51a900a3","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/Sagenkazaran/Library/Application Support/Claude/scratch-workspaces/f907b165-4712-485f-a44b-7f7d54b74cf9/77d6453f-aaee-4ad3-a7ea-34b17cbaf2e5/scratch-2026-10-26-b13584","root":null,"branch":null,"default_branch":null,"status":null,"visibility":{"origin":null,"push_remote":null,"remotes":[],"visibility_cache":[]},"error":"not_a_repo"},"live_cwd":"/Users/Sagenkazaran/Library/Application Support/Claude/scratch-workspaces/f907b165-4712-485f-a44b-7f7d54b74cf9/77d6453f-aaee-4ad3-a7ea-34b17cbaf2e5/scratch-2026-10-26-b13584","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"96bd6983-8167-402e-9bab-c9bde7cae1f0","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/Sagenkazaran/Library/Application Support/Claude/scratch-workspaces/f907b165-4712-485f-a44b-7f7d54b74cf9/77d6453f-aaee-4ad3-a7ea-34b1