CT)}\", external=True)\nwebapp.py:438:            f'<a class=\"tile\" href=\"{html.escape(legal.SUPPORT_URL, quote=True)}\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer\"><span class=\"ic\">{ICONS[\"chat\"]}</span><b\nwebapp.py:572:DOCS = {\"terms\": legal.terms_text, \"privacy\": legal.privacy_text, \"tariffs\": legal.tariffs_text, \"support\": legal.support_text}\nwebapp.py:580:    titles = {\"terms\": \"Соглашение\", \"privacy\": \"Конфиденциальность\", \"tariffs\": \"Тарифы\", \"support\": \"Поддержка\"\nwebapp.py:582:    if request.match_info[\"name\"] == \"support\":\nwebapp.py:583:        extra = (f'<a class=\"btn\" style=\"margin-top:14px\" href=\"{html.escape(legal.SUPPORT_URL, quote=True)}\" target=\"_blank\" '\nlegal.py:1:\"\"\"Public documents shown in the bot: user agreement, privacy policy, tariffs, support.\nlegal.py:17:SUPPORT_CONTACT = os.environ.get(\"AURA_SUPPORT_CONTACT\", \"@Shahen_Kazaryan\")\nlegal.py:18:# Where «Написать в поддержку» leads: the Telegram chat of the support contact.\nlegal.py:19:SUPPORT_URL = os.environ.get(\"AURA_SUPPORT_URL\") or f\"https://t.me/{SUPPORT_CONTACT.lstrip('@')}\"\nlegal.py:20:SUPPORT_HOURS = os.environ.get(\"AURA_SUPPORT_HOURS\", \"ежедневно с 10:00 до 22:00 (МСК)\")\n69d4a527f739268c\n1fe5ce8bbbd03d55\ngrep: /etc/aura-vpn-bot/nexo.env: Permission denied\ngrep: /etc/aura-vpn-bot/nexo.env: Permission denied\ninactive\n69d4a527f739268c\n1fe5ce8bbbd03d55\nShell cwd was reset to /Users/Sagenkazaran/Library/Application Support/Claude/scratch-workspaces/f907b165-4712-485f-a44b-7f7d54b74cf9/77d6453f-aaee-4ad3-a7ea-34b17cbaf2e5/scratch-2026-10-26-b13584","is_error":false}]}}
