{"parentUuid":"da9a8bf4-fc01-43cc-8574-51ff7027b43e","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"a18293c7-dac5-4674-bb63-7408d16f626f","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01L3Z67JwbieY9wFnpfTWFeU","type":"tool_result","content":"Yes. The header is **`announce`**. It accepts plain text or Base64, and the app displays up to **200 characters**.\n\n- **Format:** `announce: [string]`. Plain text works, and Base64 is marked with a `base64:` prefix. For example, `announce: base64:SGFwcCB0aGUgYmVzdCE=`.\n- **Delivery:** Either as an HTTP response header or in the subscription body with a `#` prefix (`#announce: ...`).\n- **Length limit:** 200 characters for the displayed text.\n\nOther relevant headers:\n\n- **`support-url`**: Adds a support button on the right side of the status bar. It shows a Telegram icon for Telegram links and a standard link icon otherwise. Example: `support-url: https://t.me/happ_chat`.\n- **`profile-web-page-url`**: Adds a website button on the left side of the status bar. The icon is gray if the parameter is not set. Example: `profile-web-page-url: https://happ.su`.\n- **`profile-title`**: Sets the subscription name, limited to 25 characters.\n\nFor more prominent messages, the page also describes `sub-info-text` (max 200 characters), `sub-info-button-text` (max 25 characters), `sub-info-button-link`, and `sub-info-color`. Setting `sub-info-text` to 0 disables the block, and sending 0 disables an announcement set via HTTP header or push."}]},"uuid":"f5d9d6e5-2a1e-4cc6-85e6-3be71989d939","timestamp":"2026-11-05T22:54:28.661Z","toolUseResult":{"bytes":68089,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"Yes. The header is **`announce`**. It accepts plain text or Base64, and the app displays up to **200 characters**.\n\n- **Format:** `announce: [string]`. Plain text works, and Base64 is marked with a `base64:` prefix. For example, `announce: base64:SGFwcCB0aGUgYmVzdCE=`.\n- **Delivery:** Either as an HTTP response header or in the subscription body with a `#` prefix (`#announce: ...`).\n- **Length limit:** 200 characters for the displayed text.\n\nOther relevant headers:\n\n- **`support-url`**: Adds a support button on the right side of the status bar. It shows a Telegram icon for Telegram links and a standard link icon otherwise. Example: `support-url: https://t.me/happ_chat`.\n- **`profile-web-page-url`**: Adds a website button on the left side of the status bar. The icon is gray if the parameter is not set. Example: `profile-web-page-url: https://happ.su`.\n- **`profile-title`**: Sets the subscription name, limited to 25 characters.\n\nFor more prominent messages, the page also describes `sub-info-text` (max 200 characters), `sub-info-button-text` (max 25 characters), `sub-info-button-link`, and `sub-info-color`. Setting `sub-info-text` to 0 disables the block, and sending 0 disables an announcement set via HTTP header or push.","durationMs":5537,"url":"https://www.happ.su/main/dev-docs/app-management"},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"059e6167-49f9-4c22-9752-e053c9881b49","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/Sagenkazaran/Library/Application Support/Claude/scratch-workspaces/f907b165-4712-485f-a44b-7f7d54b74cf9/77d6453f-aaee-4ad3-a7ea-34b17cbaf2e5/scratch-2026-10-26-b13584","root":null,"branch":null,"default_branch":null,"status":null,"visibility":{"origin":null,"push_remote":null,"remotes":[],"visibility_cache":[]},"error":"not_a_repo"},"live_cwd":"/Users/Sagenkazaran/Library/Application Support/Claude/scratch-workspaces/f907b165-4712-485f-a44b-7f7d54b74cf9/77d6453f-aaee-4ad3-a7ea-34b17cbaf2e5/scratch-2026-10-26-b13584","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"da9a8bf4-fc01-43cc-8574-51ff7027b43e","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/Sagenkazaran/Library/Application Support/Claude/scratch-workspaces/f907b165-4712-485f-a44b-7f7d54b74cf9/77d6453f-aaee-4ad3-a7ea-34b17cba