{"parentUuid":"2cc9a5a2-7841-4adf-868d-0cf8f2707710","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"a18293c7-dac5-4674-bb63-7408d16f626f","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_018r3VuhXcXV2Pr2cvzHfQHf","type":"tool_result","content":"**notification-subs-expire**\n\n- **Key name:** `notification-subs-expire`\n- **Value format:** `true` or `1` enables it. To disable it, pass any other non-empty value, such as `0` or `false`.\n- **Delivery:** The page lists two methods: an HTTP header (`notification-subs-expire: 1`) and the subscription body, with a `#` prefix (`#notification-subs-expire: 1`). It does not mention an app-wide config or deep link.\n- **Provider ID:** Required. The page places this parameter in the Advanced section, which states that these parameters \"require a Provider ID to be specified in the subscription.\"\n- **Platforms:** The page does not specify platforms. It has no Desktop-only, iOS-only, or Android-only label.\n\n**Standard parameters:** `announce` and `profile-web-page-url` are in the Standard section, which the page says \"work for most panels.\" The page does not explicitly say Provider ID is unnecessary for them, but their placement implies it isn't required. `announce` accepts plain text or Base64, with displayed text limited to 200 characters. `profile-web-page-url` sets the subscription website button."}]},"uuid":"2b90bc2b-cfbc-4fd5-87e1-0c464855ab15","timestamp":"2026-11-05T22:56:09.825Z","toolUseResult":{"bytes":68089,"code":200,"codeText":"OK","result":"**notification-subs-expire**\n\n- **Key name:** `notification-subs-expire`\n- **Value format:** `true` or `1` enables it. To disable it, pass any other non-empty value, such as `0` or `false`.\n- **Delivery:** The page lists two methods: an HTTP header (`notification-subs-expire: 1`) and the subscription body, with a `#` prefix (`#notification-subs-expire: 1`). It does not mention an app-wide config or deep link.\n- **Provider ID:** Required. The page places this parameter in the Advanced section, which states that these parameters \"require a Provider ID to be specified in the subscription.\"\n- **Platforms:** The page does not specify platforms. It has no Desktop-only, iOS-only, or Android-only label.\n\n**Standard parameters:** `announce` and `profile-web-page-url` are in the Standard section, which the page says \"work for most panels.\" The page does not explicitly say Provider ID is unnecessary for them, but their placement implies it isn't required. `announce` accepts plain text or Base64, with displayed text limited to 200 characters. `profile-web-page-url` sets the subscription website button.","durationMs":7109,"url":"https://www.happ.su/main/dev-docs/app-management"},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"ede8e2a4-974c-42b3-87da-f3bdfb25db97","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/Sagenkazaran/Library/Application Support/Claude/scratch-workspaces/f907b165-4712-485f-a44b-7f7d54b74cf9/77d6453f-aaee-4ad3-a7ea-34b17cbaf2e5/scratch-2026-10-26-b13584","root":null,"branch":null,"default_branch":null,"status":null,"visibility":{"origin":null,"push_remote":null,"remotes":[],"visibility_cache":[]},"error":"not_a_repo"},"live_cwd":"/Users/Sagenkazaran/Library/Application Support/Claude/scratch-workspaces/f907b165-4712-485f-a44b-7f7d54b74cf9/77d6453f-aaee-4ad3-a7ea-34b17cbaf2e5/scratch-2026-10-26-b13584","platform":"macos"}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"2cc9a5a2-7841-4adf-868d-0cf8f2707710","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/Sagenkazaran/Library/Application Support/Claude/scratch-workspaces/f907b165-4712-485f-a44b-7f7d54b74cf9/77d6453f-aaee-4ad3-a7ea-34b17cbaf2e5/scratch-2026-10-26-b13584","sessionId":"1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb","version":"2.1.317","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"deep-singing-taco"}
