n=false\nFailed to write while dumping service window: Broken pipe\n600000\nShell cwd was reset to /Users/Sagenkazaran/Library/Application Support/Claude/scratch-workspaces/f907b165-4712-485f-a44b-7f7d54b74cf9/77d6453f-aaee-4ad3-a7ea-34b17cbaf2e5/scratch-2026-10-26-b13584","is_error":false},{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QCKHMDUtVBCdVtGNiCuJUt","type":"tool_result","content":"Command running in background with ID: bh2wauqk6. Output is being written to: /private/tmp/claude-501/REDACTED/1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb/tasks/bh2wauqk6.output. You will be notified when it completes — do not poll that file or sleep while waiting. Read the file only if the user asks for progress, or if you need a line it prints before you can go on, such as a server's ready line or port.","is_error":false}]}}
