{"parentUuid":"d4e27889-291e-4de3-989b-cd81ec4eaa64","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"b1c09de0-548b-4c08-b68d-52630326215c","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01982Aqe9AXbWPAgZzr1g5Fq","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"TestFlight external testers limit 10000 build expires 90 days beta app review; Network Extension packet tunnel memory limit iOS\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"medium.com\",\"url\":\"https://medium.com/p/39bc510754f6\"},{\"title\":\"testflight guide\",\"url\":\"https://instabug.com/blog/testflight-guide\"},{\"title\":\"App Store Optimization\",\"url\":\"https://mwm.ai/glossary/testflight\"},{\"title\":\"iOS Development\",\"url\":\"https://techconcepts.org/blog/testflight-guide\"},{\"title\":\"testflight overview\",\"url\":\"https://docs.thunkable.com/publishing-apps/publish-to-app-store-ios/testflight-overview\"},{\"title\":\"Testing on iOS via TestFlight\",\"url\":\"https://docs.thunkable.com/publish-to-app-store-ios/testflight-overview\"},{\"title\":\"testflight beta testing setting effective tests\",\"url\":\"https://www.instabug.com/blog/testflight-beta-testing-setting-effective-tests\"},{\"title\":\"App Store Connect Help\",\"url\":\"https://developer-rno.apple.com/help/app-store-connect/test-a-beta-version/testflight-overview\"},{\"title\":\"us.fitgap.com\",\"url\":\"https://us.fitgap.com/products/testflight\"},{\"title\":\"App Store Connect Help\",\"url\":\"https://www.developer.apple.com/help/app-store-connect/test-a-beta-version/testflight-overview\"},{\"title\":\"6824982 resolving the this beta isn t accepting any new testers right now error\",\"url\":\"https://help.playtestcloud.com/en/articles/6824982-resolving-the-this-beta-isn-t-accepting-any-new-testers-right-now-error\"},{\"title\":\"TestFlight in Depth\",\"url\":\"https://docs.thunkable.com/v/snap-to-place/publish-to-app-store-ios/testflight-overview/testflight-in-depth\"},{\"title\":\"What is TestFlight - Essential for Developers | 2025? Definition & Meaning\",\"url\":\"https://generalistprogrammer.com/glossary/testflight\"},{\"title\":\"Drizz raises $2.7M in seed funding •\",\"url\":\"https://www.drizz.dev/post/testflight-access\"},{\"title\":\"testflight vs google play testing\",\"url\":\"https://newly.app/compare/testflight-vs-google-play-testing\"},{\"title\":\"Articles · App ExamplesUpdated September 2026\",\"url\":\"https://newly.app/guides/ios-testflight\"}]\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"What is the memory limit for a network extension?\",\"url\":\"https://developer.apple.com/forums/thread/73148?page=2\"},{\"title\":\"What is the memory limit for a network extension?\",\"url\":\"https://origin-devforums.apple.com/forums/thread/73148?page=2\"},{\"title\":\"NEPacketTunnelProvider Memory Limits (iOS)\",\"url\":\"https://developer.apple.com/forums/thread/106377\"},{\"title\":\"What is the memory limit for a network extension?\",\"url\":\"https://developer.apple.com/forums/thread/73148\"},{\"title\":\"Remove or raise memory limit for Packet Tunnel Provider extension\",\"url\":\"https://openradar.appspot.com/27660401\"},{\"title\":\"Memory Limit of NEPackTunnelProvider on new iOS system\",\"url\":\"https://developer.apple.com/forums/thread/728876\"},{\"title\":\"Is there a memory limit for macOS System Network Extension?\",\"url\":\"https://developer.apple.com/forums/thread/682778\"},{\"title\":\"PacketTunnelProvider Extension terminated due to memory limit\",\"url\":\"https://developer.apple.com/forums/thread/763586\"},{\"title\":\"origin-devforums.apple.com\",\"url\":\"https://origin-devforums.apple.com/forums/profile/aleksandarklisarski\"},{\"title\":\"Network Extension Provider Memory Strategy\",\"url\":\"https://developer.apple.com/forums/thread/44942\"},{\"title\":\"What is the memory limit for a network extension iOS 17\",\"url\":\"https://developer.apple.com/forums/thread/763392\"},{\"title\":\"Network extension crash with 2048 IPv6 Split tunnel routes\",\"url\":\"https://developer.apple.com/forums/thread/723156\"},{\"title\":\"Network Extension for iOS and MacOS. Is there any difference?\",\"url\":\"https://developer.apple.com/forums/thread/729911\"},{\"title\":\"origin-devforums.apple.com\",\"url\":\"https://origin-devforums.apple.com/forums/profile/Meera Mohideen/questions\"},{\"title\":\"icefire wang\",\"url\":\"https://origin-devforums.apple.com/forums/profile/icefire_wang\"},{\"title\":\"origin-devforums.apple.com\",\"url\":\"https://origin-devforums.apple.com/forums/profile/Cougnes\"},{\"title\":\"Packet Tunnel Provider - Writing SSL3_RT_ALERT 2 bytes\",\"url\":\"https://developer.apple.com/forums/thread/131827\"},{\"title\":\"jailbreak ios memory limit\",\"url\":\"https://stash.wiki/en/faq/jailbreak-ios-memory-limit\"},{\"title\":\"ios app extension s maximum memory budget\",\"url\":\"https://kaweah.freedombox.rocks/kiwix/stackoverflow.com_en_all_2023-11/questions/37361261/ios-app-extension-s-maximum-memory-budget\"}]\n\n**TestFlight (external testers, 10,000 cap, 90-day expiry, beta review)**\n\n- **Tester cap:** Multiple sources give 10,000 external testers per app. One source says the cap was once 1,000 before 2017, so treat that as outdated. Up to 100 internal testers (App Store Connect users) and up to 10,000 external testers per app.\n- **Beta App Review:** Apple's own help page says when you add the first build of your app to a group, the build gets sent to App Review. Third-party guides describe this as a gate for the first build of each version, with later builds usually skipping full review ().\n- **90-day expiry:** Apple's documentation says you can test a build for up to 90 days. The window is fixed, so a new build with a new build number is needed to keep testing going ().\n\n**Network Extension packet tunnel memory limit (iOS)**\n\nI found no official Apple documentation for this limit. The figures come from Apple DTS replies on the developer forums and third-party sources, and they conflict:\n\n- Older iOS versions used a 15 MiB limit. One forum thread reports a 50 MB limit starting around iOS 15, and a Stash wiki page likewise says in iOS 15 and later, the memory limit for Network Extension has been increased to 50 MB.\n- Another forum poster says memory limit for Packet tunnel seems to be back to 15 Mb on iOS 17, which is unconfirmed. A later poster reports iOS 26 still has 50MiB packet tunnel limit.\n- Apple DTS has warned that these limits have changed in the past and may well change in the future. They also advise against content filtering in a packet tunnel provider, saying in our experience it does not end well.\n\n**Bottom line:** Treat 50 MiB as the commonly reported packet tunnel limit for recent iOS, but verify on your target iOS version and device before relying on it. Apple DTS has said these limits can change, so design for a tighter budget.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"9a132a38-62e1-4695-a2d0-0a4e41d8e1cf","timestamp":"2026-11-06T07:38:31.478Z","toolUseResult":{"query":"TestFlight external testers limit 10000 build expires 90 days beta app review; Network Extension packet tunnel memory limit iOS","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01784GQnvmuxwZ5vPm79vKYR","content":[{"title":"medium.com","url":"https://medium.com/p/39bc510754f6"},{"title":"testflight guide","url":"https://instabug.com/blog/testflight-guide"},{"title":"App Store Optimization","url":"https://mwm.ai/glossary/testflight"},{"title":"iOS Development","url":"https://techconcepts.org/blog/testflight-guide"},{"title":"testflight overview","url":"https://docs.thunkable.com/publishing-apps/publish-to-app-store-ios/testflight-overview"},{"title":"Testing on iOS via TestFlight","url":"https://docs.thunkable.com/publish-to-app-store-ios/testflight-overview"},{"title":"testflight beta testing setting effective tests","url":"https://www.instabug.com/blog/testflight-beta-testing-setting-effective-tests"},{"title":"App Store Connect Help","url":"https://developer-rno.apple.com/help/app-store-connect/test-a-beta-version/testflight-overview"},{"title":"us.fitgap.com","url":"https://us.fitgap.com/products/testflight"},{"title":"App Store Connect Help","url":"https://www.developer.apple.com/help/app-store-connect/test-a-beta-version/testflight-overview"},{"title":"6824982 resolving the this beta isn t accepting any new testers right now error","url":"https://help.playtestcloud.com/en/articles/6824982-resolving-the-this-beta-isn-t-accepting-any-new-testers-right-now-error"},{"title":"TestFlight in Depth","url":"https://docs.thunkable.com/v/snap-to-place/publish-to-app-store-ios/testflight-overview/testflight-in-depth"},{"title":"What is TestFlight - Essential for Developers | 2025? Definition & Meaning","url":"https://generalistprogrammer.com/glossary/testflight"},{"title":"Drizz raises $2.7M in seed funding •","url":"https://www.drizz.dev/post/testflight-access"},{"title":"testflight vs google play testing","url":"https://newly.app/compare/testflight-vs-google-play-testing"},{"title":"Articles · App ExamplesUpdated September 2026","url":"https://newly.app/guides/ios-testflight"}]},{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01LMzKfstXbpJSTNGLAdG79v","content":[{"title":"What is the memory limit for a network extension?","url":"https://developer.apple.com/forums/thread/73148?page=2"},{"title":"What is the memory limit for a network extension?","url":"https://origin-devforums.apple.com/forums/thread/73148?page=2"},{"title":"NEPacketTunnelProvider Memory Limits (iOS)","url":"https://developer.apple.com/forums/thread/106377"},{"title":"What is the memory limit for a network extension?","url":"https://developer.apple.com/forums/thread/73148"},{"title":"Remove or raise memory limit for Packet Tunnel Provider extension","url":"https://openradar.appspot.com/27660401"},{"title":"Memory Limit of NEPackTunnelProvider on new iOS system","url":"https://developer.apple.com/forums/thread/728876"},{"title":"Is there a memory limit for macOS System Network Extension?","url":"https://developer.apple.com/forums/thread/682778"},{"title":"PacketTunnelProvider Extension terminated due to memory limit","url":"https://developer.apple.com/forums/thread/763586"},{"title":"origin-devforums.apple.com","url":"https://origin-devforums.apple.com/forums/profile/aleksandarklisarski"},{"title":"Network Extension Provider Memory Strategy","url":"https://developer.apple.com/forums/thread/44942"},{"title":"What is the memory limit for a network extension iOS 17","url":"https://developer.apple.com/forums/thread/763392"},{"title":"Network extension crash with 2048 IPv6 Split tunnel routes","url":"https://developer.apple.com/forums/thread/723156"},{"title":"Network Extension for iOS and MacOS. Is there any difference?","url":"https://developer.apple.com/forums/thread/729911"},{"title":"origin-devforums.apple.com","url":"https://origin-devforums.apple.com/forums/profile/Meera Mohideen/questions"},{"title":"icefire wang","url":"https://origin-devforums.apple.com/forums/profile/icefire_wang"},{"title":"origin-devforums.apple.com","url":"https://origin-devforums.apple.com/forums/profile/Cougnes"},{"title":"Packet Tunnel Provider - Writing SSL3_RT_ALERT 2 bytes","url":"https://developer.apple.com/forums/thread/131827"},{"title":"jailbreak ios memory limit","url":"https://stash.wiki/en/faq/jailbreak-ios-memory-limit"},{"title":"ios app extension s maximum memory budget","url":"https://kaweah.freedombox.rocks/kiwix/stackoverflow.com_en_all_2023-11/questions/37361261/ios-app-extension-s-maximum-memory-budget"}]},"**TestFlight (external testers, 10,000 cap, 90-day expiry, beta review)**\n\n- **Tester cap:** Multiple sources give 10,000 external testers per app. One source says the cap was once 1,000 before 2017, so treat that as outdated. Up to 100 internal testers (App Store Connect users) and up to 10,000 external testers per app.\n- **Beta App Review:** Apple's own help page says when you add the first build of your app to a group, the build gets sent to App Review. Third-party guides describe this as a gate for the first build of each version, with later builds usually skipping full review ().\n- **90-day expiry:** Apple's documentation says you can test a build for up to 90 days. The window is fixed, so a new build with a new build number is needed to keep testing going ().\n\n**Network Extension packet tunnel memory limit (iOS)**\n\nI found no official Apple documentation for this limit. The figures come from Apple DTS replies on the developer forums and third-party sources, and they conflict:\n\n- Older iOS versions used a 15 MiB limit. One forum thread reports a 50 MB limit starting around iOS 15, and a Stash wiki page likewise says in iOS 15 and later, the memory limit for Network Extension has been increased to 50 MB.\n- Another forum poster says memory limit for Packet tunnel seems to be back to 15 Mb on iOS 17, which is unconfirmed. A later poster reports iOS 26 still has 50MiB packet tunnel limit.\n- Apple DTS has warned that these limits have changed in the past and may well change in the future. They also advise against content filtering in a packet tunnel provider, saying in our experience it does not end well.\n\n**Bottom line:** Treat 50 MiB as the commonly reported packet tunnel limit for recent iOS, but verify on your target iOS version and device before relying on it. Apple DTS has said these limits can change, so design for a tighter budget."],"durationSeconds":9.191781915999949,"searchCount":2},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"1fe01409-f0ef-4de7-9691-23149ea7c053","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/Sagenkazaran/Projects/nexo-app","root":"/Users/Sagenkazaran/Projects/nexo-app","branch":"feat/in-app-update","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"Shahen777/nexo-app","visibility":"public"}