 hardcoded Chinese strings, updating ARB localization, or fixing generated locale output in this repository.\n- pre-commit-quality-review: Use when the user asks to commit, amend, or squash code, or requests a pre-commit structural quality review.\n- ui-work: Use when changing FlClash Flutter UI, widgets, screens, Material You styling, icons or glyphs, shapes and corner radii, navigation surfaces, async feedback, or user-facing interactions."}}
