{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb","hash":"358651cbfb20be8dafae57bf45075cc08f142b0d08bd872a9e7319321abeb9cd","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"toolu_01GLmEPtJYRd6Dh45XsLTjVH","content":[{"type":"tool_reference","tool_name":"WebSearch"}]},{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012MMUk9MeoQsQ1dH3zHa7Xu","type":"tool_result","content":"ls: ios: No such file or directory\n52:    \"ios\": [\n53-        # Recommended: in the Russian App Store and in every other one; Russian rules come from\n54-        # choosing Russia on first launch.\n55-        _app(\"karing\", \"Karing\", \"karing\", False, [(\"App Store\", KARING_IOS)]),\n56-        # Backup: imports the Xray JSON subscription with our rules as a provider configuration.\n57-        _app(\"onexray\", \"OneXray\", \"xray\", True, [(\"App Store\", ONEXRAY_IOS)]),\n58-        # Only for App Store accounts of other countries (missing from the Russian App Store).\n--\n87:    \"ios\": {\n88-        \"karing\": [(\"Запасной вариант — OneXray\", \"onexray\")],\n89-        \"onexray\": [(\"‹ Вернуться к Karing\", \"karing\")],\n90-        \"happ\": [(\"Запасной вариант — Karing\", \"karing\")],","is_error":false},{"type":"text","text":"Tool loaded."}]}}
{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb","hash":"6303de3ab34f087d6ea32803efb16fd570a773845dd05e7b8baab51aafa7f833","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01EwZN715d58X8bFUoecqe8z","name":"WebSearch","input":{"query":"App Store Review Guidelines 5.4 VPN apps must be offered by developers enrolled as an organization NEVPNManager","mode":"standard"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01UfmdJAZpRL8xUKyHrA4m4e","name":"WebSearch","input":{"query":"Apple removed VPN apps Russian App Store Roskomnadzor 2026 Apple Developer Program enrollment Russia payment","mode":"standard"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01JZHw9Z565KXuAKSq3zSVBX","name":"WebSearch","input":{"query":"alternative app marketplaces iOS which countries 2026 EU Japan Brazil AltStore PAL requirements developer account notarization","mode":"standard"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01982Aqe9AXbWPAgZzr1g5Fq","name":"WebSearch","input":{"query":"TestFlight external testers limit 10000 build expires 90 days beta app review; Network Extension packet tunnel memory limit iOS","mode":"standard"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb","hash":"54213c1e1ca82cc8586954aebcc1c5823b8bf96bb7e62795dc4f108059a02424","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JZHw9Z565KXuAKSq3zSVBX","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"alternative app marketplaces iOS which countries 2026 EU Japan Brazil AltStore PAL requirements developer account notarization\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"App store alternative AltStore wants to come to more countries\",\"url\":\"https://heise.de/-10743326\"},{\"title\":\"participating in alternative distribution for specific regions\",\"url\":\"https://developer.apple.com/documentation/marketplacekit/participating-in-alternative-distribution-for-specific-regions.md\"},{\"title\":\"participating in alternative distribution for specific regions\",\"url\":\"https://developer.apple.com/tutorials/data/documentation/marketplacekit/participating-in-alternative-distribution-for-specific-regions.md\"},{\"title\":\"Apple opens up app distribution for Brazil:\",\"url\":\"https://www.manton.org/2026/06/18/apple-opens-up-app-distribution.html\"},{\"title\":\"altstore pal now available in brazil as apple flips the switch on alternative marketplaces\",\"url\":\"https://9to5mac.com/2026/06/18/altstore-pal-now-available-in-brazil-as-apple-flips-the-switch-on-alternative-marketplaces/\"},{\"title\":\"In summary:\",\"url\":\"https://www.macworld.com/article/3199905/sideloading-changed-everything-and-nothing-about-my-iphone.html\"},{\"title\":\"this alternative iphone app store is launching in  countries before the end of the year id174723\",\"url\":\"https://www.phonearena.com/news/this-alternative-iphone-app-store-is-launching-in--countries-before-the-end-of-the-year_id174723\"},{\"title\":\"iOS: Alternative App Marketplaces Now in 29 Countries\",\"url\":\"https://heise.de/-11070764\"},{\"title\":\"move over apple meet the alternative app stores coming to the eu\",\"url\":\"https://techcrunch.com/2024/08/20/move-over-apple-meet-the-alternative-app-stores-coming-to-the-eu/\"},{\"title\":\"ccstartup.com\",\"url\":\"https://ccstartup.com/blog/?p=386395\"},{\"title\":\"apple erlaubt alternative app stores auf ios in brasilien\",\"url\":\"https://www.apfelpatient.de/news/apple-erlaubt-alternative-app-stores-auf-ios-in-brasilien\"},{\"title\":\"Apple to Allow Third-Party App Stores on iPhone in Brazil\",\"url\":\"https://www.iphoneincanada.ca/2025/12/23/apple-to-allow-third-party-app-stores-on-iphone-in-brazil/\"},{\"title\":\"Alternative app stores available in EU and elsewhere\",\"url\":\"https://en.ammonnews.net/print.php?id=89242\"},{\"title\":\"AltStore PAL available in Brazil as Apple enables alternative app marketplaces\",\"url\":\"https://alternativeto.net/news/2026/6/altstore-pal-available-in-brazil-as-apple-enables-alternative-app-marketplaces/\"},{\"title\":\"apple opens app store to competition in brazil under regulator deal\",\"url\":\"https://www.intomobile.com/2026/06/18/apple-opens-app-store-to-competition-in-brazil-under-regulator-deal/\"},{\"title\":\"Installing apps through alternative app distribution\",\"url\":\"https://support.apple.com/en-kg/117767\"},{\"title\":\"iPhone Owners In Brazil Can Now Do Something US Users Still Can't\",\"url\":\"https://www.bgr.com/2203516/iphone-users-brazil-getting-feature-us-users-still-cant-have/\"},{\"title\":\"TechnologyTE05 · Strategic Technology Control2026-06-18🇧🇷\",\"url\":\"https://gdeltcloud.com/events/brazil-opens-ios-to-alternative-app-stores-extending-app-sto--cameoplus_cc77cec3\"}]\n\nThe search confirms that alternative iOS app marketplaces are live in three regions: the EU, Japan, and Brazil. It did not return details on developer account or notarization requirements, so those need a separate search.\n\n- **EU:** Apple's EU rules are the longest-running. One source counts the EU's 27 member states plus Japan and Brazil as the 29 regions with officially approved alternative marketplaces, and says Australia was expected to be added soon. That source's date isn't clear, and I found no confirmation that Australia has launched.\n- **Japan:** Japan's Mobile Software Competition Act led Apple to commit to alternative marketplaces and payment systems starting with iOS 26.2. Alternative app marketplaces support iPhone and are available in Xcode 15.3, iOS 26.2 and later for Japan.\n- **Brazil:** Apple launched alternative marketplaces in Brazil on June 18, 2026, following a settlement with CADE, the competition regulator. Apple has enabled alternative app marketplaces in Brazil, for devices running iOS 26.5 and later. Unlike the EU, iPad users in Brazil are not covered.\n- **South Korea:** Some sources describe Korea as only partially open. One says we've got the EU, Japan, Brazil, and partially South Korea.\n\nApple's support page says the country or region of your Apple Account must be set to one of those countries or regions, and you must physically be located there. AltStore PAL is already live in Brazil.\n\nThe results did not cover developer account, notarization, or PAL-specific technical requirements. The Apple developer documentation page on region-specific distribution would be the place to check those.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."},{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01UfmdJAZpRL8xUKyHrA4m4e","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Apple removed VPN apps Russian App Store Roskomnadzor 2026 Apple Developer Program enrollment Russia payment\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"AdGuard's TrustTunnel iOS client pulled from Russian App Store as VPN crackdown intensifies\",\"url\":\"https://www.tomsguide.com/computing/vpns/adguards-trusttunnel-ios-client-pulled-from-russian-app-store-as-vpn-crackdown-intensifies\"},{\"title\":\"Internet censorship\",\"url\":\"https://hub.xeovo.com/posts/157-more-vpn-apps-disappear-from-russias-app-store\"},{\"title\":\"Apple removes AdGuard’s TrustTunnel from Russian App Store amid censorship push\",\"url\":\"https://www.techradar.com/vpn/vpn-services/adguards-open-source-vpn-client-removed-from-russias-apple-app-store\"},{\"title\":\"russia forces apple to remove vpns from app store\",\"url\":\"https://www.themoscowtimes.com/2026/10/10/russia-forces-apple-to-remove-vpns-from-app-store\"},{\"title\":\"russia forces apple to remove vpns from app store\",\"url\":\"https://www.themoscowtimes.com/2026/08/20/russia-forces-apple-to-remove-vpns-from-app-store\"},{\"title\":\"russia forces apple to remove vpns from app store\",\"url\":\"https://www.themoscowtimes.com/2026/08/01/russia-forces-apple-to-remove-vpns-from-app-store\"},{\"title\":\"russia forces apple to remove vpns from app store\",\"url\":\"https://www.themoscowtimes.com/2026/10/14/russia-forces-apple-to-remove-vpns-from-app-store\"},{\"title\":\"russia forces apple to remove vpns from app store\",\"url\":\"https://www.themoscowtimes.com/2026/10/13/russia-forces-apple-to-remove-vpns-from-app-store\"},{\"title\":\"habr.com\",\"url\":\"https://habr.com/ru/post/1016186\"},{\"title\":\"russia forces apple to remove vpns from app store\",\"url\":\"https://www.themoscowtimes.com/2026/02/07/russia-forces-apple-to-remove-vpns-from-app-store\"},{\"title\":\"Russia Accused of Forcing Apple to Remove VPNs from App Store\",\"url\":\"https://tech.co/news/russia-vpn-apps-removed-apple\"},{\"title\":\"russia orders vpn apps removal on app store\",\"url\":\"https://www.ilounge.com/news/russia-orders-vpn-apps-removal-on-app-store\"},{\"title\":\"apple has removed 25 vpn apps from the russian app store at the request of roskomnadzor\",\"url\":\"https://hide.expert/ru/blog/apple-has-removed-25-vpn-apps-from-the-russian-app-store-at-the-request-of-roskomnadzor\"},{\"title\":\"apple removes vpn apps at request of russian authorities say app makers\",\"url\":\"https://techcrunch.com/2024/07/08/apple-removes-vpn-apps-at-request-of-russian-authorities-say-app-makers\"},{\"title\":\"Apple removes custom VPN clients from Russian App Store amid Telegram crackdown\",\"url\":\"https://www.techradar.com/vpn/vpn-privacy-security/apple-removes-custom-vpn-clients-from-russian-app-store-amid-telegram-crackdown\"},{\"title\":\"Apple по требованию Роскомнадзора удалила из российского App Store несколько VPN‑клиентов\",\"url\":\"https://zona.media/news/2026/03/28/app-vpn\"},{\"title\":\"April 02, 2026\",\"url\":\"https://russianlife.com/the-russia-file/app-store-do-svidanya-vpns\"},{\"title\":\"Russia Cracks Down on VPNs, Fines Users and Apple Delists Apps\",\"url\":\"https://www.pulse.bot/telecom/news/russia-cracks-down-on-vpns-fines-users-and-apple-delists-apps-fe0e4d1f-a298-47c8-b16d-59a65b0bcb92\"},{\"title\":\"Apple Removes VPN and Proxy Apps From Russian App Store\",\"url\":\"https://www.pulse.bot/defense/news/apple-removes-vpn-and-proxy-apps-from-russian-app-store-0faeedaf-6d82-4b2f-b868-dae3a524199b\"}]\n\nThe search turned up plenty on the App Store removals but nothing on Apple Developer Program enrollment or payment in Russia, so that part of your query is unanswered.\n\n**Removals in 2026:**\n- In late March 2026, Apple pulled several VPN and proxy clients from the Russian App Store. Reports name Streisand, V2Box, v2RayTun, and Happ. Apple removed the VPN clients Streisand, V2Box and v2RayTun, plus the Happ — Proxy Utility app, from the Russian segment of the store, according to a report citing Kod Durova. Because they are delisted, these apps will no longer receive crucial software updates, including security patches, via the App Store.\n- In April 2026, AdGuard's TrustTunnel iOS client was removed. Apple notified AdGuard on April 28, 2026, stating the app \"includes content that is illegal in Russia\" and citing Article 15.1 of the country's law on information technologies. The removal only affects the Russian App Store. The app remains available globally, and Android users in Russia can still download it via Google Play.\n- Later reporting from The Moscow Times describes Apple notices to Red Shield VPN and Le VPN saying their apps would be removed \"per demand from Roskomnadzor.\" The dates on those articles are hard to pin down from the snippets, so treat their timing as unconfirmed.\n\n**Background:** Since December 2025, Roskomnadzor has more actively blocked additional protocols such as SOCKS5, VLESS and L2TP. The 2024 wave was similar. Interfax reported that Apple had removed 25 VPN apps from its Russian App Store after Roskomnadzor demanded the removals.\n\n**Not covered:** None of the results address Apple Developer Program enrollment, developer fees, or payment processing for Russian developers or users. A follow-up search would be needed for that.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."},{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01EwZN715d58X8bFUoecqe8z","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"App Store Review Guidelines 5.4 VPN apps must be offered by developers enrolled as an organization NEVPNManager\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"developer.apple.com\",\"url\":\"https://developer.apple.com/forums/thread/844983\"},{\"title\":\"App rejected under 4.3(a) after mandatory account migration for Guideline 5.4 (VPN Apps)\",\"url\":\"https://developer.apple.com/forums/thread/834624\"},{\"title\":\"Guideline 5.4 — content blocking app using a local on-device tunnel, individual account\",\"url\":\"https://developer.apple.com/forums/thread/844103\"},{\"title\":\"Question on Section 5.4 VPN Apps\",\"url\":\"https://developer.apple.com/forums/thread/119162\"},{\"title\":\"162087 apple ne veut pas que les vpn decrivent ce qu ils font vraiment sur l app store\",\"url\":\"https://www.mac4ever.com/iphone/162087-apple-ne-veut-pas-que-les-vpn-decrivent-ce-qu-ils-font-vraiment-sur-l-app-store\"},{\"title\":\"Supported architecture and organization requirement for an on-device iOS domain blocker\",\"url\":\"https://developer.apple.com/forums/thread/838967\"},{\"title\":\"Provision record\",\"url\":\"https://conductatlas.com/platform/apple/apple-app-store-review-guidelines/provision/CA-P-019100/vpn-apps-must-use-nevpnmanager-api-and-be-organization-enrolled/\"}]\n\nThe search turned up the guideline text and several developer-forum threads, but no official Apple answer on the exact question of whether a VPN client that connects to user-chosen servers needs an organization account.\n\n- **The rule:** Guideline 5.4 limits VPN services built on NEVPNManager to developers enrolled as an organization. Apps offering VPN services must utilize the NEVPNManager API and may only be offered by developers enrolled as an organization. A separate sentence extends NEVPNManager access to some other app types. Parental control, content blocking, and security apps, among others, from approved providers may also use the NEVPNManager API.\n- **Client-only apps are unresolved:** One developer asked whether the organization requirement covers a VPN client that connects only to infrastructure the user selects, with no service run by the developer. Does the organisation-enrolment requirement also apply to an app such as this? The thread shows no official answer.\n- **Content blockers face the same question:** A developer of an on-device content blocker raised a similar point. Reading the text literally, the organization sentence covers only VPN services, but a NEPacketTunnelProvider installs a VPN configuration and puts the VPN badge in the status bar. In that developer's reading, App Review would likely treat such an app as a VPN regardless.\n- **Enforcement example:** One developer who moved a VPN app from a personal account to an organization account reported a later rejection under a different guideline, saying App Review noted the app shares a similar binary, metadata, and/or concept as apps previously submitted by a terminated Apple Developer Program account.\n- **Apple DTS position:** An Apple DTS engineer distinguished what is technically supported from what is allowed on the App Store, and said App Review has the final say about what is or isn't allowed on the App Store.\n\nSource caveat: the guideline wording comes from third-party reproductions (conductatlas.com and mac4ever.com), not directly from Apple's current guidelines page, so check the live text before relying on it. The forum threads are community discussions, not official rulings.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."},{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01982Aqe9AXbWPAgZzr1g5Fq","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"TestFlight external testers limit 10000 build expires 90 days beta app review; Network Extension packet tunnel memory limit iOS\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"medium.com\",\"url\":\"https://medium.com/p/39bc510754f6\"},{\"title\":\"testflight guide\",\"url\":\"https://instabug.com/blog/testflight-guide\"},{\"title\":\"App Store Optimization\",\"url\":\"https://mwm.ai/glossary/testflight\"},{\"title\":\"iOS Development\",\"url\":\"https://techconcepts.org/blog/testflight-guide\"},{\"title\":\"testflight overview\",\"url\":\"https://docs.thunkable.com/publishing-apps/publish-to-app-store-ios/testflight-overview\"},{\"title\":\"Testing on iOS via TestFlight\",\"url\":\"https://docs.thunkable.com/publish-to-app-store-ios/testflight-overview\"},{\"title\":\"testflight beta testing setting effective tests\",\"url\":\"https://www.instabug.com/blog/testflight-beta-testing-setting-effective-tests\"},{\"title\":\"App Store Connect Help\",\"url\":\"https://developer-rno.apple.com/help/app-store-connect/test-a-beta-version/testflight-overview\"},{\"title\":\"us.fitgap.com\",\"url\":\"https://us.fitgap.com/products/testflight\"},{\"title\":\"App Store Connect Help\",\"url\":\"https://www.developer.apple.com/help/app-store-connect/test-a-beta-version/testflight-overview\"},{\"title\":\"6824982 resolving the this beta isn t accepting any new testers right now error\",\"url\":\"https://help.playtestcloud.com/en/articles/6824982-resolving-the-this-beta-isn-t-accepting-any-new-testers-right-now-error\"},{\"title\":\"TestFlight in Depth\",\"url\":\"https://docs.thunkable.com/v/snap-to-place/publish-to-app-store-ios/testflight-overview/testflight-in-depth\"},{\"title\":\"What is TestFlight - Essential for Developers | 2025? Definition & Meaning\",\"url\":\"https://generalistprogrammer.com/glossary/testflight\"},{\"title\":\"Drizz raises $2.7M in seed funding •\",\"url\":\"https://www.drizz.dev/post/testflight-access\"},{\"title\":\"testflight vs google play testing\",\"url\":\"https://newly.app/compare/testflight-vs-google-play-testing\"},{\"title\":\"Articles · App ExamplesUpdated September 2026\",\"url\":\"https://newly.app/guides/ios-testflight\"}]\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"What is the memory limit for a network extension?\",\"url\":\"https://developer.apple.com/forums/thread/73148?page=2\"},{\"title\":\"What is the memory limit for a network extension?\",\"url\":\"https://origin-devforums.apple.com/forums/thread/73148?page=2\"},{\"title\":\"NEPacketTunnelProvider Memory Limits (iOS)\",\"url\":\"https://developer.apple.com/forums/thread/106377\"},{\"title\":\"What is the memory limit for a network extension?\",\"url\":\"https://developer.apple.com/forums/thread/73148\"},{\"title\":\"Remove or raise memory limit for Packet Tunnel Provider extension\",\"url\":\"https://openradar.appspot.com/27660401\"},{\"title\":\"Memory Limit of NEPackTunnelProvider on new iOS system\",\"url\":\"https://developer.apple.com/forums/thread/728876\"},{\"title\":\"Is there a memory limit for macOS System Network Extension?\",\"url\":\"https://developer.apple.com/forums/thread/682778\"},{\"title\":\"PacketTunnelProvider Extension terminated due to memory limit\",\"url\":\"https://developer.apple.com/forums/thread/763586\"},{\"title\":\"origin-devforums.apple.com\",\"url\":\"https://origin-devforums.apple.com/forums/profile/aleksandarklisarski\"},{\"title\":\"Network Extension Provider Memory Strategy\",\"url\":\"https://developer.apple.com/forums/thread/44942\"},{\"title\":\"What is the memory limit for a network extension iOS 17\",\"url\":\"https://developer.apple.com/forums/thread/763392\"},{\"title\":\"Network extension crash with 2048 IPv6 Split tunnel routes\",\"url\":\"https://developer.apple.com/forums/thread/723156\"},{\"title\":\"Network Extension for iOS and MacOS. Is there any difference?\",\"url\":\"https://developer.apple.com/forums/thread/729911\"},{\"title\":\"origin-devforums.apple.com\",\"url\":\"https://origin-devforums.apple.com/forums/profile/Meera Mohideen/questions\"},{\"title\":\"icefire wang\",\"url\":\"https://origin-devforums.apple.com/forums/profile/icefire_wang\"},{\"title\":\"origin-devforums.apple.com\",\"url\":\"https://origin-devforums.apple.com/forums/profile/Cougnes\"},{\"title\":\"Packet Tunnel Provider - Writing SSL3_RT_ALERT 2 bytes\",\"url\":\"https://developer.apple.com/forums/thread/131827\"},{\"title\":\"jailbreak ios memory limit\",\"url\":\"https://stash.wiki/en/faq/jailbreak-ios-memory-limit\"},{\"title\":\"ios app extension s maximum memory budget\",\"url\":\"https://kaweah.freedombox.rocks/kiwix/stackoverflow.com_en_all_2023-11/questions/37361261/ios-app-extension-s-maximum-memory-budget\"}]\n\n**TestFlight (external testers, 10,000 cap, 90-day expiry, beta review)**\n\n- **Tester cap:** Multiple sources give 10,000 external testers per app. One source says the cap was once 1,000 before 2017, so treat that as outdated. Up to 100 internal testers (App Store Connect users) and up to 10,000 external testers per app.\n- **Beta App Review:** Apple's own help page says when you add the first build of your app to a group, the build gets sent to App Review. Third-party guides describe this as a gate for the first build of each version, with later builds usually skipping full review ().\n- **90-day expiry:** Apple's documentation says you can test a build for up to 90 days. The window is fixed, so a new build with a new build number is needed to keep testing going ().\n\n**Network Extension packet tunnel memory limit (iOS)**\n\nI found no official Apple documentation for this limit. The figures come from Apple DTS replies on the developer forums and third-party sources, and they conflict:\n\n- Older iOS versions used a 15 MiB limit. One forum thread reports a 50 MB limit starting around iOS 15, and a Stash wiki page likewise says in iOS 15 and later, the memory limit for Network Extension has been increased to 50 MB.\n- Another forum poster says memory limit for Packet tunnel seems to be back to 15 Mb on iOS 17, which is unconfirmed. A later poster reports iOS 26 still has 50MiB packet tunnel limit.\n- Apple DTS has warned that these limits have changed in the past and may well change in the future. They also advise against content filtering in a packet tunnel provider, saying in our experience it does not end well.\n\n**Bottom line:** Treat 50 MiB as the commonly reported packet tunnel limit for recent iOS, but verify on your target iOS version and device before relying on it. Apple DTS has said these limits can change, so design for a tighter budget.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]}}
{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb","hash":"81ab396f659a55edf9059aba2d9d1b7a5a0aa32b5f6ca54e75193e1f6c589acb","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","signature":""},{"type":"text","text":"Господин Шаген, свой Nexo на iPhone поставить можно, но сейчас я бы этого не делал: это большая работа, а Apple может убрать VPN-приложение из российского App Store. Пока надёжнее оставить на iPhone Karing и OneXray, которые наш бот уже предлагает.\n\n## Какие есть пути\n\n| Путь | Подходит ли для клиентов в России | Что важно |\n|---|---|---|\n| **App Store** | Только частично | Нужен аккаунт организации. Apple [удаляет VPN из российского магазина](https://www.techradar.com/vpn/vpn-privacy-security/apple-removes-custom-vpn-clients-from-russian-app-store-amid-telegram-crackdown) по требованию Роскомнадзора. |\n| **TestFlight** (бета-версии) | Как временный вариант | [До 10 000 человек](https://www.developer.apple.com/help/app-store-connect/test-a-beta-version/testflight-overview), каждая сборка живёт 90 дней. Нужны тот же аккаунт и проверка Apple. |\n| **Другие магазины** (например, AltStore) | Нет | Работают только в [ЕС, Японии и Бразилии](https://heise.de/-11070764). Apple требует, чтобы и аккаунт был из такой страны, и [человек физически там находился](https://support.apple.com/en-kg/117767). |\n| **Установка по списку телефонов** | Только для своих | Обычно не больше 100 устройств: подойдёт для вас и близких, но не для продажи. |\n\n## Что нужно для своего приложения\n1. **Аккаунт разработчика Apple как организация.** Обычно это около 99 долларов в год и номер компании D-U-N-S. [Правила Apple](https://conductatlas.com/platform/apple/apple-app-store-review-guidelines/provision/CA-P-019100/vpn-apps-must-use-nevpnmanager-api-and-be-organization-enrolled/) разрешают VPN-сервисы только организациям. Лучше сразу оформлять организацию: один разработчик после переноса приложения с личного аккаунта [получил отказ при проверке](https://developer.apple.com/forums/thread/834624).\n2. **Способ оплаты и компания, которые примет Apple.** Подойдёт ли российская компания и карта, я не подтвердил: поиск этого не показал. Заранее рассчитывать на это не стоит.\n3. **Версия приложения для iPhone.** Сейчас её нет, поэтому часть, которая держит VPN-соединение, придётся писать заново. Вдобавок у iPhone жёсткий предел памяти для такой части, [по сообщениям разработчиков около 50 МБ](https://developer.apple.com/forums/thread/763392), и наше VPN-ядро может в него не уложиться. Это надо проверять первым делом.\n4. **Описание для проверки Apple.** В нём нельзя писать про обход блокировок, как и в платежах.\n\n## Что будет с клиентами\nДаже если приложение пройдёт проверку, в российском магазине его могут удалить. Так уже случилось со [Streisand, V2Box, v2RayTun и Happ](https://zona.media/news/2026/03/28/app-vpn). После удаления люди с российским аккаунтом Apple не смогут его скачать и не получат обновления. Поэтому на iPhone важно иметь несколько запасных приложений, и свой Nexo этого не заменит.\n\n## Что я предлагаю\n- **Сейчас:** ничего не строить для iPhone. Проверить, доступны ли Karing и OneXray в российском App Store сегодня: в наших записях Karing там есть, но запись могла устареть.\n- **Позже:** сначала закончить Android, Mac и Windows. Для iPhone начать с небольшой пробы: запустится ли наше ядро в пределах памяти. Покупать аккаунт стоит только после этого.\n\nСборка 0.9.3 ещё идёт, напишу, когда закончится.\n\nЕсть ли у вас или у знакомых компания за пределами России? От этого зависит, реально ли вообще получить аккаунт Apple.\n\n**Источники:**\n- [Правило Apple 5.4 о VPN (пересказ)](https://conductatlas.com/platform/apple/apple-app-store-review-guidelines/provision/CA-P-019100/vpn-apps-must-use-nevpnmanager-api-and-be-organization-enrolled/)\n- [Отказ после переноса на аккаунт организации](https://developer.apple.com/forums/thread/834624)\n- [TechRadar: удаление VPN-клиентов из российского App Store](https://www.techradar.com/vpn/vpn-privacy-security/apple-removes-custom-vpn-clients-from-russian-app-store-amid-telegram-crackdown)\n- [Медиазона: какие приложения удалены](https://zona.media/news/2026/03/28/app-vpn)\n- [Heise: страны с другими магазинами](https://heise.de/-11070764)\n- [Apple: условия установки из других магазинов](https://support.apple.com/en-kg/117767)\n- [Apple: TestFlight](https://www.developer.apple.com/help/app-store-connect/test-a-beta-version/testflight-overview)\n- [Форум Apple: предел памяти](https://developer.apple.com/forums/thread/763392)"}]}}
