{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb","hash":"57aa13c007cbd8028cf427522c363bbf3b97d79196cb3e8073dd7c8e1bed1b48","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0161XWiQxawDkPHzFyJpP35a","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"App Store review time 2026 \"90%\" reviewed within 24 hours; VPN app review delay rejection; Apple Developer Program organization enrollment D-U-N-S how long\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"App Review Delay: 3+ Weeks with No Response from Apple\",\"url\":\"https://developer.apple.com/forums/thread/795168\"},{\"title\":\"App Store Review Delays in 2026: Why & How to Get Approved Fast\",\"url\":\"https://appbot.co/blog/app-store-app-review-approval-vibe-coded-delays-2026/\"},{\"title\":\"app store review time\",\"url\":\"https://www.lowcode.agency/blog/app-store-review-time\"},{\"title\":\"Posts Tagged “App Store Rejection”\",\"url\":\"https://mjtsai.com/blog/tag/rejection/\"},{\"title\":\"App Submission\",\"url\":\"https://developer.apple.com/forums/tags/app-submission?page=2\"},{\"title\":\"how long does app review take\",\"url\":\"https://www.choicely.com/tutorials/how-long-does-app-review-take\"},{\"title\":\"App Review\",\"url\":\"https://developer.apple.com/forums/tags/app-review?page=5\"},{\"title\":\"Unusually long “Waiting for Review” times this week (App Store + TestFlight delays?)\",\"url\":\"https://origin-devforums.apple.com/forums/thread/815537?page=2\"},{\"title\":\"Unusually long \\\"waiting for review\\\" time\",\"url\":\"https://origin-devforums.apple.com/forums/thread/699916\"},{\"title\":\"Unusually long “Waiting for Review” times this week (App Store + TestFlight delays?)\",\"url\":\"https://origin-devforums.apple.com/forums/thread/815537?page=3\"},{\"title\":\"ios app review delays march 2026\",\"url\":\"https://www.lowcode.agency/blog/ios-app-review-delays-march-2026?hl=en-IN\"},{\"title\":\"habr.com\",\"url\":\"https://habr.com/post/428728\"},{\"title\":\"App Review\",\"url\":\"https://developer.apple.com/forums/tags/app-review?page=15\"},{\"title\":\"app store review time what you need to know for a smooth app approval process\",\"url\":\"https://bitrise.io/blog/post/app-store-review-time-what-you-need-to-know-for-a-smooth-app-approval-process\"},{\"title\":\"App stuck in “Waiting for Review” since August 22\",\"url\":\"https://developer.apple.com/forums/thread/844051\"},{\"title\":\"Insights about Apple App Store Rules for VPN Apps\",\"url\":\"https://www.ivpn.net/blog/insights-apple-app-store-rules-vpn-apps/\"},{\"title\":\"app store review taking too long\",\"url\":\"https://ptkd.com/journal/app-store-review-taking-too-long\"}]\n\nI ran one search. It did not confirm the \"90% within 24 hours\" figure or give a D-U-N-S enrollment timeline, so those two parts are still open.\n\n**Review times in 2026:** Developer reports describe longer waits than usual. One Apple Developer Forums post describes a first-time VPN app stuck for over three weeks with no reply from Apple (App Review Delay: 3+ Weeks with No Response from Apple). Other forum posts describe \"Waiting for Review\" periods of two weeks or more after a rejection and resubmission. A lowcode.agency article says standard submissions average 24–48 hours, but its own text also says March 2026 delays were widespread. Forum users also note that most developers they asked reported approvals within 2–3 days, so this does not look like a system-wide stall. Anecdotal reports of this kind are not a reliable measure of the average.\n\n**VPN-specific rules:** A 2020 iVPN article notes that Apple's VPN section of the guidelines has existed since 2019, and that the App Store will reject the app/update when a VPN is offered in certain restricted countries. A Russian-language Habr post says VPN apps can only be uploaded from an organization account. A forum thread also describes a VPN app that was rejected for spam after the developer switched from an individual account to a company account. Those sources are old or anecdotal, so check the current App Review Guidelines before relying on them.\n\n**Not found:** I found no source for the \"90% reviewed within 24 hours\" statistic, and no source for how long organization enrollment and D-U-N-S verification take. For those, check Apple's developer enrollment page directly, or ask Apple Developer Support.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]}}
{"type":"api-request-blob","sessionId":"1fd4ae39-09c4-4cf0-9bfe-fc8abaa281eb","hash":"8b9c83b1ebc635955b874a2e9bd6f5dfdf6416822c1744788e16cb414befe61d","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Господин Шаген, обычная проверка в App Store занимает [1–2 дня](https://www.lowcode.agency/blog/app-store-review-time), но для нового VPN лучше закладывать от нескольких недель до пары месяцев. Это моя грубая оценка, официальных сроков для VPN я не нашёл.\n\n## Из чего складывается срок\n| Этап | Сколько времени | Насколько это точно |\n|---|---|---|\n| Номер D-U-N-S для компании | примерно [от 7 до 30 рабочих дней](https://habr.com/en/companies/touchinstinct/articles/342046) | Источник старый, сроки могли измениться |\n| Оформление аккаунта организации | обычно ещё несколько дней или недель | По памяти, подтверждения не нашёл |\n| Первая проверка приложения | обычно 1–2 дня, но у нового VPN бывает [больше трёх недель без ответа](https://developer.apple.com/forums/thread/795168) | Отдельные случаи разработчиков |\n| Отказ и повторная проверка | после отказа очередь [может занять две недели и больше](https://origin-devforums.apple.com/forums/thread/815537?page=3) | Тоже отдельные случаи |\n\nСюда не входят регистрация зарубежной компании и создание версии Nexo для iPhone. Создание версии, скорее всего, займёт больше всего времени.\n\nПроверка тоже не гарантирует результата: Apple может отказать, а одобренное приложение позже убрать из российского магазина.\n\nСборка 0.9.4 ещё идёт, напишу, когда она будет готова."}]}}
